a-premium-soiree-pokemon-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-soiree-pokemon-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-soiree-pokemon-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-soiree-pokemon-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-soiree-pokemon-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-soiree-pokemon-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Collection Ultra-Premium Soir\u00e9e \u2013 dos","alt":"Dos de la bo\u00eete Collection Ultra-Premium Soir\u00e9e 30\u1d49 Anniversaire Pok\u00e9mon avec le contenu"}],"categories":[{"id":2628,"name":"Coffrets Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"coffrets-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/coffrets-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12052,"name":"Coffret","slug":"coffret"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":1,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 1 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Lire la suite","description":"En savoir plus sur &ldquo;Coffret Pok\u00e9mon Ultra-Premium Soir\u00e9e ME05.5 Celebration 30 Ans&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-ultra-premium-soiree-me05-5-celebration-30-ans\/","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/93872","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=93872&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":93869,"name":"Coffret Pok\u00e9mon Ultra-Premium Journ\u00e9e ME05.5 Celebration 30 Ans","slug":"coffret-pokemon-ultra-premium-journee-me05-5-celebration-30-ans","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-ultra-premium-journee-me05-5-celebration-30-ans\/","sku":"196214155336","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Collection Ultra-Premium Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong> est le grand coffret des 30 ans c\u00f4t\u00e9 soleil : promos Pikachu-ex et Mentali-ex, 29 boosters de l&rsquo;extension 30\u1d49 Anniversaire, un booster Collection Classique, tapis de jeu, 65 prot\u00e8ge-cartes, \u00e9tui, pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallique et 6 d\u00e9s.<\/p>\n<p>Mentali porte la lumi\u00e8re, Pikachu porte la f\u00eate.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Collection Ultra-Premium Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon : la f\u00eate des 30 ans en plein jour<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Collection Ultra-Premium Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong> est le plus gros coffret de l&rsquo;anniversaire, dans sa version solaire. Elle tourne autour de Mentali, l&rsquo;\u00e9volution Psy d&rsquo;\u00c9voli traditionnellement associ\u00e9e au jour, et de Pikachu, la mascotte qui souffle ses trente bougies.<\/p>\n<h3>Deux promos brillantes<\/h3>\n<p>Le coffret contient deux cartes promo :<\/p>\n<p><strong>Pikachu-ex<\/strong>, illustr\u00e9 par l&rsquo;artiste japonais YOSHIROTTEN, commune aux deux versions de la collection ;<br \/>\n<strong>Mentali-ex<\/strong>, propre \u00e0 la version Journ\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Ce sont les deux cartes qui donnent son identit\u00e9 au coffret. Pikachu-ex fait le lien avec la version Soir\u00e9e ; Mentali-ex est la raison de choisir celle-ci.<\/p>\n<h3>Une montagne de boosters<\/h3>\n<p>Le c\u0153ur de la bo\u00eete, ce sont 29 boosters de l&rsquo;extension 30\u1d49 Anniversaire, en fran\u00e7ais. L&rsquo;extension d\u00e9passe les 150 cartes, et chaque booster r\u00e9unit 5 cartes brillantes, dont un Pikachu parmi 30 illustrations, et une \u00c9nergie de base brillante. Vingt-neuf paquets, c&rsquo;est vingt-neuf Pikachu : de quoi avancer s\u00e9rieusement dans la collection d&rsquo;un seul coup.<\/p>\n<p>Un trenti\u00e8me booster compl\u00e8te l&rsquo;ensemble : un booster Collection Classique de 3 cartes. Trente boosters pour trente ans, le compte est bon.<\/p>\n<h3>Tout pour jouer aux couleurs de Mentali<\/h3>\n<p>Le coffret ne se limite pas \u00e0 l&rsquo;ouverture. On y trouve aussi :<\/p>\n<p>un tapis de jeu ;<br \/>\n65 prot\u00e8ge-cartes ;<br \/>\nun \u00e9tui pour deck ;<br \/>\nune pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallique \u00e0 l&rsquo;effigie de Mentali ;<br \/>\n6 d\u00e9s ;<br \/>\nune carte \u00e0 code pour le JCC Pok\u00e9mon Live.<\/p>\n<p>De quoi monter un deck avec les cartes tir\u00e9es, le prot\u00e9ger et s&rsquo;installer \u00e0 une table, sans rien acheter \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Le travail de YOSHIROTTEN<\/h3>\n<p>YOSHIROTTEN est un artiste japonais venu des arts visuels et du design graphique. Son Pikachu-ex tranche avec les illustrations habituelles du jeu, par ses couleurs et sa composition. Un Pikachu d&rsquo;anniversaire qui ne ressemble \u00e0 aucun autre, et c&rsquo;est bien le but.<\/p>\n<h3>Journ\u00e9e ou Soir\u00e9e<\/h3>\n<p>Les deux versions partagent la m\u00eame base. La diff\u00e9rence tient \u00e0 la seconde promo, \u00e0 la pi\u00e8ce et aux visuels : Mentali et sa lumi\u00e8re chaude ici, Noctali et ses feux d&rsquo;artifice dans l&rsquo;autre bo\u00eete. Ceux qui h\u00e9sitent peuvent jeter un \u0153il \u00e0 l&rsquo;ensemble des <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/coffrets-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>coffrets Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a> avant de trancher.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour qui<\/h3>\n<p>C&rsquo;est le coffret de ceux qui veulent marquer le coup : collectionneurs qui visent une grande partie de l&rsquo;extension, joueurs qui veulent un kit complet aux couleurs de l&rsquo;anniversaire, ou fans d&rsquo;\u00c9voli qui ont toujours d\u00e9fendu Mentali dans le d\u00e9bat jour contre nuit. Les souvenirs de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/celebrations\/\"><strong>l&rsquo;extension C\u00e9l\u00e9brations<\/strong><\/a>, cinq ans plus t\u00f4t, montrent d&rsquo;ailleurs que ces coffrets anniversaires restent des pi\u00e8ces qu&rsquo;on garde.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Mentali \u00e9volue de jour, quand \u00c9voli est heureux. Ouvrir 29 boosters d&rsquo;un coup produit un effet comparable sur la plupart des dresseurs.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"29000","regular_price":"29000","sale_price":"29000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">290,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93967,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-ultra-premium-journee-pokemon-30-ans-boutique-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\