ations":true,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Pok\u00e9ball","slug":"Pok\u00e9ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Premier Ball","slug":"Premier Ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Great Ball","slug":"Great Ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Ultra Ball","slug":"Ultra Ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Moon Ball","slug":"Moon Ball"}]},{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12055,"name":"Pok\u00e9ball","slug":"pokeball"}]}],"variations":[{"id":92082,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"Pok\u00e9ball"}]},{"id":92083,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"Premier Ball"}]},{"id":92084,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"Great Ball"}]},{"id":92085,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"Ultra Ball"}]},{"id":92086,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"Moon Ball"}]}],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":true,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Choix des options","description":"S\u00e9lectionner les options pour &ldquo;Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon Q4 (EV02, EV04, EV05)&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-ev02-ev04-ev05\/","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/92081","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=91088,89591,89200,90652"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,89714,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=92081&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91946,"name":"Booster Pok\u00e9mon me03 Equilibre Parfait","slug":"booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait\/","sku":"196214137134","short_description":"<p>Un <strong>booster Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> (ME03), c&rsquo;est un paquet scell\u00e9 de l&rsquo;extension fran\u00e7aise du bloc M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution, sortie le 27 mars 2026.<\/p>\n<p>M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex, M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe-ex, M\u00e9ga-Staross-ex ou Miaouss-ex se cachent peut-\u00eatre derri\u00e8re l&#8217;emballage. Un seul moyen de le savoir : l&rsquo;ouvrir, de pr\u00e9f\u00e9rence au-dessus d&rsquo;une table propre.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Booster Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9quilibre Parfait : un paquet, une chance de croiser M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>booster Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> est la fa\u00e7on la plus simple de go\u00fbter \u00e0 l&rsquo;extension ME03 du bloc M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution. Un paquet scell\u00e9, des cartes tir\u00e9es au hasard dans plus de 120 cartes, et ce petit moment de silence avant de retourner la derni\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<h3>Zygarde, le gardien qui compte sur le nombre<\/h3>\n<p>La vedette de l&rsquo;extension s&rsquo;appelle M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex. Le Pok\u00e9mon l\u00e9gendaire veille sur l&rsquo;\u00e9quilibre de la ville, et l&rsquo;extension en fait son embl\u00e8me. Autour de lui, d&rsquo;autres M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volutions se partagent l&rsquo;affiche : M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe-ex et M\u00e9ga-Staross-ex, accompagn\u00e9s d&rsquo;un Miaouss-ex qui n&rsquo;a visiblement pas l&rsquo;intention de laisser la vedette aux l\u00e9gendaires.<\/p>\n<h3>Plus de 120 cartes \u00e0 se partager<\/h3>\n<p>\u00c9quilibre Parfait compte plus de 120 cartes, dont plus de 25 cartes Dresseur et plus de 30 cartes Pok\u00e9mon et Dresseur avec des illustrations sp\u00e9ciales. De quoi nourrir un deck, compl\u00e9ter une page de classeur ou simplement tomber sous le charme d&rsquo;une illustration.<\/p>\n<p>L&rsquo;extension est sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 27 mars 2026 et ses cartes sont jouables en format Standard. Un booster ne garantit aucune carte pr\u00e9cise : c&rsquo;est tout le sel de l&rsquo;ouverture, et parfois toute sa cruaut\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution ex : beaucoup de puissance, un vrai risque<\/h3>\n<p>Les Pok\u00e9mon-ex M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution sont les poids lourds du bloc. Ils frappent fort et encaissent beaucoup, mais quand l&rsquo;un d&rsquo;eux est mis K.O., l&rsquo;adversaire prend trois cartes R\u00e9compense d&rsquo;un coup. Les jouer, c&rsquo;est accepter un pari : tout gagner vite, ou offrir la partie sur un plateau.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est ce qui rend chaque M\u00e9ga tir\u00e9e dans un booster si int\u00e9ressante. Pour un collectionneur, c&rsquo;est une belle carte. Pour un joueur, c&rsquo;est la question de tout un deck : est-ce que je construis autour, ou est-ce que je la garde pour le classeur ?<\/p>\n<h3>Un booster, trois boosters, trente-six boosters<\/h3>\n<p>Le booster \u00e0 l&rsquo;unit\u00e9 convient parfaitement pour d\u00e9couvrir l&rsquo;extension, offrir un petit plaisir ou accompagner un achat en boutique. Pour aller plus loin sans passer directement \u00e0 la bo\u00eete compl\u00e8te, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me3\/\"><strong>tripack \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a> r\u00e9unit trois boosters sous le m\u00eame emballage.<\/p>\n<p>Et si l&rsquo;objectif est de construire autour de M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex ou de compl\u00e9ter le set, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/display-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/\"><strong>display \u00c9quilibre Parfait de 36 boosters<\/strong><\/a> devient vite plus logique que trente-six allers-retours en caisse.<\/p>\n<h3>Prot\u00e9ger la bonne carte avant de crier victoire<\/h3>\n<p>Une M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution ex m\u00e9rite mieux que le fond d&rsquo;une poche. Le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro\/\"><strong>portfolio A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait d&rsquo;Ultra PRO<\/strong><\/a> reprend l&rsquo;univers de l&rsquo;extension et range jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 252 cartes : la suite logique pour celles qui sortent du paquet en bon \u00e9tat.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Zygarde tire sa force du nombre : il rassemble ses cellules pour changer de forme. Sur ce point, les collectionneurs le comprennent tr\u00e8s bien. Eux aussi deviennent plus forts \u00e0 chaque booster ajout\u00e9 \u00e0 la pile.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"690","regular_price":"690","sale_price":"690","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">6,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93646,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/booster-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-francais-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Booster Pok\u00e9mon ME03 \u00c9quilibre Parfait FR","alt":"Booster Pok\u00e9mon M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u00c9quilibre Parfait (ME03) en fran\u00e7ais, 10 cartes"}],"categories":[{"id":2626,"name":"Boosters Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"boosters-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12059,"name":"Booster","slug":"booster"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12082,"name":"\u00c9quilibre Parfait","slug":"equilibre-parfait"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":1,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 1 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Booster Pok\u00e9mon me03 Equilibre Parfait&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91946","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91946","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89021,89034,89007,89005"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91946&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91088,"name":"ETB Pok\u00e9mon Coffret Dresseur Destined Rivals EV10","slug":"etb-pokemon-coffret-dresseur-destined-rivals-ev10","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-pokemon-coffret-dresseur-destined-rivals-ev10\/","sku":"196214159891","short_description":"<p>L&rsquo;<strong>ETB Destined Rivals<\/strong> est le Coffret Dresseur d&rsquo;\u00e9lite anglais de l&rsquo;extension Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es (EV10) : 9 boosters, une carte promo pleine illustration de Qulbutok\u00e9 de la Team Rocket et tout le mat\u00e9riel pour jouer.<\/p>\n<p>La version originale du coffret qui oppose les h\u00e9ros de Kanto et Paldea aux Pok\u00e9mon de Giovanni.<\/p>","description":"<h2>ETB Destined Rivals : la Team Rocket en version originale<\/h2>\n<p>L&rsquo;extension Destined Rivals, Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es en fran\u00e7ais, a ramen\u00e9 la Team Rocket sur le devant de la sc\u00e8ne. Giovanni et ses Pok\u00e9mon y affrontent des Dresseurs bien connus : Cynthia avec Carchacrok-ex, Luth avec Ho-Oh-ex, ou encore Pepper avec Dogrino-ex. L&rsquo;<strong>ETB Destined Rivals<\/strong> est le coffret de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence de cette extension, ici dans sa version anglaise.<\/p>\n<h3>Le contenu du coffret<\/h3>\n<p>Comme tout Elite Trainer Box, ce coffret r\u00e9unit de quoi ouvrir et de quoi jouer. On y trouve 9 boosters Destined Rivals, une carte promo brillante pleine illustration de Qulbutok\u00e9 de la Team Rocket (Team Rocket&rsquo;s Wobbuffet), 65 prot\u00e8ge-cartes aux couleurs de l&rsquo;extension, 45 cartes \u00c9nergie, un guide de l&rsquo;extension, 6 d\u00e9s marqueurs de d\u00e9g\u00e2ts, un d\u00e9 pour pile ou face autoris\u00e9 en comp\u00e9tition, 2 marqueurs d&rsquo;\u00c9tats Sp\u00e9ciaux et une carte \u00e0 code pour Pok\u00e9mon TCG Live. Le tout se range dans la bo\u00eete de collection, avec 4 s\u00e9parateurs.<\/p>\n<h3>Pourquoi la version anglaise ?<\/h3>\n<p>Beaucoup de collectionneurs suivent les extensions dans les deux langues. Les cartes anglaises sont jouables en tournoi comme les fran\u00e7aises, et certains classeurs se construisent exclusivement en anglais. C&rsquo;est aussi un cadeau appr\u00e9ci\u00e9 par les fans qui ont d\u00e9couvert le jeu avec les noms originaux : Team Rocket&rsquo;s Mewtwo ex sonne diff\u00e9remment de Mewtwo-ex de la Team Rocket, mais c&rsquo;est bien la m\u00eame carte.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce qu&rsquo;on peut tirer<\/h3>\n<p>Les Pok\u00e9mon de la Team Rocket sont la grande attraction de l&rsquo;extension, Mewtwo-ex en t\u00eate, accompagn\u00e9 de Pok\u00e9mon comme Nostenfer ou Persian. Face \u00e0 eux, les Pok\u00e9mon de Dresseurs h\u00e9ro\u00efques compl\u00e8tent le tableau. Neuf boosters laissent une vraie chance de tomber sur une pleine illustration ou une carte rare sp\u00e9ciale.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour les joueurs<\/h3>\n<p>Les 45 \u00c9nergies, les d\u00e9s et les marqueurs suffisent pour d\u00e9marrer des parties sans mat\u00e9riel suppl\u00e9mentaire, et les prot\u00e8ge-cartes habillent un deck complet. C&rsquo;est la raison pour laquelle l&rsquo;ETB reste le premier achat conseill\u00e9 quand une extension sort.<\/p>\n<p>L&rsquo;extension est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e en d\u00e9tail sur la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/rivalites-destinees\/\"><strong>Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong><\/a>. Pour la version fran\u00e7aise, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-rivalites-destinees-ev10\/\"><strong>Tripack Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong><\/a> et la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokebox-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-3-modeles\/\"><strong>Pok\u00e9box Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong><\/a> sont aussi en boutique, et toute la gamme anglaise est r\u00e9unie dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-anglais\/\"><strong>cartes Pok\u00e9mon en anglais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Elite Trainer Box Scarlet &amp; Violet Destined Rivals (EV10), version anglaise. Contenu : 9 boosters, 1 carte promo Team Rocket&rsquo;s Wobbuffet, 65 prot\u00e8ge-cartes, 45 cartes \u00c9nergie, 1 guide, 6 d\u00e9s de d\u00e9g\u00e2ts, 1 d\u00e9 pile ou face, 2 marqueurs d&rsquo;\u00c9tats Sp\u00e9ciaux, 1 bo\u00eete avec 4 s\u00e9parateurs, 1 carte \u00e0 code Pok\u00e9mon TCG Live. EAN : 196214159891.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Qulbutok\u00e9 est un Pok\u00e9mon fid\u00e8le de la Team Rocket depuis le dessin anim\u00e9, o\u00f9 il surgit souvent au pire moment. Le voir en promo de cet ETB est un clin d&rsquo;\u0153il que les fans de la s\u00e9rie reconna\u00eetront tout de suite.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"15000","regular_price":"15000","sale_price":"15000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">150,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":92050,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais.webp 2560w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-300x286.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-1024x976.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-768x732.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-1536x1464.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-2048x1952.webp 2048w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-500x477.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-600x572.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-64x61.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/etb-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-ev10-anglais-100x100.webp 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"ETB Pok\u00e9mon Destined Rivals SV10, Elite Trainer Box en anglais","alt":"Elite Trainer Box Pok\u00e9mon Destined Rivals SV10 en anglais (Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es), s\u00e9rie Scarlet & Violet"}],"categories":[{"id":4594,"name":"Cartes Pok\u00e9mon en Anglais","slug":"cartes-pokemon-en-anglais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-anglais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6371,"name":"Anglais","slug":"anglais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12053,"name":"ETB","slug":"etb"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12066,"name":"\u00c9carlate et Violet","slug":"ecarlate-et-violet"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12076,"name":"Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es","slug":"rivalites-destinees"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;ETB Pok\u00e9mon Coffret Dresseur Destined Rivals EV10&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91088","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":5,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91088","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88455"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88455"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91088&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91070,"name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait 252 cartes &#8211; Ultra PRO","slug":"portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro\/","sku":"074427167240","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO affiche M\u00e9ga-Zygarde en couverture et M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe au dos : 14 pages de 9 poches pour 252 cartes en double chargement.<\/p>\n<p>Licence officielle, mat\u00e9riaux sans acide ni PVC.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO met \u00e0 l&rsquo;honneur l&rsquo;extension avec une couverture pleine illustration de M\u00e9ga-Zygarde et M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe au dos. De quoi ranger les cartes de l&rsquo;extension dans un classeur assorti.<\/p>\n<h3>Deux Pok\u00e9mon de l\u00e9gende<\/h3>\n<p>Zygarde est le Pok\u00e9mon l\u00e9gendaire qui veille sur l&rsquo;\u00e9quilibre de l&rsquo;\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me, un nom qui colle parfaitement \u00e0 l&rsquo;extension. M\u00e9lodelfe, la f\u00e9e de la Lune, apporte au dos du classeur une touche plus douce.<\/p>\n<h3>252 cartes au format A4 classique<\/h3>\n<p>Quatorze pages de 9 poches : 126 cartes en simple chargement, 252 en double (une carte de chaque c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la poche). Les pages sont fabriqu\u00e9es dans des mat\u00e9riaux de qualit\u00e9 archive, sans acide et sans PVC. Produit sous licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon, fabriqu\u00e9 en Californie par Ultra PRO.<\/p>\n<p>Le m\u00eame mod\u00e8le existe pour d&rsquo;autres extensions, comme le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes\/\"><strong>portfolio A4 Chaos Ascendants<\/strong><\/a>. Pour prot\u00e9ger vos meilleures cartes, voyez les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/toploader-x25-pokemon-phoenix-shield\/\"><strong>toploaders Phoenix Shield<\/strong><\/a>. Toute la gamme est dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/\"><strong>accessoires cartes<\/strong><\/a>, et les cartes dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/\"><strong>cartes Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Marque : Ultra PRO (licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon)<br \/>Format : A4, 9 poches par page<br \/>Pages : 14<br \/>Capacit\u00e9 : 126 cartes en simple chargement, 252 en double<br \/>Couverture : M\u00e9ga-Zygarde (avant), M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe (dos)<br \/>Mat\u00e9riaux : qualit\u00e9 archive, sans acide, sans PVC<br \/>EAN : 0074427167240<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Zygarde prot\u00e8ge l&rsquo;\u00e9quilibre de la nature. Sur votre bureau, il se contentera de prot\u00e9ger l&rsquo;\u00e9quilibre de votre collection. C&rsquo;est d\u00e9j\u00e0 beaucoup.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1490","regular_price":"1490","sale_price":"1490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">14,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93253,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-equilibre-parfait-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait 252 cartes Ultra PRO","alt":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Ultra PRO \u00c9quilibre Parfait, M\u00e9ga-Zygarde, 252 cartes, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":2623,"name":"Portfolios","slug":"portfolios","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/portfolios\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 \u00c9quilibre Parfait 252 cartes &#8211; Ultra PRO&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91070","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":11,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91070","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89419"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=91069,91071,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91070&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91068,"name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Dracaufeu Y, Dracaufeu X 180 Cartes","slug":"portfolio-pokemon-a4-dracaufeu-y-dracaufeu-x-180-cartes","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-dracaufeu-y-dracaufeu-x-180-cartes\/","sku":"074427167356","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et Y<\/strong> r\u00e9unit les deux M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volutions de Dracaufeu sur une couverture pleine illustration.<\/p>\n<p>Plus fin qu&rsquo;un classeur de 252 cartes, ce mod\u00e8le Ultra PRO compte 10 pages de 9 pochettes, soit 180 places pour une collection Dracaufeu bien tri\u00e9e.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et Y : deux flammes, 180 places<\/h2>\n<p>Dracaufeu a deux M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volutions, et ce classeur n&rsquo;en oublie aucune. Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et Y<\/strong>, sign\u00e9 Ultra PRO, pr\u00e9sente M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu Y sur une couverture pleine illustration. Derri\u00e8re, 180 places attendent vos cartes.<\/p>\n<h3>10 pages de 9 pochettes<\/h3>\n<p>Il compte 10 pages de 9 pochettes. Rang\u00e9es par deux, dos contre dos, les cartes au format standard y trouvent 180 places. C&rsquo;est moins qu&rsquo;un classeur de 252 cartes, et c&rsquo;est justement l&rsquo;int\u00e9r\u00eat : il reste fin et l\u00e9ger, id\u00e9al pour une collection cibl\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Avec une seule carte par pochette, il offre 90 places : de quoi consacrer dix pages enti\u00e8res \u00e0 vos plus belles cartes, sans avoir \u00e0 les empiler.<\/p>\n<h3>Une collection Dracaufeu toute trouv\u00e9e<\/h3>\n<p>Dracaufeu est l&rsquo;un des Pok\u00e9mon les plus imprim\u00e9s du jeu de cartes : cartes classiques, illustrations sp\u00e9ciales, versions ex, promos. Avec 9 cartes par face, une page permet de comparer plusieurs g\u00e9n\u00e9rations de Dracaufeu d&rsquo;un seul coup d&rsquo;\u0153il.<\/p>\n<p>Une id\u00e9e de classement : une page par \u00e9poque du jeu, des premi\u00e8res cartes jusqu&rsquo;aux plus r\u00e9centes. Feuilleter le classeur revient alors \u00e0 parcourir l&rsquo;histoire du Pok\u00e9mon en cartes.<\/p>\n<p>Pas d&rsquo;acide, pas de PVC : les cartes qu&rsquo;on ne veut pas voir vieillir sont entre de bonnes mains.<\/p>\n<h3>A4 ou A5 : lequel choisir ?<\/h3>\n<p>Ce format A4 sert de classeur de collection : il reste \u00e0 la maison et accueille la s\u00e9rie compl\u00e8te. Le format A5 du m\u00eame visuel, plus petit, emporte une s\u00e9lection et range en plus 4 cartes Jumbo. Rien n&#8217;emp\u00eache de prendre les deux : le visuel est le m\u00eame, seul l&rsquo;usage change.<\/p>\n<h3>Le duo existe aussi en petit et en tapis<\/h3>\n<p>Pour emporter une s\u00e9lection ou ranger des cartes Jumbo, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-dracaufeu-y-dracaufeu-x-80-cartes-et-4-jumbo\/\"><strong>portfolio A5 M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et Y<\/strong><\/a> reprend le m\u00eame visuel. Pour jouer, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tapis-de-jeu-pokemon-mega-dracaufeu\/\"><strong>tapis de jeu M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu<\/strong><\/a> compl\u00e8te l&rsquo;ensemble.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Un conseil tout de m\u00eame : gardez une page vide en fin de classeur. Avec Dracaufeu, une nouvelle version finit toujours par arriver.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1490","regular_price":"1490","sale_price":"1490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">14,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93251,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-dracaufeu-x-y-180-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et Y 180 cartes Ultra PRO","alt":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Ultra PRO M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et Y, 180 cartes, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":2623,"name":"Portfolios","slug":"portfolios","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/portfolios\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12049,"name":"Portfolio \/ Classeur","slug":"portfolio-classeur"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Dracaufeu Y, Dracaufeu X 180 Cartes&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91068","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91068","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89714,89419,91130,89414"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91068&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91074,"name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Nuit Noire 80 Cartes et 4 Jumbo","slug":"portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-et-4-jumbo","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-et-4-jumbo\/","sku":"074427169213","short_description":"<p>M\u00e9ga-Zeraora en couverture, M\u00e9ga-Minotaupe au dos : le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Nuit Noire<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO est taill\u00e9 pour une s\u00e9lection courte et soign\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Quatre cartes par face, 80 places en rangeant les cartes dos \u00e0 dos, et deux grandes pochettes r\u00e9serv\u00e9es \u00e0 4 cartes Jumbo.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Nuit Noire : M\u00e9ga-Zeraora devant, M\u00e9ga-Minotaupe derri\u00e8re<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Nuit Noire<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO mise sur deux M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volutions qui n&rsquo;ont rien en commun. M\u00e9ga-Zeraora occupe la couverture avec son \u00e9lectricit\u00e9. M\u00e9ga-Minotaupe s&rsquo;occupe du dos, les griffes en avant. Entre les deux, il y a de la place pour 80 cartes et 4 Jumbo.<\/p>\n<h3>Deux Pok\u00e9mon, deux temp\u00e9raments<\/h3>\n<p>Zeraora est un Pok\u00e9mon fabuleux de type \u00c9lectrique, rapide et nerveux. Minotaupe, de type Sol et Acier, pr\u00e9f\u00e8re creuser. Sous leur forme M\u00e9ga, les deux changent d&rsquo;allure, et Ultra PRO les a plac\u00e9s chacun sur une face du classeur.<\/p>\n<p>Leurs types s&rsquo;opposent d&rsquo;ailleurs directement : le Sol ne craint pas l&rsquo;\u00c9lectrique. Sur ce classeur, Minotaupe a donc eu le bon r\u00e9flexe en prenant le dos.<\/p>\n<h3>Un petit format pens\u00e9 pour une s\u00e9lection<\/h3>\n<p>Le classeur contient 10 pages de 4 pochettes. On y range 40 cartes \u00e0 raison d&rsquo;une par pochette, ou 80 en pla\u00e7ant deux cartes dos \u00e0 dos. Avec quatre cartes par face, chaque carte se voit bien, sans se perdre dans une page charg\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est le bon format pour les cartes M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution d&rsquo;une extension, vos illustrations pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es ou les cartes qu&rsquo;on emporte pour les montrer. Le rangement dos \u00e0 dos se fait avec des cartes nues ; une carte en sleeve occupe une pochette \u00e0 elle seule.<\/p>\n<h3>Deux pochettes pour les cartes Jumbo<\/h3>\n<p>Les cartes g\u00e9antes des coffrets finissent souvent pli\u00e9es au fond d&rsquo;un tiroir. Ici, deux pochettes grand format re\u00e7oivent jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 4 cartes Jumbo, juste \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 des cartes au format normal.<\/p>\n<p>Le plastique des pages ne contient ni acide ni PVC : vos cartes peuvent y rester des ann\u00e9es.<\/p>\n<h3>Le m\u00eame visuel en grand format<\/h3>\n<p>Le format A5 ne suffit plus ? La gamme existe aussi en <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes\/\"><strong>portfolio A4 Nuit Noire 252 cartes<\/strong><\/a>, avec 9 pochettes par page et M\u00e9ga-Darkrai en couverture. Les deux classeurs se compl\u00e8tent bien : le grand reste \u00e0 la maison pour la collection, le petit part en \u00e9change.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Zeraora file \u00e0 toute vitesse, Minotaupe creuse sous terre. Si l&rsquo;un des deux d\u00e9cidait un jour de quitter le classeur, on sait d\u00e9j\u00e0 lequel passerait par le dessous.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1090","regular_price":"1490","sale_price":"1090","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"sale-price\"><del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">14,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Le prix initial \u00e9tait\u00a0: 14,90&#067;&#072;&#070;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">10,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Le prix actuel est\u00a0: 10,90&#067;&#072;&#070;.<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93255,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Nuit Noire 80 cartes Ultra PRO","alt":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Ultra PRO Nuit Noire, 80 cartes, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":2623,"name":"Portfolios","slug":"portfolios","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/portfolios\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12049,"name":"Portfolio \/ Classeur","slug":"portfolio-classeur"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A5 Nuit Noire 80 Cartes et 4 Jumbo&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91074","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":8,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91074","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88977,89465,78164,89578"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89714,89419,91068,91130"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91074&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91071,"name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Nuit Noire 252 Cartes","slug":"portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes\/","sku":"074427169220","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Nuit Noire<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO confie sa couverture \u00e0 M\u00e9ga-Darkrai et son dos \u00e0 M\u00e9ga-Lugulabre : ambiance T\u00e9n\u00e8bres et Spectre assur\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Ses 14 pages de 9 pochettes offrent 252 places en glissant deux cartes par pochette, de quoi suivre une extension num\u00e9ro par num\u00e9ro.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Nuit Noire : M\u00e9ga-Darkrai garde l&rsquo;entr\u00e9e<\/h2>\n<p>Un classeur dont la couverture est confi\u00e9e \u00e0 M\u00e9ga-Darkrai ne promet pas des nuits tranquilles. Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Nuit Noire<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO assume l&rsquo;ambiance : M\u00e9ga-Darkrai devant, M\u00e9ga-Lugulabre et ses flammes spectrales derri\u00e8re. Au milieu, il y a 252 places pour vos cartes.<\/p>\n<h3>Un duo T\u00e9n\u00e8bres et Spectre<\/h3>\n<p>Darkrai est le Pok\u00e9mon fabuleux des cauchemars, connu pour plonger ceux qui l&rsquo;approchent dans un sommeil agit\u00e9. Lugulabre, lui, est un lustre hant\u00e9 de type Spectre et Feu, dont les flammes sont r\u00e9put\u00e9es absorber l&rsquo;\u00e2me. Difficile de trouver deux Pok\u00e9mon plus \u00e0 leur place sur un classeur baptis\u00e9 Nuit Noire.<\/p>\n<h3>14 pages de 9 pochettes<\/h3>\n<p>Le format A4 classique affiche 9 cartes par face. Une carte par pochette donne 126 places ; en les glissant par paires, dos contre dos, on monte \u00e0 252. C&rsquo;est assez pour suivre une extension dans l&rsquo;ordre de ses num\u00e9ros, ou pour construire des pages par Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Avec ce duo en couverture, une page consacr\u00e9e aux types T\u00e9n\u00e8bres et Spectre se construit presque toute seule.<\/p>\n<h3>Les M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution ex m\u00e9ritent une page \u00e0 part<\/h3>\n<p>Dans le jeu de cartes, les Pok\u00e9mon M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution ex frappent fort, mais rapportent trois cartes R\u00e9compense \u00e0 l&rsquo;adversaire s&rsquo;ils sont mis K.O. Ce sont souvent les cartes les plus spectaculaires d&rsquo;une extension. Leur r\u00e9server les premi\u00e8res pages du classeur permet de les retrouver d&rsquo;un coup d&rsquo;\u0153il. On peut aussi placer chacune face \u00e0 la carte de base du m\u00eame Pok\u00e9mon, pour comparer les deux illustrations.<\/p>\n<h3>Des mat\u00e9riaux faits pour durer<\/h3>\n<p>Aucun acide ni PVC dans les pages : le film reste neutre au contact des cartes, m\u00eame apr\u00e8s des ann\u00e9es d&rsquo;\u00e9tag\u00e8re. Les pochettes sont faites pour des cartes au format standard.<\/p>\n<h3>Le petit fr\u00e8re A5<\/h3>\n<p>Pour une s\u00e9lection plus courte ou pour ranger vos cartes Jumbo, le m\u00eame univers existe en <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a5-nuit-noire-80-cartes-et-4-jumbo\/\"><strong>portfolio A5 Nuit Noire 80 cartes et 4 Jumbo<\/strong><\/a>, avec M\u00e9ga-Zeraora et M\u00e9ga-Minotaupe.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Darkrai est connu pour provoquer des cauchemars. Dans ce classeur, le seul cauchemar possible est une case vide au milieu d&rsquo;une page presque compl\u00e8te.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1490","regular_price":"1990","sale_price":"1490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"sale-price\"><del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">19,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Le prix initial \u00e9tait\u00a0: 19,90&#067;&#072;&#070;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">14,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Le prix actuel est\u00a0: 14,90&#067;&#072;&#070;.<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93254,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-nuit-noire-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Nuit Noire 252 cartes Ultra PRO","alt":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Ultra PRO Nuit Noire, 252 cartes, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":2623,"name":"Portfolios","slug":"portfolios","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/portfolios\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12049,"name":"Portfolio \/ Classeur","slug":"portfolio-classeur"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Nuit Noire 252 Cartes&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91071","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":11,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91071","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89714,89419,91068,91130"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91071&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":91069,"name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Chaos Ascendants 252 Cartes","slug":"portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes\/","sku":"074427167264","short_description":"<p>Eau contre feu d\u00e8s la couverture : le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Chaos Ascendants<\/strong> oppose M\u00e9ga-Amphinobi, devant, \u00e0 M\u00e9ga-N\u00e9m\u00e9lios, au dos.<\/p>\n<p>\u00c0 l&rsquo;int\u00e9rieur, ce classeur Ultra PRO aligne 9 cartes par face et range jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 252 cartes, plac\u00e9es dos \u00e0 dos dans des pochettes sans acide ni PVC.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Chaos Ascendants : M\u00e9ga-Amphinobi contre M\u00e9ga-N\u00e9m\u00e9lios<\/h2>\n<p>D&rsquo;un c\u00f4t\u00e9 un ninja d&rsquo;eau, de l&rsquo;autre un lion de feu. Le <strong>portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Chaos Ascendants<\/strong> d&rsquo;Ultra PRO place M\u00e9ga-Amphinobi en couverture et M\u00e9ga-N\u00e9m\u00e9lios au dos. L&rsquo;opposition eau contre feu est pos\u00e9e avant m\u00eame la premi\u00e8re page.<\/p>\n<h3>Deux Pok\u00e9mon venus de Kalos<\/h3>\n<p>Amphinobi, de type Eau et T\u00e9n\u00e8bres, est l&rsquo;\u00e9volution finale de Grenousse, le starter Eau de la sixi\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration. N\u00e9m\u00e9lios, de type Feu et Normal, r\u00e8gne sur sa troupe avec sa crini\u00e8re enflamm\u00e9e. Tous deux viennent de la r\u00e9gion de Kalos, et leurs formes M\u00e9ga leur donnent une allure encore plus combative.<\/p>\n<h3>252 cartes au format A4 classique<\/h3>\n<p>Quatorze pages, 9 pochettes chacune : 126 cartes si vous en mettez une par pochette, 252 si vous les rangez par deux, dos \u00e0 dos. Neuf cartes par face, c&rsquo;est le format le plus lisible pour suivre une extension par num\u00e9ro ou regrouper un Pok\u00e9mon et ses \u00e9volutions.<\/p>\n<p>Une page Grenousse, Cro\u00e2poral et Amphinobi, par exemple, trouve naturellement sa place derri\u00e8re la couverture.<\/p>\n<h3>Ranger une extension, ou tout le bloc<\/h3>\n<p>Pour une collection compl\u00e8te du bloc M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution, un classeur par extension garde chaque s\u00e9rie lisible, et la couverture indique tout de suite laquelle vous tenez en main.<\/p>\n<p>Deux cartes par pochette, c&rsquo;est pratique pour les communes et les doublons. Vos cartes rares, elles, gagnent \u00e0 passer d&rsquo;abord dans une sleeve : elles prennent alors une pochette chacune, et le classeur revient \u00e0 126 places.<\/p>\n<h3>Sans acide, sans PVC<\/h3>\n<p>Ultra PRO utilise des mat\u00e9riaux sans acide et sans PVC. Les cartes ne jaunissent pas et ne collent pas aux pages avec le temps.<\/p>\n<h3>Les autres classeurs M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution<\/h3>\n<p>Le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-mega-evolution-252-cartes\/\"><strong>portfolio A4 M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution<\/strong><\/a> et le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-heros-transcendants-252-cartes\/\"><strong>portfolio A4 H\u00e9ros Transcendants<\/strong><\/a> ont le m\u00eame format et la m\u00eame capacit\u00e9, avec d&rsquo;autres M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volutions en couverture. Align\u00e9s sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re, ils forment une vraie biblioth\u00e8que de l&rsquo;\u00e8re M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution, extension par extension.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Amphinobi devant, N\u00e9m\u00e9lios derri\u00e8re : sur le papier, l&rsquo;eau a l&rsquo;avantage. Mais tant que le classeur reste ferm\u00e9, personne ne peut prouver qui a gagn\u00e9.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1490","regular_price":"1490","sale_price":"1490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">14,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93252,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/portfolio-pokemon-a4-chaos-ascendants-252-cartes-ultra-pro-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Chaos Ascendants 252 cartes Ultra PRO","alt":"Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Ultra PRO Chaos Ascendants, 252 cartes, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":2623,"name":"Portfolios","slug":"portfolios","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/portfolios\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12049,"name":"Portfolio \/ Classeur","slug":"portfolio-classeur"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Portfolio Pok\u00e9mon A4 Chaos Ascendants 252 Cartes&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=91069","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":12,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/91069","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89714,89419,91068,91130"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=91069&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":90954,"name":"Lot 50 Board Game Sleeves Pok\u00e9mon Gamegenic","slug":"lot-50-board-game-sleeves-pokemon-gamegenic","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/lot-50-board-game-sleeves-pokemon-gamegenic\/","sku":"4251715419816","short_description":"<p>Les <strong>Sleeves Gamegenic 50<\/strong> sont des pochettes transparentes de 66 \u00d7 92 mm pour cartes standard jusqu\u2019\u00e0 64 \u00d7 90 mm. Un format simple pour prot\u00e9ger les cartes pendant le jeu, le tri ou le rangement.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Sleeves Gamegenic 50 : simplement prot\u00e9ger les cartes<\/h2>\n<p>Les <strong>Sleeves Gamegenic 50<\/strong> vont droit au but : <strong>50 pochettes transparentes de 66 \u00d7 92 mm<\/strong>, pr\u00e9vues pour des cartes allant jusqu\u2019\u00e0 environ 64 \u00d7 90 mm.<\/p>\n<p>Pas d\u2019illustration, pas de personnage, pas de d\u00e9bat sur la meilleure couleur.<\/p>\n<p>Juste une carte et une protection transparente.<\/p>\n<p>Parfois, c\u2019est reposant.<\/p>\n<h2>Le format standard pour beaucoup de jeux<\/h2>\n<p>Ces sleeves conviennent \u00e0 de nombreuses cartes standard, y compris Pok\u00e9mon et plusieurs autres TCG ou jeux de cartes.<\/p>\n<p>Elles servent de protection contre les traces, les frottements et l\u2019usure normale li\u00e9e aux manipulations.<\/p>\n<h2>50 sleeves : le paquet qui dispara\u00eet au moment du tri<\/h2>\n<p>On commence avec une petite pile de cartes \u00e0 prot\u00e9ger.<\/p>\n<p>Puis on en ajoute quelques-unes.<\/p>\n<p>Puis on d\u00e9cide finalement de sleeever toute la s\u00e9rie pour que le rangement soit uniforme.<\/p>\n<p>Il reste trois sleeves.<\/p>\n<p>C\u2019est g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement l\u00e0 qu\u2019on retrouve quatre cartes oubli\u00e9es sur le bureau.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marque :<\/strong> Gamegenic<\/li>\n<li><strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Just Sleeves<\/li>\n<li><strong>Quantit\u00e9 :<\/strong> 50 sleeves<\/li>\n<li><strong>Dimensions :<\/strong> 66 \u00d7 92 mm<\/li>\n<li><strong>Cartes compatibles :<\/strong> jusqu\u2019\u00e0 64 \u00d7 90 mm<\/li>\n<li><strong>Couleur :<\/strong> transparente<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 4251715419816<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#x25b6;\u00a0 Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>Les Just Sleeves portent assez bien leur nom. Elles n\u2019essaient pas de devenir la vedette de la collection. Elles se contentent de faire en sorte que la vedette reste la carte. Et c\u2019est probablement exactement ce qu\u2019on leur demande.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"490","regular_price":"490","sale_price":"490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">4,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[],"categories":[{"id":2624,"name":"Sleeves","slug":"sleeves","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/sleeves\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6498,"name":"Gamegenic","slug":"gamegenic","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/gamegenic\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Lot 50 Board Game Sleeves Pok\u00e9mon Gamegenic&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=90954","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":44,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/90954","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=90954&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":90931,"name":"Protection Crystal Box Souple Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 Boosters","slug":"protection-crystal-box-souple-display-pokemon-36-boosters","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-pokemon-36-boosters\/","sku":"5412128410985","short_description":"<p>Protection <strong>Crystal Box souple pour Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 boosters<\/strong>, id\u00e9ale pour pr\u00e9server la bo\u00eete des frottements, de la poussi\u00e8re et des petites marques de manipulation.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Vendue \u00e0 l\u2019unit\u00e9.<\/strong><\/p>","description":"<h2>Protection Crystal Box souple pour Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 boosters<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Protection Crystal Box Souple Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 Boosters<\/strong> prot\u00e8ge un display scell\u00e9 pendant le rangement, la manipulation ou l\u2019exposition. Elle ajoute une enveloppe l\u00e9g\u00e8re autour de la bo\u00eete tout en conservant son visuel parfaitement visible.<\/p>\n<p>Pour un collectionneur de produits scell\u00e9s, l\u2019ext\u00e9rieur du display compte aussi. Les coins, le carton et le film peuvent rapidement marquer au contact d\u2019autres bo\u00eetes. Ainsi, une protection adapt\u00e9e \u00e9vite une bonne partie de ces petits d\u00e9g\u00e2ts du quotidien.<\/p>\n<h3>Prot\u00e9ger un Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 boosters sans masquer son artwork<\/h3>\n<p>Cette Crystal Box correspond au format des <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/displays-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>Displays Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais de 36 boosters<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Elle limite les frottements directs contre les \u00e9tag\u00e8res ou les autres produits. De plus, sa transparence permet de profiter pleinement de l\u2019illustration de l\u2019extension sans sortir le display de sa protection.<\/p>\n<p>C\u2019est particuli\u00e8rement pratique pour un produit que l\u2019on souhaite garder scell\u00e9. Apr\u00e8s tout, prot\u00e9ger un beau display pour ensuite le cacher compl\u00e8tement serait l\u00e9g\u00e8rement contre-productif.<\/p>\n<h3>Crystal Box souple ou protection acrylique ?<\/h3>\n<p>Les deux solutions r\u00e9pondent \u00e0 des besoins diff\u00e9rents. La Crystal Box souple reste l\u00e9g\u00e8re, discr\u00e8te et peu encombrante. Elle convient donc tr\u00e8s bien au rangement courant et \u00e0 l\u2019exposition.<\/p>\n<p>Une protection rigide apporte davantage de structure autour du produit. En revanche, elle occupe aussi plus de place. Pour cette solution, retrouvez les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/protections-acrylique-tcg\/\"><strong>protections acryliques TCG<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Le choix d\u00e9pend surtout de votre mani\u00e8re de conserver le display. Une Crystal Box souple prot\u00e8ge efficacement des contacts l\u00e9gers. Une bo\u00eete rigide conviendra davantage \u00e0 ceux qui recherchent une coque plus solide.<\/p>\n<h3>Une protection utile pour les collectionneurs de Pok\u00e9mon scell\u00e9<\/h3>\n<p>Un display ferm\u00e9 ne se r\u00e9sume pas \u00e0 ses 36 boosters. Son artwork, son film et l\u2019\u00e9tat g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de sa bo\u00eete participent aussi au plaisir de la collection.<\/p>\n<p>Ensuite, les manipulations r\u00e9p\u00e9t\u00e9es finissent souvent par laisser des traces. Une protection limite ces contacts et aide \u00e0 conserver un display propre plus longtemps.<\/p>\n<p>Pour les coffrets d\u2019un autre format, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-pokemon-4-boosters\/\"><strong>Protection Crystal Box Souple pour Coffret Pok\u00e9mon 4 Boosters<\/strong><\/a> reprend le m\u00eame principe avec une taille adapt\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Enfin, la Crystal Box poss\u00e8de une limite importante : elle prot\u00e8ge le display, pas votre volont\u00e9. Le fameux \u00ab j\u2019ouvre juste un booster \u00bb reste donc enti\u00e8rement sous votre responsabilit\u00e9.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Une solution simple pour garder un Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 boosters propre et bien prot\u00e9g\u00e9. Pour r\u00e9sister aux 36 boosters qui vous regardent \u00e0 travers la bo\u00eete, aucune technologie fiable n\u2019existe encore.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<p><strong>Produit :<\/strong> Protection Crystal Box souple<br \/>\n<strong>Compatibilit\u00e9 :<\/strong> Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 boosters<br \/>\n<strong>Type :<\/strong> Protection souple transparente<br \/>\n<strong>Conditionnement :<\/strong> \u00c0 l\u2019unit\u00e9<br \/>\n<strong>EAN :<\/strong> 5412128410985<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"500","regular_price":"500","sale_price":"500","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">5,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93265,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crysta