protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/protection-crystal-box-souple-display-36-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Protection Crystal Box souple display Pok\u00e9mon 36 boosters Phoenix Shield","alt":"Protection Crystal Box souple Phoenix Shield pour display Pok\u00e9mon de 36 boosters, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":4294,"name":"Protections acryliques TCG","slug":"protections-acrylique-tcg","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/protections-acrylique-tcg\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6503,"name":"Phoenix Shield","slug":"phoenix-shield","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/phoenix-shield\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12054,"name":"Protection","slug":"protection"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Protection Crystal Box Souple Display Pok\u00e9mon 36 Boosters&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=90931","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":146,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/90931","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88977,89465,78164,89578"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88455,89428,89423,88454"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=90931&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":90652,"name":"Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon Reprint 2024 Anglais (EV07, EV09, ME1)","slug":"pokeball-pokemon-reprint-2024-anglais-ev07-ev09-me1","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokeball-pokemon-reprint-2024-anglais-ev07-ev09-me1\/","sku":"196214145870","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon en anglais<\/strong> contient 3 boosters anglais du JCC Pok\u00e9mon (Stellar Crown, Journey Together et Mega Evolution) dans une bo\u00eete en m\u00e9tal en forme de Pok\u00e9 Ball.<\/p>\n<p>Pour ceux qui collectionnent en version originale, ou qui veulent simplement une Pok\u00e9 Ball de plus sur l&rsquo;\u00e9tag\u00e8re.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon en anglais : la Pok\u00e9 Ball Tin version originale<\/h2>\n<p>Certains collectionneurs ne jurent que par la version anglaise des cartes, pour la langue d&rsquo;origine du jeu en Occident ou pour compl\u00e9ter un classeur d\u00e9j\u00e0 bien rempli. La <strong>Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon en anglais<\/strong>, ou Pok\u00e9 Ball Tin, glisse trois boosters anglais dans une bo\u00eete en m\u00e9tal en forme de Pok\u00e9 Ball.<\/p>\n<h3>Trois boosters, trois \u00e9poques r\u00e9centes<\/h3>\n<p>Les boosters viennent de Stellar Crown (EV07, Couronne Stellaire en fran\u00e7ais), Journey Together (EV09, Aventures Ensemble) et Mega Evolution (ME1, M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution). Deux extensions de la fin de l&rsquo;\u00e8re \u00c9carlate et Violet et la premi\u00e8re du bloc M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution : de quoi voir passer Terapagos, les Pok\u00e9mon de Dresseurs et le retour des M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volutions en une seule ouverture.<\/p>\n<h3>Pourquoi des cartes en anglais ?<\/h3>\n<p>Les cartes anglaises sont jouables en tournoi au m\u00eame titre que les fran\u00e7aises, et beaucoup de joueurs aiment m\u00e9langer les langues dans leurs classeurs. Elles permettent aussi de comparer les traductions des noms : Stellar Crown pour Couronne Stellaire, Journey Together pour Aventures Ensemble. Un petit plaisir de collectionneur.<\/p>\n<h3>La bo\u00eete<\/h3>\n<p>Comme toutes les Pok\u00e9 Ball Tins, la bo\u00eete est en m\u00e9tal et s&rsquo;ouvre en deux, comme dans les jeux. Elle garde ensuite des cartes, des d\u00e9s ou un petit deck, et cinq mod\u00e8les diff\u00e9rents se choisissent directement sur la fiche.<\/p>\n<h3>Avant d&rsquo;ouvrir<\/h3>\n<p>Les trois extensions incluses n&rsquo;ont pas la m\u00eame ambiance : Couronne Stellaire mise sur Terapagos et le T\u00e9racristal Stellaire, Aventures Ensemble sur les duos Dresseur et Pok\u00e9mon, et M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution sur le retour des M\u00e9ga-Pok\u00e9mon. Pour en savoir plus avant d&rsquo;ouvrir, la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/mega-evolution\/\"><strong>M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution<\/strong><\/a> d\u00e9taille la derni\u00e8re, et <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/aventures-ensemble\/\"><strong>Aventures Ensemble<\/strong><\/a> la seconde.<\/p>\n<p>La m\u00eame bo\u00eete existe en fran\u00e7ais avec d&rsquo;autres boosters : la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-ev02-ev04-ev05\/\"><strong>Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Pok\u00e9 Ball Tin, version anglaise. Contenu : 3 boosters du JCC Pok\u00e9mon en anglais (EV07 Stellar Crown, EV09 Journey Together, ME1 Mega Evolution). Bo\u00eete en m\u00e9tal, cinq mod\u00e8les au choix. EAN : 196214145870.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>En anglais, on dit \u00ab Gotta catch &#8217;em all \u00bb. En fran\u00e7ais, \u00ab Attrapez-les tous \u00bb. Dans les deux cas, cette Pok\u00e9 Ball rend la mission un peu plus facile.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2490","regular_price":"2490","sale_price":"2490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">24,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":89876,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-honor-ball.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-honor-ball-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-honor-ball.webp 1000w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-honor-ball-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-honor-ball-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-honor-ball-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancom