-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12057,"name":"Pok\u00e9box","slug":"pokebox"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12079,"name":"Chaos Ascendant","slug":"chaos-ascendant"},{"id":12080,"name":"Nuit Noire","slug":"nuit-noire"}]}],"variations":[{"id":90443,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"M\u00e9ga-Darkrai Ex"}]},{"id":90444,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"M\u00e9ga-Zeraora Ex"}]}],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":true,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Choix des options","description":"S\u00e9lectionner les options pour &ldquo;Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon M\u00e9ga Puissances &#8211; 3 Mod\u00e8les&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokebox-pokemon-mega-puissances-3-modeles\/","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/90441","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89020,89015,89035,89032"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=90441&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89615,"name":"Duopack Pok\u00e9mon Zarude (ME04, ME05)","slug":"duopack-me04-me05-zarude","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/duopack-me04-me05-zarude\/","sku":"0196214141926","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>Duopack Zarude<\/strong> r\u00e9unit un booster Chaos Ascendant (ME04), un booster Nuit Noire (ME05), une carte brillante de Zarude et une pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallis\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Deux extensions voisines du bloc M\u00e9ga dans un seul blister.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Duopack Zarude : deux extensions et un roi de la jungle<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>Duopack Zarude<\/strong> est un blister du JCC Pok\u00e9mon qui associe deux boosters de deux extensions qui se suivent : Chaos Ascendant (ME04) et Nuit Noire (ME05). Il y ajoute une carte brillante de Zarude et une pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallis\u00e9e, visibles \u00e0 travers le plastique.<\/p>\n<h3>Zarude, le p\u00e8re adoptif de la jungle<\/h3>\n<p>Zarude est un Pok\u00e9mon fabuleux de type Plante et T\u00e9n\u00e8bres, pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 au grand public dans le film \u00ab Pok\u00e9mon : Les secrets de la jungle \u00bb. On y suit un Zarude qui recueille un b\u00e9b\u00e9 humain, Koko, et l&rsquo;\u00e9l\u00e8ve comme son fils, quitte \u00e0 \u00eatre rejet\u00e9 par sa troupe. Une histoire touchante, et l&rsquo;une des plus belles du cin\u00e9ma Pok\u00e9mon. Sur la carte de ce duopack, Zarude a 130 PV et son allure de chef de bande.<\/p>\n<h3>Deux boosters, deux ambiances<\/h3>\n<p>Le booster Chaos Ascendant emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 Illumis, o\u00f9 M\u00e9ga-Floette-ex s\u00e8me la pagaille. Le booster Nuit Noire plonge dans l&rsquo;ombre de M\u00e9ga-Darkrai-ex. Chacun contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base. C&rsquo;est une bonne fa\u00e7on de comparer deux extensions avant de choisir laquelle suivre de plus pr\u00e8s.<\/p>\n<h3>La pi\u00e8ce<\/h3>\n<p>Le blister contient aussi une pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallis\u00e9e, utile pour les lancers \u00e0 pile ou face en d\u00e9but de partie. Celle de notre photo est illustr\u00e9e d&rsquo;un Ronflex. Une pi\u00e8ce de plus dans la bo\u00eete de jeu, c&rsquo;est toujours pratique quand la premi\u00e8re a disparu sous le canap\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Un petit cadeau qui fait plaisir<\/h3>\n<p>Petit prix, contenu vari\u00e9, carte visible : le duopack est un excellent cadeau pour un enfant qui commence \u00e0 collectionner, ou un compl\u00e9ment pour un fan qui veut toutes les cartes de Zarude.<\/p>\n<p>Les deux extensions sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es sur les pages <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/chaos-ascendant\/\"><strong>Chaos Ascendant<\/strong><\/a> et <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/nuit-noire\/\"><strong>Nuit Noire<\/strong><\/a>. Zarude a aussi sa promo pleine illustration dans l&rsquo;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-pokemon-coffret-dresseur-delite-nuit-noire-me05\/\"><strong>ETB Nuit Noire<\/strong><\/a>. Les autres formats sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/duopacks-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>duopacks Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Duopack JCC Pok\u00e9mon Zarude, version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 1 booster M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 Chaos Ascendant, 1 booster M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 Nuit Noire, 1 carte brillante Zarude, 1 pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallis\u00e9e. EAN : 196214141926.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Zarude a \u00e9lev\u00e9 un enfant humain dans la jungle. Ouvrir deux boosters sans vous les faire r\u00e9clamer par le v\u00f4tre, c&rsquo;est un d\u00e9fi d&rsquo;un tout autre niveau.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1490","regular_price":"1490","sale_price":"1490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">14,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93674,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-me05-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/duopack-pokemon-zarude-me04-m