emon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12058,"name":"Duopack","slug":"duopack"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12079,"name":"Chaos Ascendant","slug":"chaos-ascendant"},{"id":12080,"name":"Nuit Noire","slug":"nuit-noire"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Duopack Pok\u00e9mon Zarude (ME04, ME05)&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89615","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89615","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89020,89015,89035,89032"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89615&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89591,"name":"Coffret Pok\u00e9mon Premier Partenaire S\u00e9rie 1 (Anglais)","slug":"coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais\/","sku":"196214134959","short_description":"<p>La <strong>First Partner Illustration Collection Series 1<\/strong> est la version anglaise de la Collection Illustration Premiers Partenaires \u2013 S\u00e9rie 1 : un booster avec 3 promos parmi 9, 2 boosters et une page d&rsquo;autocollants.<\/p>\n<p>Les starters de Kanto, Sinnoh et Alola, en version originale.<\/p>","description":"<h2>First Partner Illustration Collection Series 1 : les starters en VO<\/h2>\n<p>Le laboratoire, le professeur, trois Pok\u00e9 Balls sur la table : la <strong>First Partner Illustration Collection Series 1<\/strong>, sortie au 1er trimestre 2026, fait revivre cette sc\u00e8ne avec neuf cartes promo de style \u00ab illustration rare \u00bb consacr\u00e9es aux premiers partenaires de trois r\u00e9gions : Kanto, Sinnoh et Alola. Ce coffret est la version anglaise du produit.<\/p>\n<h3>Le contenu<\/h3>\n<p>Dans la bo\u00eete : un booster sp\u00e9cial qui cache trois promos sur neuf possibles, deux boosters classiques et une planche d&rsquo;autocollants \u00e0 l&rsquo;effigie des starters. Ici, tout est en anglais : cartes, boosters et emballage.<\/p>\n<h3>Neuf starters, trois r\u00e9gions<\/h3>\n<p>Kanto, c&rsquo;est le trio de 1996 : Bulbasaur, Charmander et Squirtle, nos Bulbizarre, Salam\u00e8che et Carapuce. Sinnoh, c&rsquo;est Turtwig, Chimchar et Piplup, soit Tortipouss, Ouisticram et Tiplouf. Alola, c&rsquo;est Rowlet, Litten et Popplio : Brindibou, Flamiaou et Otaquin. Lire les noms anglais au dos de la bo\u00eete est un petit jeu en soi, et les fans d\u00e9couvrent souvent que Tiplouf s&rsquo;appelle Piplup avec un certain amusement.<\/p>\n<h3>Pourquoi la version anglaise ?<\/h3>\n<p>Beaucoup de collectionneurs compl\u00e8tent leurs s\u00e9ries dans plusieurs langues, et les promos illustration rare se pr\u00eatent particuli\u00e8rement bien \u00e0 ce jeu : m\u00eame illustration, autre texte. C&rsquo;est aussi un bon cadeau pour un fan anglophone ou pour quelqu&rsquo;un qui apprend l&rsquo;anglais en jouant. Les cartes anglaises sont jouables en tournoi comme les fran\u00e7aises.<\/p>\n<h3>Le hasard du trio<\/h3>\n<p>On ne choisit pas les trois promos : elles sont tir\u00e9es au hasard parmi les neuf. C&rsquo;est tout le sel de la collection, et la raison pour laquelle certains en ouvrent plusieurs pour compl\u00e9ter la s\u00e9rie.<\/p>\n<p>La version fran\u00e7aise existe aussi en boutique avec d&rsquo;autres r\u00e9gions : la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-2\/\"><strong>S\u00e9rie 2<\/strong><\/a> (Johto, Unys, Galar) et la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-3\/\"><strong>S\u00e9rie 3<\/strong><\/a> (Hoenn, Kalos, Paldea). Les autres produits en VO sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-anglais\/\"><strong>cartes Pok\u00e9mon en anglais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Pok\u00e9mon TCG: First Partner Illustration Collection \u2013 Series 1, version anglaise. Contenu : 1 booster contenant 3 des 9 cartes promo, 2 boosters, 1 page d&rsquo;autocollants. Sortie : 1er trimestre 2026. EAN : 196214134959.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Trente ans de d\u00e9bats pour savoir quel starter choisir, et la r\u00e9ponse officielle de Pok\u00e9mon tient en trois mots : \u00ab three of nine \u00bb. Pratique, \u00e7a \u00e9vite de trancher.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"4900","regular_price":"4900","sale_price":"4900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">49,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93672,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-premier-partenaire-serie-1-anglais-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfa