,"categories":[{"id":6657,"name":"Pok\u00e9balls en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"pokeballs-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/pokeballs-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":0,"name":"Mod\u00e8le","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":true,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Pok\u00e9ball","slug":"Pok\u00e9ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Bis Ball","slug":"Bis Ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Hyper Ball","slug":"Hyper Ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Super Ball","slug":"Super Ball"},{"id":0,"name":"Honor Ball","slug":"Honor Ball"}]},{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12055,"name":"Pok\u00e9ball","slug":"pokeball"}]}],"variations":[{"id":89474,"attributes":[{"name":"Mod\u00e8le","value":"Bis Ball"}]}],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":true,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Choix des options","description":"S\u00e9lectionner les options pour &ldquo;Pok\u00e9ball Pok\u00e9mon Q4 2025 (EV03-EV04)&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokeball-pokemon-q4-2025-ev03-ev04\/","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89463","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89021,89020,89015,88374"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,89714,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89463&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89440,"name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME02 Flammes Fantasmagoriques","slug":"tripack-pokemon-flammes-fantasmagoriques-me02","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-flammes-fantasmagoriques-me02\/","sku":"196214125261","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Flammes Fantasmagoriques<\/strong> glisse trois boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME02 sous blister, avec une carte promo Dimoret pos\u00e9e bien en \u00e9vidence au milieu.<\/p>\n<p>Le format qu&rsquo;on attrape pour une soir\u00e9e de d\u00e9gustation sans sortir l&rsquo;artillerie lourde : trois tentatives pour croiser M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X-ex et ses flammes bleues.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Flammes Fantasmagoriques : Dimoret en vitrine, trois boosters ME02 derri\u00e8re<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Flammes Fantasmagoriques<\/strong> a un avantage que le booster seul n&rsquo;aura jamais : avant m\u00eame d&rsquo;ouvrir quoi que ce soit, vous savez d\u00e9j\u00e0 qu&rsquo;une carte repart avec vous. Dimoret tr\u00f4ne au centre du blister, griffes en avant, pendant que trois boosters de la deuxi\u00e8me extension du bloc M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution attendent sagement leur tour.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce qu&rsquo;il y a dans le blister<\/h3>\n<p>Trois boosters Flammes Fantasmagoriques en fran\u00e7ais et une carte promo Dimoret. Rien de plus, rien de moins, et c&rsquo;est justement ce qui en fait un bon format : assez de cartes pour vivre une vraie ouverture, sans engager le budget d&rsquo;une display compl\u00e8te.<\/p>\n<p>La promo est visible \u00e0 travers le plastique. Pas de surprise de ce c\u00f4t\u00e9-l\u00e0, la surprise est r\u00e9serv\u00e9e aux boosters.<\/p>\n<h3>Dimoret, le voleur de la bande<\/h3>\n<p>Dimoret, c&rsquo;est l&rsquo;\u00e9volution de Farfuret, un Pok\u00e9mon qui a toujours eu des airs de pickpocket des neiges. Ses griffes sont sa signature, et sur la carte il les affiche sans complexe. Dans une extension domin\u00e9e par le feu bleu et les spectres, ce petit r\u00f4deur glacial joue les invit\u00e9s qui ne respectent pas le th\u00e8me. On l&rsquo;aime pour \u00e7a.<\/p>\n<h3>Flammes Fantasmagoriques : le feu bleu et les fant\u00f4mes<\/h3>\n<p>Sortie le 14 novembre 2025, ME02 compte plus de 120 cartes. M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X-ex m\u00e8ne la danse avec ses flammes bleues, et M\u00e9ga-Ectoplasma-ex lui donne la r\u00e9plique depuis l&rsquo;ombre. M\u00e9ga-Scarhino-ex et M\u00e9ga-Lockpin-ex compl\u00e8tent le tableau des Pok\u00e9mon-ex M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution de l&rsquo;extension.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est un set \u00e0 l&rsquo;ambiance nocturne, un peu inqui\u00e9tante, qui tranche avec le c\u00f4t\u00e9 lumineux du premier set du bloc. Si vous aimez les illustrations sombres avec un seul \u00e9clat de couleur vive, vous \u00eates au bon endroit.<\/p>\n<p>Toutes les cartes phares, le contexte de sortie et les autres formats de l&rsquo;extension sont r\u00e9unis sur notre page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/flammes-fantasmagoriques\/\"><strong>Flammes Fantasmagoriques<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour qui, ce tripack ?<\/h3>\n<p>Pour le collectionneur qui veut tenter sa chance sur M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X-ex sans y laisser sa paie. Pour le joueur qui compl\u00e8te un deck et aime bien avoir une carte garantie. Et pour le cadeau facile : un blister se glisse sous le sapin ou dans une chaussette sans emballage compliqu\u00e9, et le Dimoret fait sourire avant m\u00eame l&rsquo;ouverture.<\/p>\n<p>Si l&rsquo;envie de M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution persiste apr\u00e8s le dernier booster, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-chaos-ascendant-me4\/\"><strong>Tripack Chaos Ascendant<\/strong><\/a> prolonge le bloc deux extensions plus loin.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Jeu :<\/strong> JCC Pok\u00e9mon, en fran\u00e7ais<\/li>\n<li><strong>Extension :<\/strong> M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 Flammes Fantasmagoriques (ME02)<\/li>\n<li><strong>Contenu :<\/strong> 3 boosters + 1 carte promo Dimoret<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 196214125261<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Ouvrir les trois boosters en gardant Dimoret pour la fin, c&rsquo;est possible. Mais un Pok\u00e9mon qui vit de vols \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9talage n&rsquo;a jamais appris \u00e0 attendre son tour : en g\u00e9n\u00e9ral, c&rsquo;est lui qu&rsquo;on sort du blister en premier.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2990","regular_price":"2990","sale_price":"2990","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[],"categories":[{"id":6520,"name":"Tripacks Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"tripacks-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/tripacks-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12050,"name":"Tripack","slug":"tripack"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12077,"name":"Flammes Fantasmagoriques","slug":"flammes-fantasmagoriques"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME02 Flammes Fantasmagoriques&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89440","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":8,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89440","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89440&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89439,"name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait","slug":"tripack-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me3","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me3\/","sku":"196214136694","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>Tripack \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> r\u00e9unit 3 boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME03 et une carte promo de Germignon, visible \u00e0 travers le blister.<\/p>\n<p>Le format id\u00e9al pour d\u00e9couvrir l&rsquo;extension ou faire un petit cadeau.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Tripack \u00c9quilibre Parfait : trois boosters et un starter de Johto<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>Tripack \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> est un blister de trois boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME03, sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 27 mars 2026, accompagn\u00e9s d&rsquo;une carte promo. Sur notre exemplaire, la promo est Germignon, le petit Pok\u00e9mon Plante \u00e0 la feuille sur la t\u00eate.<\/p>\n<h3>Germignon, le retour d&rsquo;un starter<\/h3>\n<p>Germignon est l&rsquo;un des trois starters de Pok\u00e9mon Or et Argent, sortis en 1999 au Japon, avec H\u00e9ricendre et Kaiminus. C&rsquo;\u00e9tait souvent le choix des courageux : ses premi\u00e8res ar\u00e8nes ne l&rsquo;avantagent pas, et beaucoup de joueurs s&rsquo;en souviennent. Il a retrouv\u00e9 la lumi\u00e8re dans L\u00e9gendes Pok\u00e9mon : Z-A, o\u00f9 il fait partie des Pok\u00e9mon de d\u00e9part, et son \u00e9volution finale, M\u00e9ganium, a m\u00eame re\u00e7u une M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution. De quoi donner une seconde jeunesse \u00e0 un Pok\u00e9mon que certains avaient un peu sous-estim\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Trois boosters, 33 cartes<\/h3>\n<p>Chaque booster \u00c9quilibre Parfait contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base. Trois boosters, c&rsquo;est donc 30 cartes \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir, plus la promo. Assez pour tomber sur un Pok\u00e9mon-ex, voir les nouvelles cartes Dresseur ou commencer une collection de l&rsquo;extension. M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex, M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe-ex et M\u00e9ga-Staross-ex en sont les grandes vedettes.<\/p>\n<h3>Le bon format pour un cadeau<\/h3>\n<p>Un tripack tient dans une main, se glisse dans un sac et s&rsquo;offre facilement. La promo visible \u00e0 travers le plastique permet de savoir ce que l&rsquo;on offre au moins pour une carte. Pour les plus jeunes, c&rsquo;est souvent le premier vrai produit de cartes Pok\u00e9mon, avant de passer \u00e0 l&rsquo;ETB ou au display.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour les joueurs<\/h3>\n<p>Le blister ne contient pas d&rsquo;accessoires, mais les trois boosters permettent de compl\u00e9ter un deck existant ou de tester les cartes de l&rsquo;extension. La promo de Germignon est jouable, comme toutes les cartes promo du JCC.<\/p>\n<p>L&rsquo;extension est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e sur la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/equilibre-parfait\/\"><strong>\u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a>. Pour plus de boosters : le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/\"><strong>lot de 6 boosters \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a> ou le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/display-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/\"><strong>Display<\/strong><\/a>. Les autres blisters sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/tripacks-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>tripacks Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Tripack M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 \u00c9quilibre Parfait (ME03), version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 3 boosters de 10 cartes + 1 \u00c9nergie de base, 1 carte promo (Germignon sur la photo). EAN : 196214136694.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>En 1999, choisir Germignon, c&rsquo;\u00e9tait accepter de souffrir face \u00e0 Albert et ses Pok\u00e9mon Vol. En 2026, choisir ce tripack, c&rsquo;est juste accepter trois boosters. On a connu des d\u00e9cisions plus dures.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2490","regular_price":"2490","sale_price":"2490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">24,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93670,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait","alt":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait \u2013 visuel du produit"}],"categories":[{"id":6520,"name":"Tripacks Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"tripacks-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/tripacks-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12050,"name":"Tripack","slug":"tripack"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12082,"name":"\u00c9quilibre Parfait","slug":"equilibre-parfait"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89439","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":43,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89439","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89021,89034,89007,89005"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89439&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89438,"name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Day 2026","slug":"coffret-pokemon-day","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-day\/","sku":"196214139718","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Collection Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon 2026<\/strong> contient une carte brillante de Pikachu estampill\u00e9e \u00ab Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon \u00bb, une pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallique au logo sp\u00e9cial et 3 boosters du JCC Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Le souvenir du Pok\u00e9mon Day de l&rsquo;ann\u00e9e des 30 ans.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Collection Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon 2026 : f\u00eater les 30 ans avec Pikachu<\/h2>\n<p>Chaque 27 f\u00e9vrier, les fans du monde entier c\u00e9l\u00e8brent la Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon, ou Pok\u00e9mon Day. La date n&rsquo;est pas choisie au hasard : le 27 f\u00e9vrier 1996 sortaient au Japon les tout premiers jeux, Pok\u00e9mon Vert et Rouge. En 2026, la f\u00eate avait une saveur particuli\u00e8re, puisque Pok\u00e9mon soufflait ses 30 bougies. La <strong>Collection Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon 2026<\/strong> en est le souvenir officiel.<\/p>\n<h3>Le contenu officiel<\/h3>\n<p>La collection contient une carte brillante de Pikachu estampill\u00e9e \u00ab Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon \u00bb, une pi\u00e8ce Pok\u00e9mon m\u00e9tallique marqu\u00e9e d&rsquo;un logo sp\u00e9cial et trois boosters provenant de diverses extensions du JCC Pok\u00e9mon. Sur notre exemplaire, on aper\u00e7oit notamment un booster Flammes Fantasmagoriques. Le blister porte le logo des 30 ans, bien visible sur le c\u00f4t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Pikachu, mascotte depuis toujours<\/h3>\n<p>Dans les premiers jeux, Pikachu n&rsquo;\u00e9tait qu&rsquo;un Pok\u00e9mon parmi 151, que l&rsquo;on capturait dans la For\u00eat de Jade. C&rsquo;est le dessin anim\u00e9 qui en a fait une star : le Pikachu de Sacha refuse d&rsquo;entrer dans sa Pok\u00e9 Ball, et ce petit caprice a suffi \u00e0 conqu\u00e9rir le monde. Trente ans plus tard, il est toujours la mascotte de la licence, et sa carte promo estampill\u00e9e est un classique du Pok\u00e9mon Day.<\/p>\n<h3>La pi\u00e8ce<\/h3>\n<p>La pi\u00e8ce m\u00e9tallique sert \u00e0 lancer \u00e0 pile ou face en d\u00e9but de partie, mais beaucoup la gardent comme objet de collection. Celle de 2026 porte un logo sp\u00e9cial de l&rsquo;ann\u00e9e, ce qui en fait un petit marqueur dans une collection de pi\u00e8ces Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour qui ?<\/h3>\n<p>Pour les collectionneurs de promos Pikachu, pour ceux qui gardent un souvenir de chaque Pok\u00e9mon Day, et pour les fans qui veulent marquer les 30 ans de la licence sans se lancer dans les gros coffrets. C&rsquo;est aussi un cadeau abordable qui a une vraie histoire \u00e0 raconter.<\/p>\n<p>Pour d\u00e9couvrir le bloc en cours, la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/mega-evolution\/\"><strong>M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution<\/strong><\/a> et la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/flammes-fantasmagoriques\/\"><strong>Flammes Fantasmagoriques<\/strong><\/a> pr\u00e9sentent les extensions. Les autres blisters sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/tripacks-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>tripacks Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Collection Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon 2026 du JCC Pok\u00e9mon, version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 1 carte brillante Pikachu estampill\u00e9e \u00ab Journ\u00e9e Pok\u00e9mon \u00bb, 1 pi\u00e8ce Pok\u00e9mon m\u00e9tallique, 3 boosters de diverses extensions. Sortie : 1er trimestre 2026. EAN : 196214139718.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Le Pikachu de Sacha refusait d&rsquo;entrer dans sa Pok\u00e9 Ball. Celui-ci accepte de rester dans son blister jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 ce que vous l&rsquo;ouvriez. Les temps changent.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2490","regular_price":"2490","sale_price":"2490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">24,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93669,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-day-2026-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Day 2026","alt":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Day 2026 \u2013 visuel du produit"}],"categories":[{"id":2628,"name":"Coffrets Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"coffrets-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/coffrets-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12050,"name":"Tripack","slug":"tripack"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12077,"name":"Flammes Fantasmagoriques","slug":"flammes-fantasmagoriques"},{"id":12075,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Day 2026&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89438","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":13,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89438","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=91114,89007,89004,89003"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89428,89183,91139,89714"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89438&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89437,"name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon ME04 Chaos Ascendant","slug":"tripack-pokemon-chaos-ascendant-me4","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-chaos-ascendant-me4\/","sku":"196214140172","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>Tripack Chaos Ascendant<\/strong> contient 3 boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME04 et une carte promo de Reptincel, visible \u00e0 travers le blister.<\/p>\n<p>Trois ouvertures et un Pok\u00e9mon au caract\u00e8re bien tremp\u00e9.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Tripack Chaos Ascendant : trois boosters et un Reptincel<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>Tripack Chaos Ascendant<\/strong> r\u00e9unit trois boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME04, sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 22 mai 2026, et une carte promo brillante. Sur notre blister, la promo est Reptincel, avec son attaque Crachage de Feu R\u00e9gulier.<\/p>\n<h3>Reptincel, l&rsquo;ado rebelle de la famille Salam\u00e8che<\/h3>\n<p>Reptincel est l&rsquo;\u00e9volution de Salam\u00e8che et la pr\u00e9-\u00e9volution de Dracaufeu. Dans le dessin anim\u00e9, c&rsquo;est un \u00e9pisode rest\u00e9 c\u00e9l\u00e8bre : le Salam\u00e8che de Sacha, adorable et fid\u00e8le, \u00e9volue en Reptincel et ne veut soudain plus lui ob\u00e9ir. Il gardera ce caract\u00e8re en devenant Dracaufeu, jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 refuser de se battre en plein match de la Ligue Indigo. Toute une g\u00e9n\u00e9ration a grandi avec ce Pok\u00e9mon t\u00eatu, et le retrouver en promo fait toujours sourire.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce que cachent les boosters<\/h3>\n<p>Chaque booster contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base. Chaos Ascendant se passe \u00e0 Illumis, o\u00f9 M\u00e9ga-Floette-ex s\u00e8me la pagaille. M\u00e9ga-Amphinobi-ex, M\u00e9ga-N\u00e9m\u00e9lios-ex et M\u00e9ga-Kravarech-ex essaient de r\u00e9tablir l&rsquo;ordre. Trois boosters, c&rsquo;est 30 cartes pour voir si l&rsquo;extension vous pla\u00eet avant de passer au format sup\u00e9rieur.<\/p>\n<h3>Un cadeau simple et efficace<\/h3>\n<p>Le blister est compact, la promo est visible, le prix reste doux. C&rsquo;est le genre de produit qu&rsquo;on glisse dans une hotte de No\u00ebl, qu&rsquo;on offre pour un anniversaire ou qu&rsquo;on s&rsquo;offre \u00e0 soi-m\u00eame apr\u00e8s une bonne semaine. Il pla\u00eet autant aux enfants qu&rsquo;aux collectionneurs qui suivent toutes les promos de l&rsquo;extension.<\/p>\n<h3>Et pour les joueurs ?<\/h3>\n<p>La carte Reptincel est jouable, et les boosters peuvent compl\u00e9ter un deck autour des M\u00e9ga de l&rsquo;extension. Pour jouer avec un deck complet, l&rsquo;ETB reste plus adapt\u00e9e, avec ses \u00c9nergies et ses accessoires.<\/p>\n<p>La page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/chaos-ascendant\/\"><strong>Chaos Ascendant<\/strong><\/a> pr\u00e9sente toute l&rsquo;extension. Pour en ouvrir plus : l&rsquo;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-pokemon-chaos-ascendant-me04\/\"><strong>ETB Chaos Ascendant<\/strong><\/a> ou le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/duopack-me04-me05-zarude\/\"><strong>Duopack Zarude<\/strong><\/a>, qui m\u00e9lange Chaos Ascendant et Nuit Noire. Et pour comparer les promos, direction les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/tripacks-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>tripacks Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Tripack M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 Chaos Ascendant (ME04), version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 3 boosters de 10 cartes + 1 \u00c9nergie de base, 1 carte promo brillante (Reptincel sur la photo). EAN : 196214140172.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Contrairement au Reptincel de Sacha, celui-ci ne vous tournera pas le dos. Il reste sagement derri\u00e8re son plastique en attendant que vous ouvriez les trois boosters.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2490","regular_price":"2490","sale_price":"2490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">24,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93667,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tripack-pokemon-me04-chaos-ascendant-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-wid