s":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Mini Tin Pok\u00e9mon Illumis&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89198","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":28,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89198","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89021,89020,89015,88374"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89198&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89142,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque","slug":"figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque\/","sku":"6923517303898","short_description":"<p>Canon point\u00e9, jet d&rsquo;eau translucide en plein tir : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque<\/strong> de Langbowang fige le starter Eau de Kanto au c\u0153ur d&rsquo;un combat, camp\u00e9 sur un sol sablonneux. Une pi\u00e8ce officielle, sculpt\u00e9e comme une sc\u00e8ne de combat miniature.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque : la carapace qui tire \u00e0 vue<\/h2>\n<p>Le petit Carapuce qui arrosait les dresseurs a bien grandi. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque<\/strong> le montre en pleine riposte : un bras tendu, la gueule ouverte, et un jet d&rsquo;eau transparent qui part d&rsquo;un des canons fix\u00e9s sur sa carapace. Sous ses pieds, un sol de sable clair donne l&rsquo;impression d&rsquo;une ar\u00e8ne en plein air.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Battle Moment de Langbowang<\/h3>\n<p>Le fabricant chinois Langbowang, qui travaille sous licence officielle, a b\u00e2ti cette collection autour d&rsquo;un principe : figer un Pok\u00e9mon c\u00e9l\u00e8bre au moment pr\u00e9cis o\u00f9 il frappe. Chaque pi\u00e8ce combine le personnage, un bout de terrain et un effet transparent pour l&rsquo;attaque. On la trouve sous plusieurs noms selon les revendeurs, Battle Moment ou Final Duel, mais l&rsquo;esprit reste le m\u00eame.<\/p>\n<p>Pour Tortank, le choix de l&rsquo;attaque \u00e9tait \u00e9vident : Hydrocanon, ce jet d&rsquo;eau sous pression qu&rsquo;il propulse par ses canons, et qui suffit selon le Pok\u00e9dex \u00e0 percer l&rsquo;acier.<\/p>\n<h3>Le num\u00e9ro 0009, la forteresse de Kanto<\/h3>\n<p>Tortank est l&rsquo;\u00e9volution finale de Carapuce, apr\u00e8s Carabaffe, et l&rsquo;un des trois starters les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres de la licence. Son design en a fait une ic\u00f4ne : une tortue massive, une carapace dure comme de la pierre et deux canons qui sortent de son dos. Il est d&rsquo;ailleurs la mascotte de Pok\u00e9mon Bleu, sur la jaquette du jeu.<\/p>\n<p>Dans l&rsquo;anime, le Carapuce de Sacha n&rsquo;a jamais atteint ce stade, ce qui n&rsquo;a pas emp\u00each\u00e9 Tortank de devenir l&rsquo;un des Pok\u00e9mon les plus populaires de la s\u00e9rie, notamment gr\u00e2ce au Tortank de R\u00e9gis, le rival de toujours.<\/p>\n<h3>Une sc\u00e8ne plut\u00f4t qu&rsquo;une statue<\/h3>\n<p>Ce qui rend la figurine int\u00e9ressante, c&rsquo;est la dynamique. Le corps est l\u00e9g\u00e8rement tourn\u00e9, la t\u00eate suit le tir, et l&rsquo;eau translucide prolonge la composition vers l&rsquo;ext\u00e9rieur. Les d\u00e9tails de la carapace, les griffes et l&rsquo;int\u00e9rieur de la gueule sont peints proprement pour ce format.<\/p>\n<p>Le socle sablonneux, avec ses petits reliefs, apporte un d\u00e9cor sans prendre trop de place. La figurine reste compacte et s&rsquo;int\u00e8gre facilement \u00e0 une \u00e9tag\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<h3>De Carapuce \u00e0 Tortank<\/h3>\n<p>Pour montrer toute la lign\u00e9e, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-carapuce\/\"><strong>figurine Carapuce Prime Figure Mini<\/strong><\/a> de Funism fait un excellent point de d\u00e9part : le m\u00eame jet d&rsquo;eau, en version miniature. Et pour reformer le trio des \u00e9volutions finales de Kanto en s\u00e9rie Attaque, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-dracaufeu-attaque\/\"><strong>figurine Dracaufeu Attaque<\/strong><\/a> est faite pour se placer \u00e0 ses c\u00f4t\u00e9s.<\/p>\n<p>Petit d\u00e9tail appr\u00e9ci\u00e9 : le dessous de la carapace et le ventre cr\u00e8me sont bien diff\u00e9renci\u00e9s, et les deux canons sont sculpt\u00e9s en relief. M\u00eame vue de dos, la figurine reste int\u00e9ressante.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Langbowang \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Battle Moment (Attaque) \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Tortank (n\u00b0 0009) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6923517303898<\/p>\n<p>Pi\u00e8ce de collection \u00e0 exposer. L&rsquo;effet d&rsquo;eau en plastique transparent se nettoie avec un pinceau doux.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Un Hydrocanon, \u00e7a perce l&rsquo;acier d&rsquo;apr\u00e8s le Pok\u00e9dex. Sur votre \u00e9tag\u00e8re, il se contentera de viser la figurine Dracaufeu, par principe.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3900","regular_price":"3900","sale_price":"3900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">39,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93800,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tortank-attaque-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12214,"name":"Tortank","slug":"tortank"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12215,"name":"Langbowang","slug":"langbowang"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tortank Attaque&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89142","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":7,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89142","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,76404,59926"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89142&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89141,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf","slug":"figurine-pokemon-tiplouf","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf\/","sku":"6972407216008","short_description":"<p>Un clin d&rsquo;\u0153il, une nageoire lev\u00e9e et des cristaux de glace : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf<\/strong> de Funism montre le starter Eau de Sinnoh perch\u00e9 sur un bloc glac\u00e9, entour\u00e9 de bulles. Format Prime Figure Mini d&rsquo;une dizaine de centim\u00e8tres, son nom anglais <em>Piplup<\/em> grav\u00e9 sur la base.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf : le petit pingouin le plus fier de Sinnoh<\/h2>\n<p>Il ne fait qu&rsquo;une dizaine de centim\u00e8tres, mais il se tient comme un empereur. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf<\/strong> le montre debout sur un bloc de glace, une nageoire en l&rsquo;air, l&rsquo;\u0153il malicieux, avec des \u00e9clats de cristal bleu translucide autour de lui et une bulle d&rsquo;eau qui flotte \u00e0 ses c\u00f4t\u00e9s.<\/p>\n<h3>Le starter Eau de Diamant et Perle<\/h3>\n<p>Tiplouf, num\u00e9ro 0393 du Pok\u00e9dex, est l&rsquo;un des trois Pok\u00e9mon de d\u00e9part de Sinnoh, avec Tortipouss et Ouisticram. Le Pok\u00e9dex le d\u00e9crit comme tr\u00e8s orgueilleux : il a du mal \u00e0 accepter la nourriture qu&rsquo;on lui donne et n&rsquo;en fait qu&rsquo;\u00e0 sa t\u00eate.<\/p>\n<p>Dans l&rsquo;anime, celui d&rsquo;Aurore partage ce caract\u00e8re : fier, susceptible, mais toujours pr\u00eat \u00e0 se battre pour son amie. Plus tard, il \u00e9volue en Prinplouf, puis en Pingol\u00e9on, l&#8217;empereur qui gagne au passage le type Acier.<\/p>\n<h3>Glace et bulles, version Prime Figure Mini<\/h3>\n<p>Funism joue ici sur deux mati\u00e8res : la glace opaque du rocher et les cristaux transparents qui en sortent. Le r\u00e9sultat rappelle les attaques Bulles d&rsquo;O et la vie de Tiplouf sur les c\u00f4tes froides de Sinnoh.<\/p>\n<p>Le socle bleu porte son nom en anglais et en chinois. La bo\u00eete vitrine permet de l&rsquo;exposer emball\u00e9, ou de le sortir pour qu&rsquo;il rejoigne les autres starters de la gamme.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour une \u00e9tag\u00e8re qui sent la banquise<\/h3>\n<p>\u00c0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de lui, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque\/\"><strong>figurine Lokhlass Attaque<\/strong><\/a> de Langbowang prolonge l&rsquo;ambiance glac\u00e9e avec son propre bloc de banquise. Et pour aligner plusieurs g\u00e9n\u00e9rations de starters, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-flambino\/\"><strong>Flambino<\/strong><\/a> et <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-carapuce\/\"><strong>Carapuce<\/strong><\/a> existent dans le m\u00eame format.<\/p>\n<p>Le visage est soign\u00e9 : le bec jaune, la cape bleu fonc\u00e9 qui lui descend sur le torse et les petites taches blanches sur les joues sont peints proprement. Le clin d&rsquo;\u0153il donne \u00e0 la figurine un air complice qui va bien au personnage.<\/p>\n<p>Les fans de Pok\u00e9mon Diamant \u00c9tincelant et Perle Scintillante, les remakes sortis sur Switch, le retrouveront tel qu&rsquo;ils l&rsquo;ont choisi au d\u00e9part de leur aventure. Ceux de la quatri\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration d&rsquo;origine aussi, avec un brin de nostalgie en plus.<\/p>\n<p>Sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re, sa silhouette ronde et ses couleurs froides tranchent avec les starters Feu, ce qui aide \u00e0 composer une vitrine \u00e9quilibr\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Et pour les dresseurs qui l&rsquo;ont choisi \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9poque de la Nintendo DS, c&rsquo;est aussi un petit retour en arri\u00e8re bienvenu.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Prime Figure Mini \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Tiplouf (n\u00b0 0393) \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 10 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete vitrine \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6972407216008<\/p>\n<p>Statuette fixe \u00e0 exposer. Les cristaux transparents sont fins : on la prend par le socle.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Si votre Tiplouf a l&rsquo;air vex\u00e9 sur l&rsquo;\u00e9tag\u00e8re, c&rsquo;est normal : il voulait la place du milieu. Donnez-la-lui, c&rsquo;est plus simple pour tout le monde.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93799,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12207,"name":"Tiplouf","slug":"tiplouf"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Tiplouf&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89141","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89141","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89141&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89140,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Salam\u00e8che","slug":"figurine-pokemon-salameche","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-salameche\/","sku":"6971680458211","short_description":"<p>La <strong>figurine Salam\u00e8che<\/strong> Funism Prime Figure Mini pr\u00e9sente le n\u00b0004 du Pok\u00e9dex au milieu d&rsquo;effets de flammes transparents. Environ 10 cm de PVC, licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>La flamme de la queue reste allum\u00e9e, promis, et le futur Dracaufeu garde d\u00e9j\u00e0 son regard de champion.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Salam\u00e8che Funism : le n\u00b0004 et sa flamme qui ne s&rsquo;\u00e9teint jamais<\/h2>\n<p>Choisir Salam\u00e8che \u00e0 Bourg Palette, c&rsquo;\u00e9tait accepter de souffrir contre l&rsquo;ar\u00e8ne de Pierre pour mieux tout br\u00fbler ensuite. La <strong>figurine Salam\u00e8che<\/strong> de Funism garde l&rsquo;\u00e9nergie de ce choix : le petit l\u00e9zard de feu appara\u00eet entour\u00e9 de flammes transparentes, comme s&rsquo;il venait de lancer une Flamm\u00e8che.<\/p>\n<h3>La flamme au bout de la queue<\/h3>\n<p>Dans l&rsquo;univers Pok\u00e9mon, la flamme de Salam\u00e8che indique son \u00e9tat de sant\u00e9 et sa force. Les fans se souviennent tous de l&rsquo;\u00e9pisode du Salam\u00e8che abandonn\u00e9 sous la pluie, abrit\u00e9 par Sacha. La figurine, elle, montre la flamme bien vive : aucun risque de pluie sur votre bureau.<\/p>\n<h3>Une statuette de la gamme Prime Figure Mini<\/h3>\n<p>Le Pok\u00e9mon repose sur un socle rond o\u00f9 s&rsquo;affichent son nom anglais, Charmander, et son nom chinois. Les effets de flammes en plastique transparent orang\u00e9 entourent la figurine et captent bien la lumi\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<p>Avec ses 10 cm environ, elle trouve sa place sans encombrer : \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 d&rsquo;un \u00e9cran, sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re de mangas ou en face d&rsquo;un classeur de cartes.<\/p>\n<h3>Le reste de la famille<\/h3>\n<p>Salam\u00e8che finit par devenir Dracaufeu, et la grande version en duo existe dans la m\u00eame maison : la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-funism-pikachu-et-dracaufeu\/\"><strong>figurine Funism Pikachu et Dracaufeu<\/strong><\/a> r\u00e9unit les deux mascottes sur une statue d&rsquo;environ 17 cm.<\/p>\n<p>Pour rester sur les starters, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-carapuce\/\"><strong>figurine Carapuce de la m\u00eame gamme<\/strong><\/a> rejoue le duel Feu contre Eau en miniature.<\/p>\n<h3>De Salam\u00e8che \u00e0 Dracaufeu<\/h3>\n<p>Salam\u00e8che \u00e9volue en Reptincel au niveau 16, puis en Dracaufeu au niveau 36. Ce n&rsquo;est qu&rsquo;\u00e0 ce dernier stade qu&rsquo;il gagne ses ailes et le type Vol, ce qui en fait l&rsquo;un des Pok\u00e9mon les plus populaires de toute la licence, cartes comprises.<\/p>\n<p>Dans Pok\u00e9mon Jaune, ceux qui avaient rat\u00e9 le labo du Professeur Chen pouvaient le r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer sur la Route 24, aupr\u00e8s d&rsquo;un dresseur qui ne voulait plus s&rsquo;en occuper. Une petite histoire qui colle bien \u00e0 ce Pok\u00e9mon qu&rsquo;on a tous eu envie de prot\u00e9ger.<\/p>\n<h3>Flamme brandie et d\u00e9cor embras\u00e9<\/h3>\n<p>Ce Salam\u00e8che salue d&rsquo;une main, une flamme orang\u00e9e dress\u00e9e \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de lui. Autour de lui, des flammes translucides montent du socle orange et dessinent un petit brasier. Le r\u00e9sultat a beaucoup de relief pour une figurine de cette taille, et les couleurs chaudes ressortent particuli\u00e8rement bien sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re sombre.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Marque : Funism. Gamme : Prime Figure Mini. Mat\u00e9riau : PVC. Taille : environ 10 cm. Produit sous licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon. EAN : 6971680458211.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Salam\u00e8che, Reptincel, Dracaufeu : trois stades, et la flamme grandit \u00e0 chaque fois. Celle-ci reste \u00e0 taille d&rsquo;\u00e9tag\u00e8re, ce qui arrange tout le monde, \u00e0 commencer par les rideaux.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93798,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-salameche-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Salam\u00e8che","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Salam\u00e8che"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6755,"name":"Salam\u00e8che","slug":"salameche"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Salam\u00e8che&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89140","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":10,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89140","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89140&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89138,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison","slug":"figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison\/","sku":"6923517312913","short_description":"<p>Allong\u00e9 dans un petit bassin entour\u00e9 de pierres et de verdure : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison<\/strong> de Langbowang montre le Pok\u00e9mon le plus lent de Kanto exactement l\u00e0 o\u00f9 il aime \u00eatre, dans l&rsquo;eau, sans se presser. Une figurine officielle qui donne envie de faire la sieste.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison : la sieste comme art de vivre<\/h2>\n<p>Ramoloss n&rsquo;a pas d&rsquo;agenda. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison<\/strong> le montre allong\u00e9 dans un bassin d&rsquo;eau claire, bord\u00e9 de pierres grises et de plantes, la t\u00eate pos\u00e9e sur le rebord et le regard vague. On se demande s&rsquo;il est en train de se reposer ou s&rsquo;il a simplement oubli\u00e9 de sortir.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure de Langbowang<\/h3>\n<p>Ce diorama appartient \u00e0 la s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure, o\u00f9 chaque Pok\u00e9mon retrouve son \u00e9l\u00e9ment. Le bassin de Ramoloss est l&rsquo;un des d\u00e9cors les plus r\u00e9ussis : les pierres, la v\u00e9g\u00e9tation et l&rsquo;eau forment une sc\u00e8ne compl\u00e8te qui tient dans la paume de la main.<\/p>\n<p>Le rose de sa peau, le cr\u00e8me de son museau et ses grands yeux mi-clos sont fid\u00e8les au personnage des jeux et de l&rsquo;anime.<\/p>\n<h3>Le Pok\u00e9mon qui p\u00eache avec sa queue<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0079 du Pok\u00e9dex, Ramoloss est un Pok\u00e9mon Eau et Psy connu pour sa lenteur extraordinaire. Le Pok\u00e9dex raconte qu&rsquo;il trempe sa queue dans l&rsquo;eau pour p\u00eacher, et qu&rsquo;il lui faut parfois plusieurs secondes pour ressentir la douleur quand on la lui mord. Cette queue, d&rsquo;ailleurs, a un go\u00fbt sucr\u00e9 qui attire Kokiyas : c&rsquo;est en s&rsquo;y accrochant que na\u00eet Flagadoss.<\/p>\n<p>Sa nonchalance en a fait une petite star : une ville enti\u00e8re, \u00c9corcia, lui est d\u00e9vou\u00e9e dans Pok\u00e9mon Or et Argent, et la r\u00e9gion de Galar lui a m\u00eame donn\u00e9 une forme r\u00e9gionale.<\/p>\n<h3>Le club des Pok\u00e9mon tranquilles<\/h3>\n<p>Ramoloss a un compagnon de fl\u00e2nerie tout trouv\u00e9 : le diorama <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/ramoloss-psykokwak-diorama-relax-time\/\"><strong>Ramoloss et Psykokwak Relax Time<\/strong><\/a> de Banpresto le montre en pleine pause avec le canard migraineux. Dans la m\u00eame s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-bulbizarre-saison\/\"><strong>figurine Bulbizarre Saison<\/strong><\/a> partage aussi son amour des points d&rsquo;eau.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est le genre de figurine qui d\u00e9tend rien qu&rsquo;\u00e0 la regarder, parfaite sur un bureau un peu trop charg\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Le bassin est sans doute le d\u00e9cor le plus d\u00e9taill\u00e9 de la s\u00e9rie : les pierres ont chacune leur forme, la v\u00e9g\u00e9tation d\u00e9borde par endroits et l&rsquo;eau, peinte en d\u00e9grad\u00e9, donne une impression de profondeur. Ramoloss semble vraiment flotter, \u00e0 moiti\u00e9 immerg\u00e9, ce qui le rend encore plus cr\u00e9dible dans son r\u00f4le de champion de la flemme.<\/p>\n<p>On peut le placer au premier plan d&rsquo;une vitrine, devant des figurines plus hautes, o\u00f9 son allure allong\u00e9e fait office de petite sc\u00e8ne de repos.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Langbowang \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Nature Adventure (Saison) \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Ramoloss (n\u00b0 0079) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6923517312913<\/p>\n<p>C\u00f4t\u00e9 entretien, un pinceau \u00e0 poils souples passe facilement entre les pierres et les feuillages.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Si votre Ramoloss n&rsquo;a pas boug\u00e9 depuis des mois, c&rsquo;est normal : il r\u00e9fl\u00e9chit. Il vous r\u00e9pondra peut-\u00eatre l&rsquo;ann\u00e9e prochaine.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93797,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-ramoloss-saison-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6751,"name":"Ramoloss","slug":"ramoloss"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12215,"name":"Langbowang","slug":"langbowang"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ramoloss Saison&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89138","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":6,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89138","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89138&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89137,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak","slug":"figurine-pokemon-psykokwak","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak\/","sku":"6972407214967","short_description":"<p>Une patte sur le cr\u00e2ne, le regard dans le vague : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak<\/strong> de Funism capture le canard le plus migraineux du Pok\u00e9dex, encadr\u00e9 de deux vagues translucides et d&rsquo;une bulle. Une Prime Figure Mini d&rsquo;environ 10 cm, pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e en bo\u00eete transparente.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak : le mal de t\u00eate le plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bre de Kanto<\/h2>\n<p>Il y a des Pok\u00e9mon qui inspirent la crainte, et il y a Psykokwak. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak<\/strong> le montre fid\u00e8le \u00e0 lui-m\u00eame : une main pos\u00e9e sur la t\u00eate, les yeux un peu perdus, comme s&rsquo;il essayait de se souvenir de ce qu&rsquo;il faisait l\u00e0. Autour de lui, deux arcs d&rsquo;eau transparents et une bulle donnent pourtant l&rsquo;impression qu&rsquo;il pr\u00e9pare quelque chose.<\/p>\n<h3>Un canard, des migraines et des pouvoirs cach\u00e9s<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0054 du Pok\u00e9dex, Psykokwak est un Pok\u00e9mon Eau tourment\u00e9 par des maux de t\u00eate permanents. Quand la douleur devient trop forte, il lib\u00e8re des pouvoirs psychiques, puis oublie compl\u00e8tement ce qui vient de se passer. C&rsquo;est de l\u00e0 que vient son nom, et c&rsquo;est aussi ce qui le rend si attachant.<\/p>\n<p>Dans l&rsquo;anime, celui d&rsquo;Ondine sortait de sa Pok\u00e9 Ball au pire moment, ne comprenait jamais les ordres, puis r\u00e9glait parfois le combat d&rsquo;un coup quand la migraine montait. Il \u00e9volue en Akwakwak, un canard bleu beaucoup plus s\u00fbr de lui.<\/p>\n<h3>Le traitement Prime Figure Mini<\/h3>\n<p>Funism a choisi de garder la pose du Psykokwak perdu dans ses pens\u00e9es, plut\u00f4t qu&rsquo;une posture de combat. Les effets d&rsquo;eau translucides, pos\u00e9s en arc de part et d&rsquo;autre, servent de cadre et rappellent qu&rsquo;il reste un Pok\u00e9mon de type Eau. La bulle qu&rsquo;il tient pr\u00e8s de sa main ajoute un d\u00e9tail amusant.<\/p>\n<p>Le jaune du corps est vif, le bec cr\u00e8me bien dessin\u00e9, et les trois petits cheveux sur le sommet du cr\u00e2ne sont pr\u00e9sents. Le socle bleu porte ses noms anglais (<em>Psyduck<\/em>) et chinois.<\/p>\n<h3>Le duo id\u00e9al<\/h3>\n<p>Psykokwak a un vieux complice dans le registre des Pok\u00e9mon lents : Ramoloss. Les deux se retrouvent dans le diorama <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/ramoloss-psykokwak-diorama-relax-time\/\"><strong>Ramoloss et Psykokwak Relax Time<\/strong><\/a> de Banpresto, assis au bord de l&rsquo;eau. Placer ce Psykokwak soucieux \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de cette sc\u00e8ne de pause, c&rsquo;est montrer les deux faces du personnage.<\/p>\n<p>Pour qui aime les Pok\u00e9mon un peu \u00e0 part, il compl\u00e8te bien une \u00e9tag\u00e8re de starters ou de l\u00e9gendaires : un Pok\u00e9mon qu&rsquo;on n&rsquo;aurait jamais choisi pour gagner, mais qu&rsquo;on garde pour l&rsquo;affection.<\/p>\n<p>C\u00f4t\u00e9 jeu, Psykokwak a d&rsquo;ailleurs une particularit\u00e9 amusante : son talent Ciel Gris annule les effets de la m\u00e9t\u00e9o pendant un combat, comme si le monde entier devait s&rsquo;adapter \u00e0 son humeur. Un d\u00e9tail que seuls les dresseurs attentifs ont remarqu\u00e9, et qui colle parfaitement \u00e0 ce personnage toujours un peu \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Prime Figure Mini \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Psykokwak (n\u00b0 0054) \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 10 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete vitrine \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6972407214967<\/p>\n<p>Figurine statique en PVC, \u00e0 exposer. Les arcs d&rsquo;eau transparents sont fix\u00e9s au socle : on la d\u00e9place en la tenant par la base.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Si vous avez mal \u00e0 la t\u00eate en essayant de choisir votre prochaine figurine, prenez celle-ci : au moins, quelqu&rsquo;un vous comprendra.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93796,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-psykokwak-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6747,"name":"Psykokwak","slug":"psykokwak"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Psykokwak&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89137","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":3,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89137","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89137&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89136,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison","slug":"figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison\/","sku":"6923517312890","short_description":"<p>Une couronne de fleurs sur la t\u00eate et un buisson rose en fleurs \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison<\/strong> de Langbowang montre la mascotte en pleine pause printani\u00e8re, assise dans l&rsquo;herbe. Un petit diorama officiel aux couleurs du printemps.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison : un pique-nique sous les fleurs<\/h2>\n<p>Pour une fois, Pikachu ne se bat pas. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison<\/strong> le montre assis sur un coin de prairie, une couronne de fleurs pos\u00e9e entre les oreilles, \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 d&rsquo;un buisson couvert de fleurs roses. Le regard tourn\u00e9 vers vous, il a l&rsquo;air de profiter d&rsquo;une journ\u00e9e sans dresseur ni combat.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure de Langbowang<\/h3>\n<p>Avec cette collection, Langbowang sort les Pok\u00e9mon des ar\u00e8nes pour les installer en pleine nature. Chacun a son d\u00e9cor : une mare, un bassin, une plage, une prairie. Les revendeurs la d\u00e9signent sous plusieurs noms, Nature Adventure ou Natural Wildlife, et la bo\u00eete chinoise d&rsquo;origine reprend la m\u00eame id\u00e9e de nature et de d\u00e9tente.<\/p>\n<p>La version Pikachu est la plus printani\u00e8re de la s\u00e9rie : tons roses, fleurs, herbe verte et petits d\u00e9tails de pique-nique. Pos\u00e9e sur un bureau, elle rappelle que les beaux jours finissent toujours par revenir.<\/p>\n<h3>Le Pikachu des moments calmes<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0025 du Pok\u00e9dex, Pikachu est d&rsquo;habitude repr\u00e9sent\u00e9 les joues pleines d&rsquo;\u00e9lectricit\u00e9. Ici, rien de tout \u00e7a : la queue pos\u00e9e dans l&rsquo;herbe et l&rsquo;expression sereine renvoient plut\u00f4t aux \u00e9pisodes de l&rsquo;anime o\u00f9 l&rsquo;\u00e9quipe fait une pause entre deux ar\u00e8nes, ou aux jeux comme Pok\u00e9mon Caf\u00e9 ReMix et Pok\u00e9mon Sleep, o\u00f9 l&rsquo;on prend simplement le temps.<\/p>\n<p>La couronne de fleurs ajoute une touche de f\u00eate de printemps qui change agr\u00e9ablement des figurines de combat.<\/p>\n<h3>Une petite sc\u00e8ne \u00e0 compl\u00e9ter<\/h3>\n<p>Ce Pikachu prend tout son sens avec les autres dioramas de la s\u00e9rie. La <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison\/\"><strong>figurine \u00c9voli Saison<\/strong><\/a>, install\u00e9e sur une bou\u00e9e, apporte l&rsquo;\u00e9t\u00e9, et la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-bulbizarre-saison\/\"><strong>figurine Bulbizarre Saison<\/strong><\/a> sa mare fleurie. Ensemble, ils composent une petite promenade \u00e0 travers les saisons.<\/p>\n<p>Et pour un Pikachu dans un tout autre registre, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu\/\"><strong>figurine Pikachu Prime Figure Mini<\/strong><\/a> adopte au contraire une posture de combat, joues charg\u00e9es. Deux humeurs bien diff\u00e9rentes pour un m\u00eame personnage.<\/p>\n<p>Le sol est travaill\u00e9 comme un vrai morceau de jardin : quelques brins d&rsquo;herbe en relief, un coin de terre et des fleurs qui d\u00e9bordent du buisson. Le format reste petit, mais chaque centim\u00e8tre raconte quelque chose, ce qui donne envie de regarder la figurine de pr\u00e8s plut\u00f4t que de loin.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est aussi une figurine qui parle aux plus jeunes fans, qui connaissent Pikachu \u00e0 travers des jeux plus doux et des peluches, et qui le reconna\u00eetront ici dans une ambiance qui leur ressemble.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Langbowang \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Nature Adventure (Saison) \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Pikachu (n\u00b0 0025) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6923517312890<\/p>\n<p>D\u00e9cor fixe pens\u00e9 pour une \u00e9tag\u00e8re, un bureau ou une table de chevet. Un coup de pinceau doux suffit pour le d\u00e9poussi\u00e9rer.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Si vous cherchez Pikachu un jour de printemps, regardez sous les cerisiers : il ne vous attend pas pour le pique-nique.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93795,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6741,"name":"Pikachu","slug":"pikachu"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12215,"name":"Langbowang","slug":"langbowang"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Saison&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89136","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89136","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89136&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89135,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Et Pichu","slug":"figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu\/","sku":"4983164821154","short_description":"<p>Pikachu fait un clin d&rsquo;\u0153il, Pichu s&rsquo;est endormi contre lui : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu et Pichu<\/strong> de Banpresto, s\u00e9rie Relaxing Time, saisit un moment de calme dans une prairie fleurie. Environ 11 cm, PVC peint, pour ceux qui pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent la tendresse aux combats.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu et Pichu : la pause des deux souris<\/h2>\n<p>Il y a des sc\u00e8nes qui n&rsquo;ont besoin d&rsquo;aucune attaque. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu et Pichu<\/strong> montre les deux Pok\u00e9mon assis dans l&rsquo;herbe : Pikachu, l&rsquo;air amus\u00e9, cligne d&rsquo;un \u0153il, tandis que Pichu, les yeux ferm\u00e9s, s&rsquo;appuie contre lui comme un petit fr\u00e8re qui s&rsquo;est endormi en plein apr\u00e8s-midi.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Relaxing Time de Banpresto<\/h3>\n<p>Banpresto, la marque de figurines de Bandai Spirits, a consacr\u00e9 cette s\u00e9rie \u00e0 des Pok\u00e9mon en pleine d\u00e9tente, assis ou allong\u00e9s dans de petits d\u00e9cors naturels. Connue sous les noms Relaxing Time ou Kutsurogi Time selon les pays, elle privil\u00e9gie les expressions et les postures douces. Cette version est sortie au Japon en mars 2025.<\/p>\n<p>Le socle, une prairie verte parsem\u00e9e de petites fleurs bleues, donne \u00e0 la figurine des airs de diorama, et ses environ 11 cm lui permettent de se glisser partout.<\/p>\n<h3>Une \u00e9volution en famille<\/h3>\n<p>Pichu, introduit dans Pok\u00e9mon Or et Argent, est la pr\u00e9-\u00e9volution de Pikachu : il \u00e9volue lorsqu&rsquo;il est tr\u00e8s attach\u00e9 \u00e0 son dresseur. Le Pok\u00e9dex raconte qu&rsquo;il ne sait pas encore bien contr\u00f4ler son \u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et qu&rsquo;il lui arrive de s&rsquo;\u00e9lectrocuter lui-m\u00eame quand il est surpris ou qu&rsquo;il rit.<\/p>\n<p>Cette figurine joue justement sur ce lien : l&rsquo;a\u00een\u00e9 protecteur, l&rsquo;\u0153il rieur, et le petit qui se repose sans crainte contre lui. C&rsquo;est l&rsquo;une des fa\u00e7ons les plus tendres de repr\u00e9senter ce duo.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour un coin de calme<\/h3>\n<p>Dans la m\u00eame s\u00e9rie, le diorama <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/ramoloss-psykokwak-diorama-relax-time\/\"><strong>Ramoloss et Psykokwak Relax Time<\/strong><\/a> partage le m\u00eame esprit et le m\u00eame format : les deux figurines c\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te composent une petite promenade paisible. Pour un Pikachu dans un registre tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rent, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu\/\"><strong>figurine Pikachu Prime Figure Mini<\/strong><\/a> le montre en garde, entour\u00e9 d&rsquo;\u00e9clairs.<\/p>\n<p>Cette sc\u00e8ne pla\u00eet beaucoup aux familles et aux collectionneurs qui aiment les Pok\u00e9mon dans leur vie de tous les jours, loin des ar\u00e8nes.<\/p>\n<p>Les finitions sont dans la tradition Banpresto : couleurs nettes, joues rouges bien plac\u00e9es, oreilles aux extr\u00e9mit\u00e9s noires parfaitement d\u00e9limit\u00e9es. Le petit Pichu, avec son oreille corn\u00e9e et sa queue courte, est particuli\u00e8rement r\u00e9ussi, et le contraste de taille entre les deux rend la sc\u00e8ne encore plus touchante.<\/p>\n<p>Un regard sur cette sc\u00e8ne, et la journ\u00e9e para\u00eet tout de suite moins charg\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Banpresto (Bandai Spirits) \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Relaxing Time \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Pikachu et Pichu \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 11 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 4983164821154<\/p>\n<p>Figurine statique, destin\u00e9e \u00e0 l&rsquo;exposition sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re ou un bureau. Un pinceau doux suffit \u00e0 la garder propre.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Faites attention en passant \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 : Pichu dort, et un Pichu r\u00e9veill\u00e9 en sursaut, \u00e7a peut piquer un peu.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3900","regular_price":"3900","sale_price":"3900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">39,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93816,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Et Pichu","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Et Pichu"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6505,"name":"Bandai","slug":"bandai","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/bandai\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":11602,"name":"Pichu","slug":"pichu"},{"id":6741,"name":"Pikachu","slug":"pikachu"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12160,"name":"Banpresto","slug":"banpresto"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":1,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 1 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu Et Pichu&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89135","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89135","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,76404,59926"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89135&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89134,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu","slug":"figurine-pokemon-pikachu","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu\/","sku":"6971680452431","short_description":"<p>La <strong>figurine Pikachu Funism<\/strong> de la gamme Prime Figure Mini montre la mascotte Pok\u00e9mon en pleine d\u00e9charge, entour\u00e9e d&rsquo;arcs \u00e9lectriques jaunes transparents. PVC, licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Pas besoin de Pok\u00e9 Ball : il reste sagement sur son socle, ce qui est d\u00e9j\u00e0 un exploit pour lui.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pikachu Funism : la mascotte en pleine d\u00e9charge<\/h2>\n<p>Trente ans de Pok\u00e9mon, et toujours la m\u00eame t\u00eate en premier sur les bo\u00eetes, les cartes et les affiches. La <strong>figurine Pikachu Funism<\/strong> ne cherche pas \u00e0 r\u00e9inventer le personnage : elle le montre tel qu&rsquo;on l&rsquo;aime, joues charg\u00e9es et arcs \u00e9lectriques jaunes autour de lui, pr\u00eat \u00e0 lancer un Tonnerre.<\/p>\n<h3>Le n\u00b0025 que tout le monde conna\u00eet<\/h3>\n<p>Pikachu est le Pok\u00e9mon num\u00e9ro 025 du Pok\u00e9dex national et le compagnon de Sacha depuis le premier \u00e9pisode de la s\u00e9rie anim\u00e9e, celui o\u00f9 il refuse cat\u00e9goriquement d&rsquo;entrer dans sa Pok\u00e9 Ball. Il est devenu le visage de la licence enti\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<h3>Des arcs \u00e9lectriques en transparence<\/h3>\n<p>La gamme Prime Figure Mini de Funism mise sur les effets en plastique transparent. Ici, ils prennent la forme d&rsquo;\u00e9clairs jaunes qui s&rsquo;enroulent autour de Pikachu et donnent du relief \u00e0 la pose. Sur le socle figure le nom du Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Pos\u00e9e pr\u00e8s d&rsquo;une fen\u00eatre ou sous une lampe, la figurine joue avec la lumi\u00e8re, comme une petite d\u00e9charge fig\u00e9e dans le PVC.<\/p>\n<h3>Pikachu en d&rsquo;autres versions<\/h3>\n<p>Pikachu revient souvent dans le rayon. La <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison\/\"><strong>figurine Pikachu Saison<\/strong><\/a> le montre dans un d\u00e9cor fleuri, plus calme, tandis que la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-et-pichu\/\"><strong>figurine Pikachu et Pichu de Banpresto<\/strong><\/a> r\u00e9unit le Pok\u00e9mon et sa pr\u00e9-\u00e9volution dans une petite sc\u00e8ne.<\/p>\n<h3>Pichu, Pikachu, Raichu<\/h3>\n<p>Pikachu \u00e9volue en Raichu au contact d&rsquo;une Pierre Foudre, et depuis Pok\u00e9mon Or et Argent il poss\u00e8de m\u00eame une pr\u00e9-\u00e9volution, Pichu. Dans Pok\u00e9mon Jaune, il \u00e9tait le seul Pok\u00e9mon de d\u00e9part possible et suivait le joueur \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9cran, en refusant lui aussi la Pok\u00e9 Ball.<\/p>\n<p>Ce statut de mascotte se retrouve partout : sur les bo\u00eetes du JCC Pok\u00e9mon, dans les films et jusque dans les ballons des parades. Une figurine Pikachu, c&rsquo;est un peu la porte d&rsquo;entr\u00e9e naturelle de toute collection Pok\u00e9mon, qu&rsquo;on ait 8 ou 45 ans.<\/p>\n<h3>Regard d\u00e9termin\u00e9 et \u00e9clairs dor\u00e9s<\/h3>\n<p>Funism a donn\u00e9 \u00e0 ce Pikachu un air r\u00e9solu : sourcils fronc\u00e9s, petit sourire en coin et joues rouges pr\u00eates \u00e0 cr\u00e9piter. Des \u00e9clairs jaunes translucides se d\u00e9ploient de chaque c\u00f4t\u00e9, pos\u00e9s sur un socle jaune o\u00f9 l&rsquo;on lit PIKACHU et son nom chinois. Ce n&rsquo;est pas le Pikachu tout mignon des peluches, c&rsquo;est celui qui part au combat.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Fabricant : Funism. Collection : Prime Figure Mini. Mati\u00e8re : PVC, effets en plastique transparent. Licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon. Code-barres EAN : 6971680452431.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Dans le premier \u00e9pisode, Pikachu refuse la Pok\u00e9 Ball et pr\u00e9f\u00e8re l&rsquo;\u00e9paule de Sacha. Sur votre \u00e9tag\u00e8re, il a enfin trouv\u00e9 un compromis : un socle. Personne n&rsquo;a os\u00e9 lui reparler de la Pok\u00e9 Ball.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":