icarpe-2-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe-2-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Magicarpe (bo\u00eete)","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Magicarpe dans sa bo\u00eete"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12208,"name":"Magicarpe","slug":"magicarpe"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Magicarpe&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89129","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":6,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89129","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89129&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89128,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lucario","slug":"figurine-pokemon-lucario","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-lucario\/","sku":"6970834318210","short_description":"<p>La <strong>figurine Lucario<\/strong> Funism Prime Figure Mini saisit le Pok\u00e9mon Aura en pleine attaque, avec un effet transparent sur son socle. Environ 10 cm de PVC, licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Combat et Acier, une sacr\u00e9e classe, et l&rsquo;Aura qui va avec : le Pok\u00e9mon de Sinnoh pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 de beaucoup de dresseurs.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Lucario Funism : le ma\u00eetre de l&rsquo;Aura en pleine attaque<\/h2>\n<p>Lucario fait partie de ces Pok\u00e9mon qui ont tout de suite eu leurs fans. Silhouette de combattant, regard concentr\u00e9, aura bleue : la <strong>figurine Lucario<\/strong> de Funism le montre en pleine attaque, avec un effet transparent qui donne de l&rsquo;\u00e9lan \u00e0 la pose.<\/p>\n<h3>Le Pok\u00e9mon Aura de Sinnoh<\/h3>\n<p>Apparu dans Pok\u00e9mon Diamant et Perle, Lucario porte le num\u00e9ro 448 du Pok\u00e9dex. Il est de type Combat et Acier, une combinaison rare qui lui donne beaucoup de r\u00e9sistances. Son design \u00e9voque Anubis, le dieu \u00e9gyptien \u00e0 t\u00eate de chacal, et il a eu droit \u00e0 son propre film, Lucario et le Myst\u00e8re de Mew.<\/p>\n<p>Dans le JCC Pok\u00e9mon, M\u00e9ga-Lucario-ex fait m\u00eame partie des vedettes de l&rsquo;extension M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution : Lucario n&rsquo;a jamais vraiment quitt\u00e9 le devant de la sc\u00e8ne.<\/p>\n<h3>Une statuette compacte et vivante<\/h3>\n<p>La gamme Prime Figure Mini garde un format d&rsquo;environ 10 cm, avec un socle rond o\u00f9 sont inscrits son nom anglais, Lucario, et son nom chinois. L&rsquo;effet d&rsquo;attaque en plastique transparent apporte le mouvement qui manque souvent aux petites figurines.<\/p>\n<h3>\u00c0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 des cartes<\/h3>\n<p>Les dresseurs qui jouent Lucario sur table trouveront leurs cartes dans le rayon <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>cartes Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>. Et pour une autre figurine de combattant de la m\u00eame gamme, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-cizayox\/\"><strong>figurine Cizayox<\/strong><\/a> joue elle aussi la carte de l&rsquo;acier.<\/p>\n<h3>De Riolu \u00e0 M\u00e9ga-Lucario<\/h3>\n<p>Lucario \u00e9volue \u00e0 partir de Riolu, quand celui-ci est tr\u00e8s attach\u00e9 \u00e0 son dresseur et monte de niveau en journ\u00e9e. Depuis Pok\u00e9mon X et Y, il peut aussi m\u00e9ga-\u00e9voluer en M\u00e9ga-Lucario. Il a m\u00eame rejoint la liste des combattants jouables de Super Smash Bros. Brawl, preuve qu&rsquo;il a largement d\u00e9pass\u00e9 le cercle des joueurs Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Cette popularit\u00e9 se retrouve chez les collectionneurs : Lucario fait partie des Pok\u00e9mon de quatri\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration que l&rsquo;on voit le plus souvent sur les \u00e9tag\u00e8res, \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 des starters et de Pikachu.<\/p>\n<h3>En garde, l&rsquo;Aura d\u00e9ploy\u00e9e<\/h3>\n<p>Lucario est saisi accroupi, en position de combat, une patte en avant, le regard rouge fix\u00e9 sur son adversaire. Deux arcs d&rsquo;\u00e9nergie bleue translucide l&rsquo;entourent comme une aura qui s&rsquo;\u00e9chappe de son corps. Le socle bleu porte son nom, en anglais et en chinois. Une pose de combattant, parfaitement dans le caract\u00e8re du Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Marque : Funism. Gamme : Prime Figure Mini. Mati\u00e8re : PVC avec effet transparent. Hauteur : environ 10 cm. Sous licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon. EAN : 6970834318210.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Lucario serait capable de lire les \u00e9motions gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l&rsquo;Aura. Si celui-ci vous fixe depuis l&rsquo;\u00e9tag\u00e8re, ne paniquez pas : il a simplement senti que vous h\u00e9sitiez encore \u00e0 prendre Mew avec.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93785,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/up