figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-lucario-2-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lucario (bo\u00eete)","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lucario dans sa bo\u00eete"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6721,"name":"Lucario","slug":"lucario"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lucario&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89128","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":8,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89128","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89128&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89127,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lokhlass Attaque","slug":"figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque\/","sku":"6923517303928","short_description":"<p>Pos\u00e9 sur un bloc de banquise, le cou dress\u00e9 au milieu des \u00e9clats de glace : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lokhlass Attaque<\/strong> de Langbowang montre le grand transporteur des mers de Kanto en pleine attaque Glace. Diorama officiel en PVC peint, livr\u00e9 dans une bo\u00eete illustr\u00e9e.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lokhlass Attaque : la banquise prend la parole<\/h2>\n<p>Lokhlass a l&rsquo;air doux, mais il sait se d\u00e9fendre. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lokhlass Attaque<\/strong> le montre sur une plaque de glace qui flotte, entour\u00e9 de pics et de cristaux transparents, la t\u00eate tourn\u00e9e vers l&rsquo;adversaire. Une sc\u00e8ne calme en apparence, mais l&rsquo;air glacial qui l&rsquo;entoure laisse deviner un Laser Glace imminent.<\/p>\n<h3>Le passeur des mers<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0131 du Pok\u00e9dex, Lokhlass est de type Eau et Glace. Le Pok\u00e9dex le d\u00e9crit comme un Pok\u00e9mon intelligent et doux, qui aime transporter les gens sur son dos pour traverser la mer. Dans Pok\u00e9mon Rouge et Bleu, on le recevait en cadeau dans la Sylphe SARL, \u00e0 Safrania, apr\u00e8s avoir chass\u00e9 la Team Rocket : un compagnon de voyage autant qu&rsquo;un combattant.<\/p>\n<p>Sa coquille bossel\u00e9e, sa corne et son grand cou en font un Pok\u00e9mon facile \u00e0 reconna\u00eetre. Il a m\u00eame droit \u00e0 une forme Gigamax dans Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9p\u00e9e et Bouclier, preuve qu&rsquo;il n&rsquo;a jamais quitt\u00e9 le c\u0153ur des d\u00e9veloppeurs.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Battle Moment de Langbowang<\/h3>\n<p>La s\u00e9rie Battle Moment fige des Pok\u00e9mon connus en pleine action, chacun sur un sol \u00e0 son image. Ici, l&rsquo;\u00e9l\u00e9ment Glace est partout : la banquise opaque, les pics translucides, la surface de l&rsquo;eau fig\u00e9e. Le rendu donne envie de poser la figurine pr\u00e8s d&rsquo;une fen\u00eatre, \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re froide d&rsquo;un matin d&rsquo;hiver.<\/p>\n<p>La bo\u00eete, illustr\u00e9e, reprend le Pok\u00e9mon et le logo de la s\u00e9rie. Elle est assez jolie pour \u00eatre conserv\u00e9e par ceux qui aiment garder l&#8217;emballage.<\/p>\n<h3>Une vitrine de Pok\u00e9mon des mers<\/h3>\n<p>Lokhlass s&rsquo;accorde naturellement avec d&rsquo;autres Pok\u00e9mon aquatiques : la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-leviator\/\"><strong>figurine L\u00e9viator<\/strong><\/a>, bien plus agressive, ou le petit <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-tiplouf\/\"><strong>Tiplouf<\/strong><\/a> et son propre bloc de glace, qui forment une jolie sc\u00e8ne de banquise. Et pour rester dans la s\u00e9rie Attaque, il compl\u00e8te bien Tortank, l&rsquo;autre Pok\u00e9mon Eau de la gamme.<\/p>\n<p>Les fans de la premi\u00e8re g\u00e9n\u00e9ration appr\u00e9cieront aussi ce choix moins attendu que les starters : un Pok\u00e9mon que beaucoup ont utilis\u00e9 pour Surfer pendant toute leur aventure.<\/p>\n<p>La pose a aussi le m\u00e9rite de mettre en valeur sa carapace grise et bossel\u00e9e, souvent laiss\u00e9e dans l&rsquo;ombre sur les illustrations. Ici, on en voit bien les pointes, pos\u00e9es sur le dos comme les rochers d&rsquo;un \u00eelot, ce qui donne au Pok\u00e9mon un air de petite \u00eele vivante.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Langbowang \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Battle Moment (Attaque) \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Lokhlass (n\u00b0 0131) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete illustr\u00e9e \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6923517303928<\/p>\n<p>Une sc\u00e8ne fixe \u00e0 exposer. Les pics de glace sont fins : on la tient par le socle.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Dans le jeu, Lokhlass vous faisait traverser les mers de Kanto. Ici, il se contente de la travers\u00e9e de votre \u00e9tag\u00e8re, mais avec la m\u00eame \u00e9l\u00e9gance.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3900","regular_price":"3900","sale_price":"3900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">39,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93783,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdf