Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6717,"name":"Lokhlass","slug":"lokhlass"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12215,"name":"Langbowang","slug":"langbowang"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Lokhlass Attaque&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89127","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":8,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89127","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,76404,59926"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89127&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89126,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon L\u00e9viator","slug":"figurine-pokemon-leviator","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-leviator\/","sku":"6972407216022","short_description":"<p>La <strong>figurine L\u00e9viator<\/strong> Funism Prime Figure Mini montre le Pok\u00e9mon jaillissant d&rsquo;une vague en plastique transparent, gueule ouverte. Environ 10 cm de PVC, licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>La preuve que Magicarpe avait un plan depuis le d\u00e9but, et qu&rsquo;il fallait juste attendre le niveau 20.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine L\u00e9viator Funism : la revanche de Magicarpe<\/h2>\n<p>Il a fallu de la patience, des combats perdus et beaucoup de Trempette. Mais au niveau 20, Magicarpe devient L\u00e9viator, et plus personne ne rit. La <strong>figurine L\u00e9viator<\/strong> de Funism capte ce moment de puissance : le serpent de mer bleu surgit d&rsquo;une vague transparente, gueule grande ouverte.<\/p>\n<h3>Le n\u00b0130, Eau et Vol<\/h3>\n<p>L\u00e9viator porte le num\u00e9ro 130 du Pok\u00e9dex. Il est de type Eau et Vol, ce qui \u00e9tonne toujours un peu pour un Pok\u00e9mon qui ne poss\u00e8de pas d&rsquo;ailes.<\/p>\n<h3>Une vague en guise de socle<\/h3>\n<p>Funism a construit la figurine autour d&rsquo;un grand effet d&rsquo;eau en plastique transparent bleut\u00e9, qui enveloppe le corps du Pok\u00e9mon et donne toute la dynamique de la sc\u00e8ne. Le socle porte son nom anglais, Gyarados, et son nom chinois. La statuette mesure environ 10 cm.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est l&rsquo;une des figurines les plus dynamiques de la gamme Prime Figure Mini : on a vraiment l&rsquo;impression qu&rsquo;il va sortir de l&rsquo;eau.<\/p>\n<h3>L&rsquo;histoire compl\u00e8te en deux figurines<\/h3>\n<p>Pour raconter l&rsquo;\u00e9volution de bout en bout, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-magicarpe\/\"><strong>figurine Magicarpe de la m\u00eame gamme<\/strong><\/a> montre le point de d\u00e9part. Et pour d&rsquo;autres Pok\u00e9mon aquatiques, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-locklass-attaque\/\"><strong>figurine Lokhlass Attaque<\/strong><\/a> propose une sc\u00e8ne de combat en pleine mer.<\/p>\n<h3>M\u00e9ga-L\u00e9viator et le Lac Col\u00e8re<\/h3>\n<p>Depuis Pok\u00e9mon X et Y, L\u00e9viator peut aussi m\u00e9ga-\u00e9voluer en M\u00e9ga-L\u00e9viator, qui passe au type Eau et T\u00e9n\u00e8bres. Et dans Pok\u00e9mon Or et Argent, le Lac Col\u00e8re accueillait un L\u00e9viator rouge forc\u00e9 \u00e0 \u00e9voluer, l&rsquo;une des rencontres les plus m\u00e9morables de la deuxi\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration.<\/p>\n<p>Ce m\u00e9lange de puissance et de mauvaise humeur explique pourquoi L\u00e9viator reste un favori des collectionneurs : il fait partie des rares Pok\u00e9mon qui ont l&rsquo;air vraiment dangereux, m\u00eame en 10 cm.<\/p>\n<h3>Le serpent de mer en mouvement<\/h3>\n<p>Le corps de L\u00e9viator s&rsquo;enroule dans une grande vague bleue translucide, crocs et moustaches en avant, la cr\u00eate dress\u00e9e. C&rsquo;est une pose verticale, qui prend de la hauteur malgr\u00e9 la petite taille de la figurine. Pos\u00e9e \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de Magicarpe, elle cr\u00e9e un contraste imm\u00e9diat entre le petit poisson inoffensif et sa forme finale.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Fabricant : Funism. Collection : Prime Figure Mini. Mati\u00e8re : PVC, effet d&rsquo;eau transparent. Taille : environ 10 cm. Licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon. EAN : 6972407216022.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Selon le Pok\u00e9dex, la col\u00e8re de L\u00e9viator ne se calme qu&rsquo;une fois tout d\u00e9truit autour de lui. Rassurez-vous : la version Funism se contente de fixer votre \u00e9tag\u00e8re d&rsquo;un air mena\u00e7ant. C&rsquo;est d\u00e9j\u00e0 beaucoup.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93782,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-leviator-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon L\u00e9viator","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon L\u00e9viator"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12209,"name":"L\u00e9viator","slug":"leviator"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon L\u00e9viator&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89126","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":4,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89126","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89126&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89125,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin","slug":"figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin\/","sku":"6972913401301","short_description":"<p>Endormi sur un gros coussin rose, les mains sur le ventre et les rubans de v\u0153ux \u00e9tal\u00e9s autour de lui : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin<\/strong> de Langbowang montre le Pok\u00e9mon des souhaits en plein sommeil. Une petite figurine officielle de la s\u00e9rie Starry Dream, toute en douceur.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin : mille ans de sommeil, enfin bien install\u00e9<\/h2>\n<p>Quand on dort mille ans d&rsquo;affil\u00e9e, autant choisir un bon coussin. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin<\/strong> le montre allong\u00e9 sur un pouf rose tout rond, les yeux ferm\u00e9s, la bouche entrouverte, ses petites mains pos\u00e9es sur le ventre. Les rubans jaunes qui pendent de sa t\u00eate et de son dos s&rsquo;\u00e9talent autour de lui comme des draps.<\/p>\n<h3>Le Pok\u00e9mon des v\u0153ux<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0385 du Pok\u00e9dex, Jirachi est un Pok\u00e9mon fabuleux de type Acier et Psy, apparu dans Pok\u00e9mon Rubis et Saphir. Le Pok\u00e9dex raconte qu&rsquo;il ne se r\u00e9veille que sept jours tous les mille ans, et qu&rsquo;il exauce pendant ce court r\u00e9veil les souhaits \u00e9crits sur les \u00e9tiquettes accroch\u00e9es \u00e0 sa t\u00eate.<\/p>\n<p>Son \u00e9toile jaune et ses rubans s&rsquo;inspirent des petits papiers de v\u0153ux de la f\u00eate japonaise de Tanabata, qu&rsquo;on accroche aux branches de bambou. Comme Mew, il n&rsquo;\u00e9tait obtenu que lors d&rsquo;\u00e9v\u00e9nements ou de distributions sp\u00e9ciales, ce qui lui donne une aura particuli\u00e8re chez les collectionneurs.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Starry Dream de Langbowang<\/h3>\n<p>Starry Dream rassemble des Pok\u00e9mon endormis, chacun sur son coussin ou dans son lit. Les revendeurs la nomment Starry Dream ou Sleeping Pok\u00e9mon, et elle se reconna\u00eet \u00e0 ses couleurs pastel et \u00e0 ses formes arrondies.<\/p>\n<p>Le coussin de Jirachi est sculpt\u00e9 pour imiter le tissu, avec ses plis et son creux central. Le contraste entre le rose du pouf, le blanc de son corps et le jaune de ses rubans est particuli\u00e8rement doux.<\/p>\n<h3>Une figurine pour les r\u00eaveurs<\/h3>\n<p>Petite et calme, elle trouve naturellement sa place sur une table de chevet ou \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 d&rsquo;un \u00e9cran, l\u00e0 o\u00f9 l&rsquo;on a parfois besoin d&rsquo;une pause. Elle s&rsquo;accorde parfaitement avec la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-dodoala-coussin\/\"><strong>figurine Dodoala Coussin<\/strong><\/a> de la m\u00eame s\u00e9rie, autre grand dormeur du Pok\u00e9dex. Pour une ambiance encore plus douce, les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/jeux-jouets\/peluches-jeux\/peluches-pokemon\/\"><strong>peluches Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong><\/a> prennent le relais.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est aussi un joli petit cadeau, accessible, pour quelqu&rsquo;un qui aime Pok\u00e9mon sans forc\u00e9ment collectionner les grandes figurines.<\/p>\n<p>La sculpture du visage est particuli\u00e8rement r\u00e9ussie : les paupi\u00e8res ferm\u00e9es, le petit sourire et les joues rondes donnent l&rsquo;impression qu&rsquo;il fait un beau r\u00eave. M\u00eame l&rsquo;\u00e9toile \u00e0 trois branches de sa t\u00eate, souvent raide sur les figurines, retombe ici mollement, comme un bonnet de nuit.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Langbowang \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Starry Dream (Coussin) \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Jirachi (n\u00b0 0385) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6972913401301<\/p>\n<p>Pour l&rsquo;entretien, rien de compliqu\u00e9, m\u00eame pour une figurine aussi douce : le coussin est en PVC sculpt\u00e9, pas en tissu : un simple coup de pinceau suffit pour l&rsquo;entretenir.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Vous pouvez lui confier un v\u0153u, bien s\u00fbr. Mais vu le rythme de ses r\u00e9veils, mieux vaut ne pas \u00eatre press\u00e9.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1500","regular_price":"1500","sale_price":"1500","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">15,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93781,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-jirachi-coussin-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12218,"name":"Jirachi","slug":"jirachi"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12215,"name":"Langbowang","slug":"langbowang"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Jirachi Coussin&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89125","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":12,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89125","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89125&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89124,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur","slug":"figurine-pokemon-insecateur","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur\/","sku":"6971680455487","short_description":"<p>Ailes d\u00e9ploy\u00e9es et faux en avant : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur<\/strong> de Funism tranche l&rsquo;air au milieu de deux sillages verts translucides. Format Prime Figure Mini d&rsquo;environ 10 cm, avec son nom anglais <em>Scyther<\/em> sur la base verte et une bo\u00eete transparente.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur : deux faux, z\u00e9ro h\u00e9sitation<\/h2>\n<p>Ins\u00e9cateur n&rsquo;a pas de mains, il a des lames. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur<\/strong> le montre lanc\u00e9 vers l&rsquo;avant, les ailes transparentes ouvertes et les deux faux tendues, pendant que des tra\u00een\u00e9es vertes translucides dessinent le mouvement autour de lui. On croirait entendre le sifflement de Tranche.<\/p>\n<h3>Un ninja de la premi\u00e8re g\u00e9n\u00e9ration<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0123 du Pok\u00e9dex, Ins\u00e9cateur est de type Insecte et Vol. Le Pok\u00e9dex insiste sur sa vitesse, si grande qu&rsquo;elle rendrait ses mouvements presque invisibles, et sur ses faux qui deviennent plus tranchantes \u00e0 chaque combat. Dans Pok\u00e9mon Rouge, on ne pouvait l&rsquo;obtenir qu&rsquo;au Parc Safari ou au Casino de C\u00e9ladopole, ce qui le rendait d&rsquo;autant plus convoit\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Il a une particularit\u00e9 rare : deux \u00e9volutions possibles. \u00c9chang\u00e9 en tenant une Peau M\u00e9tal, il devient Cizayox, Insecte et Acier. Et depuis L\u00e9gendes Pok\u00e9mon : Arceus, une Obsidienne lui permet de devenir Hach\u00e9cateur, un b\u00fbcheron de pierre arm\u00e9 de haches.<\/p>\n<h3>Prime Figure Mini : la vitesse en plastique transparent<\/h3>\n<p>Rendre la vitesse dans une figurine fixe n&rsquo;est pas simple. Funism y parvient avec des arcs verts translucides qui partent du socle et s&rsquo;enroulent autour des jambes, comme les traces laiss\u00e9es par un coup de faux. Les ailes, elles aussi transparentes, laissent passer la lumi\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<p>La peinture garde les tons vert tendre du corps et le cr\u00e8me des faux et du ventre. Le socle vert porte son nom anglais et son nom chinois.<\/p>\n<h3>Avant l&rsquo;\u00e9change, apr\u00e8s l&rsquo;\u00e9change<\/h3>\n<p>Le duo \u00e9vident, c&rsquo;est Cizayox. La <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-cizayox\/\"><strong>figurine Cizayox<\/strong><\/a> du m\u00eame format montre ce qu&rsquo;il devient apr\u00e8s l&rsquo;\u00e9change : rouge, m\u00e9tallique, avec des pinces \u00e0 la place des faux. Les deux ensemble racontent une \u00e9volution que beaucoup de joueurs ont attendue en cherchant un ami pr\u00eat \u00e0 faire l&rsquo;\u00e9change.<\/p>\n<p>Seul, il s&rsquo;int\u00e8gre parfaitement \u00e0 une \u00e9tag\u00e8re de Pok\u00e9mon de Kanto, avec une \u00e9nergie que les starters, plus sages, n&rsquo;ont pas.<\/p>\n<p>Ceux qui ont jou\u00e9 \u00e0 L\u00e9gendes Arceus le voient sans doute aussi comme le Pok\u00e9mon qui, d&rsquo;un coup d&rsquo;aile, surgissait des hautes herbes pour attaquer le joueur. La figurine a gard\u00e9 cette impression de danger imminent.<\/p>\n<p>Les d\u00e9tails sculpt\u00e9s sont soign\u00e9s : les articulations des pattes, la cr\u00eate sur la t\u00eate et les motifs des ailes sont bien lisibles pour une figurine de ce format.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Prime Figure Mini \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Ins\u00e9cateur (n\u00b0 0123) \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 10 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete vitrine \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6971680455487<\/p>\n<p>Figurine de collection non articul\u00e9e. Les ailes et les effets translucides sont fins : on la saisit par le socle.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Rassurez-vous, ses faux sont en PVC et n&rsquo;ont jamais coup\u00e9 quoi que ce soit. Mais \u00e0 le voir, on pr\u00e9f\u00e8re quand m\u00eame ne pas le contrarier.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93780,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-insecateur-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12210,"name":"Ins\u00e9cateur","slug":"insecateur"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Ins\u00e9cateur&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89124","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89124","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89124&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89123,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago","slug":"figurine-pokemon-gromago","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-gromago\/","sku":"6971680457955","short_description":"<p>Un corps d&rsquo;or massif pos\u00e9 sur une pile de pi\u00e8ces : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago<\/strong> de Funism c\u00e9l\u00e8bre le Pok\u00e9mon n\u00b0 1000, mi-Acier, mi-Spectre, qui surfe sur son tr\u00e9sor. Environ 10 cm de PVC peint fa\u00e7on m\u00e9tal, pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s dans une bo\u00eete transparente.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago : le n\u00b0 1000 tout en or<\/h2>\n<p>Gromago brille, et il le sait. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago<\/strong> le repr\u00e9sente debout, les bras lev\u00e9s, sur un amas de pi\u00e8ces d&rsquo;or qui se d\u00e9verse au pied du socle. Son corps dor\u00e9, presque enti\u00e8rement fait de monnaie selon le Pok\u00e9dex, attrape la lumi\u00e8re sous tous les angles.<\/p>\n<h3>Le milli\u00e8me Pok\u00e9mon<\/h3>\n<p>Apparu dans Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9carlate et Violet, Gromago porte le num\u00e9ro 1000 du Pok\u00e9dex national, un symbole pour une licence qui a commenc\u00e9 avec 151 esp\u00e8ces. Il est de type Acier et Spectre, une combinaison rare qui lui donne de nombreuses immunit\u00e9s en combat.<\/p>\n<p>Son \u00e9volution est l&rsquo;une des plus originales de la s\u00e9rie. Il faut d&rsquo;abord trouver Mordudor, un petit Pok\u00e9mon cach\u00e9 dans des coffres, puis collecter 999 Pi\u00e8ces du Mordudor dispers\u00e9es dans la r\u00e9gion de Paldea. Beaucoup de joueurs ont pass\u00e9 des heures \u00e0 ramasser ces pi\u00e8ces, ce qui donne \u00e0 Gromago un parfum de r\u00e9compense.<\/p>\n<h3>Une Prime Figure Mini qui joue sur le m\u00e9tal<\/h3>\n<p>La peinture dor\u00e9e est le point fort de cette figurine. Funism a soign\u00e9 la surface pour qu&rsquo;elle paraisse m\u00e9tallique, avec des reflets plus sombres dans les creux. Les pi\u00e8ces qui l&rsquo;entourent, empil\u00e9es et \u00e9parpill\u00e9es, forment une vague fig\u00e9e au pied du personnage et rappellent son attaque Ru\u00e9e d&rsquo;Or.<\/p>\n<p>Le socle porte son nom anglais (<em>Gholdengo<\/em>) et son nom chinois, dans un bandeau bleu qui fait ressortir l&rsquo;or.<\/p>\n<h3>La neuvi\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration sur votre \u00e9tag\u00e8re<\/h3>\n<p>Pour repr\u00e9senter Paldea, Gromago a une voisine toute trouv\u00e9e : la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina\/\"><strong>figurine Forgelina<\/strong><\/a>, autre Pok\u00e9mon Acier d&rsquo;\u00c9carlate et Violet, arm\u00e9e de son marteau g\u00e9ant. Les deux ensemble rappellent que le Pok\u00e9dex ne s&rsquo;est pas arr\u00eat\u00e9 aux classiques de Kanto.<\/p>\n<p>Ses couleurs dor\u00e9es en font aussi un cadeau original pour les joueurs qui ont pass\u00e9 du temps sur la neuvi\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration, ou pour ceux qui aiment simplement les figurines qui brillent.<\/p>\n<p>Il a aussi trouv\u00e9 sa place dans le jeu comp\u00e9titif, o\u00f9 sa Ru\u00e9e d&rsquo;Or et son talent Corps en Or, qui le prot\u00e8ge des capacit\u00e9s de statut, en ont fait un choix fr\u00e9quent des joueurs.<\/p>\n<p>Le visage, avec son sourire satisfait, et le petit bonnet en forme de pi\u00e8ce sur sa t\u00eate sont bien rendus. On sent tout de suite le personnage s\u00fbr de lui.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Prime Figure Mini \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Gromago (n\u00b0 1000) \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 10 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete vitrine \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6971680457955<\/p>\n<p>Figurine statique. Pour garder l&rsquo;\u00e9clat de la peinture dor\u00e9e, un chiffon microfibre sec suffit.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Il a fallu 999 pi\u00e8ces pour l&rsquo;obtenir dans le jeu. Ici, une seule visite en boutique suffit, et on vous rend la monnaie.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93779,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-gromago-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12212,"name":"Gromago","slug":"gromago"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Gromago&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89123","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":3,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89123","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89123&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89122,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forg\u00e9lina","slug":"figurine-pokemon-forgelina","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina\/","sku":"6971680457979","short_description":"<p>Un marteau plus grand qu&rsquo;elle et une gerbe d&rsquo;eau \u00e0 l&rsquo;impact : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forgelina<\/strong> de Funism montre la forgeronne de Paldea en plein \u00e9lan. Une dizaine de centim\u00e8tres, une base violette marqu\u00e9e <em>Tinkaton<\/em> et un emballage transparent pour l&rsquo;exposer.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forgelina : petite taille, tr\u00e8s gros marteau<\/h2>\n<p>Forgelina ne fait pas dans la demi-mesure. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forgelina<\/strong> la saisit en plein mouvement, son marteau g\u00e9ant brandi derri\u00e8re elle, tandis que des \u00e9clats translucides jaillissent du socle comme si l&rsquo;outil venait de frapper le sol. Le contraste entre sa petite silhouette rose et cette masse \u00e9norme fait tout le charme du personnage.<\/p>\n<h3>Une forgeronne F\u00e9e et Acier<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0959 du Pok\u00e9dex, Forgelina est apparue dans Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9carlate et Violet. Elle est l&rsquo;\u00e9volution finale de Forgerette, puis de Forgella, une petite lign\u00e9e qui fabrique ses propres marteaux \u00e0 partir de morceaux de m\u00e9tal. Plus elle \u00e9volue, plus son marteau grossit.<\/p>\n<p>Le Pok\u00e9dex lui pr\u00eate un passe-temps tr\u00e8s particulier : elle frappe des rochers pour les envoyer dans le ciel, en visant les Corvaillus qui passent. Les joueurs l&rsquo;ont vite surnomm\u00e9e la terreur des oiseaux, et elle a gagn\u00e9 une vraie popularit\u00e9 pendant la sortie du jeu.<\/p>\n<h3>Le rendu Prime Figure Mini<\/h3>\n<p>Le marteau, peint en violet et gris avec ses reflets m\u00e9talliques, occupe une bonne moiti\u00e9 de la figurine. Funism a \u00e9quilibr\u00e9 l&rsquo;ensemble en pla\u00e7ant la gerbe translucide de l&rsquo;autre c\u00f4t\u00e9, ce qui donne une composition dynamique sans que la figurine paraisse bancale.<\/p>\n<p>Les d\u00e9tails du visage, les nattes roses et les tons blanc et rose du corps sont propres. Le socle affiche son nom anglais et son nom chinois.<\/p>\n<h3>Paldea \u00e0 l&rsquo;honneur<\/h3>\n<p>Pour une \u00e9tag\u00e8re consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 la neuvi\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration, elle forme un beau duo avec la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-gromago\/\"><strong>figurine Gromago<\/strong><\/a>, le Pok\u00e9mon n\u00b0 1000, lui aussi de type Acier. L&rsquo;or massif d&rsquo;un c\u00f4t\u00e9, le rose et le m\u00e9tal de l&rsquo;autre : deux fa\u00e7ons tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rentes de porter le m\u00eame type.<\/p>\n<p>Elle pla\u00eet aussi beaucoup aux joueurs comp\u00e9titifs, qui l&rsquo;ont vue briller en combat gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son attaque signature, Marteau Gigatonne, si puissante qu&rsquo;on ne peut pas l&rsquo;utiliser deux fois de suite.<\/p>\n<p>Sa silhouette compacte, presque ronde, la rend aussi facile \u00e0 placer : elle trouve sa place entre deux figurines plus hautes sans se faire oublier, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ce marteau qui d\u00e9passe toujours un peu du rang.<\/p>\n<p>Les petites dents pointues et l&rsquo;air faussement innocent de son visage contrastent d&rsquo;ailleurs tr\u00e8s bien avec la violence de la pose. Tout Forgelina tient dans ce d\u00e9calage entre une allure de poup\u00e9e et un temp\u00e9rament de d\u00e9molisseuse.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Prime Figure Mini \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Forgelina (n\u00b0 0959) \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 10 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete vitrine \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6971680457979<\/p>\n<p>Figurine de collection statique. Le marteau d\u00e9passe largement : on la prend par le socle pour la d\u00e9placer.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Si vous poss\u00e9dez des figurines de Corvaillus, on vous conseille de les ranger sur une autre \u00e9tag\u00e8re. Simple pr\u00e9caution.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93778,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-forgelina-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forg\u00e9lina","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forg\u00e9lina"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12213,"name":"Forgelina","slug":"forgelina"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Forg\u00e9lina&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89122","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89122","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89122&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89121,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino","slug":"figurine-pokemon-flambino","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-flambino\/","sku":"6970834313475","short_description":"<p>Pattes en feu et grand sourire : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino<\/strong> de Funism met le starter Feu de Galar en pleine course, port\u00e9 par des flammes translucides. Gamme Prime Figure Mini, une dizaine de centim\u00e8tres, socle orange et bo\u00eete vitrine num\u00e9rot\u00e9e 0813.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino : le lapin de Galar qui chauffe les crampons<\/h2>\n<p>Flambino ne marche pas, il sprinte. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino<\/strong> le montre bondissant, les bras \u00e9cart\u00e9s, au-dessus d&rsquo;un feu translucide qui lui l\u00e8che les pieds. Funism a parfaitement saisi l&rsquo;\u00e9nergie de ce lapin blanc au museau orange qui ne tient pas en place.<\/p>\n<h3>Un starter qui a le football dans le sang<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0813 du Pok\u00e9dex, Flambino est le Pok\u00e9mon de d\u00e9part Feu de Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9p\u00e9e et Bouclier, aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s d&rsquo;Ouistempo et de Larm\u00e9l\u00e9on. Sa r\u00e9gion, Galar, s&rsquo;inspire du Royaume-Uni, et ses combats d&rsquo;ar\u00e8ne se d\u00e9roulent dans de v\u00e9ritables stades.<\/p>\n<p>\u00c7a se voit dans sa lign\u00e9e : il \u00e9volue en Lapyro, puis en Pyrobut, qui jongle avec une boule de feu comme un attaquant avec son ballon. Flambino, lui, en est encore \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9chauffement, et les coussinets de ses pattes chauffent d\u00e8s qu&rsquo;il se met \u00e0 courir.<\/p>\n<h3>Le format Prime Figure Mini<\/h3>\n<p>La gamme de Funism associe chaque Pok\u00e9mon \u00e0 un effet de son type. Pour Flambino, les flammes sont plac\u00e9es sous lui, comme une piste br\u00fblante, ce qui all\u00e8ge la silhouette et met en valeur sa posture de coureur.<\/p>\n<p>Le socle orange affiche ses noms anglais (<em>Scorbunny<\/em>) et chinois. La bo\u00eete vitrine, d\u00e9cor\u00e9e d&rsquo;une illustration, porte son num\u00e9ro de Pok\u00e9dex.<\/p>\n<h3>Les autres starters Feu<\/h3>\n<p>Pour comparer les g\u00e9n\u00e9rations, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-salameche\/\"><strong>Salam\u00e8che<\/strong><\/a> existe dans la m\u00eame gamme, lui aussi au milieu des flammes. Ensemble, ils montrent bien comment chaque r\u00e9gion r\u00e9invente le starter Feu, du l\u00e9zard de Kanto au lapin footballeur de Galar.<\/p>\n<p>La sculpture est fid\u00e8le au design de Game Freak : le pansement sur le nez, les oreilles longues aux pointes orange et les pieds jaunes qui ressemblent \u00e0 des chaussures de sport. Ce sont ces petits d\u00e9tails qui donnent \u00e0 Flambino son air de gamin de quartier toujours pr\u00eat \u00e0 taper dans un ballon.<\/p>\n<p>La posture en mouvement, un pied en l&rsquo;air, change des figurines plant\u00e9es sur leur socle. On sent qu&rsquo;il va sortir du cadre au prochain mouvement.<\/p>\n<p>Ceux qui ont jou\u00e9 \u00e0 \u00c9p\u00e9e ou Bouclier se souviennent sans doute du moment o\u00f9 il a fallu choisir entre lui, le singe batteur et le l\u00e9zard aquatique. Avec cette figurine, au moins, on n&rsquo;a plus \u00e0 renoncer aux deux autres.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Prime Figure Mini \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> Flambino (n\u00b0 0813) \u00b7 <strong>Hauteur :<\/strong> environ 10 cm \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete vitrine \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6970834313475<\/p>\n<p>Figurine de collection statique, id\u00e9ale pour un bureau ou une vitrine. Les effets transparents se d\u00e9poussi\u00e8rent au pinceau.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Si vous jouez \u00e0 Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9p\u00e9e, vous savez d\u00e9j\u00e0 comment se finit son histoire : en Pyrobut, buteur attitr\u00e9 de l&rsquo;\u00e9quipe. Celui-ci en est encore au centre de formation, mais il a d\u00e9j\u00e0 le bon jeu de jambes.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93777,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-flambino-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6701,"name":"Flambino","slug":"flambino"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12206,"name":"Funism","slug":"funism"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon Flambino&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89121","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":6,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89121","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89120,89111,44935"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89121&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89120,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison","slug":"figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison\/","sku":"6923517312944","short_description":"<p>Install\u00e9e sur une bou\u00e9e ray\u00e9e rouge et blanc, les pattes au bord de l&rsquo;eau : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison<\/strong> de Langbowang offre au Pok\u00e9mon aux huit \u00e9volutions une vraie journ\u00e9e de vacances. Une sc\u00e8ne d&rsquo;\u00e9t\u00e9 en miniature, sous licence officielle.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison : les vacances avant l&rsquo;\u00e9volution<\/h2>\n<p>\u00c9voli a huit avenirs possibles, mais aujourd&rsquo;hui, il a d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de ne penser \u00e0 aucun. Cette <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison<\/strong> le montre assis sur une bou\u00e9e ray\u00e9e, pos\u00e9e sur une eau bleue et calme, la collerette bien gonfl\u00e9e et les oreilles dress\u00e9es. Un parfait petit air de vacances d&rsquo;\u00e9t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>La s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure de Langbowang<\/h3>\n<p>La s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure donne \u00e0 chaque Pok\u00e9mon son coin de nature \u00e0 lui. Apr\u00e8s la prairie fleurie de Pikachu et la mare de Bulbizarre, \u00c9voli a droit \u00e0 la baignade. La bo\u00eete, avec sa fen\u00eatre et ses illustrations, reprend le m\u00eame th\u00e8me.<\/p>\n<p>Le d\u00e9cor est volontairement simple : un disque d&rsquo;eau bleue, la bou\u00e9e et le Pok\u00e9mon. Ce d\u00e9pouillement met en valeur le pelage brun et cr\u00e8me, peint avec soin.<\/p>\n<h3>Un Pok\u00e9mon, huit destins<\/h3>\n<p>Num\u00e9ro 0133 du Pok\u00e9dex, \u00c9voli est connu pour son code g\u00e9n\u00e9tique instable, qui lui permet d&rsquo;\u00e9voluer en huit Pok\u00e9mon diff\u00e9rents : Aquali, Voltali, Pyroli, Mentali, Noctali, Phyllali, Givrali et Nymphali. Chacun d\u00e9pend d&rsquo;une pierre, d&rsquo;un lieu, d&rsquo;un moment de la journ\u00e9e ou du lien avec son dresseur.<\/p>\n<p>Cette richesse en fait l&rsquo;un des Pok\u00e9mon les plus collectionn\u00e9s : beaucoup de fans construisent toute une \u00e9tag\u00e8re autour de lui et de ses \u00e9volutions. Il a m\u00eame \u00e9t\u00e9 le partenaire de d\u00e9part de Pok\u00e9mon Let&rsquo;s Go \u00c9voli, sorti sur Switch.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour aller plus loin avec \u00c9voli<\/h3>\n<p>Pour d\u00e9couvrir ses \u00e9volutions, la bo\u00eete surprise <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-et-evolutions-mirroirs\/\"><strong>\u00c9voli et \u00e9volutions<\/strong><\/a> de Funism contient une figurine au hasard parmi la s\u00e9rie : de quoi agrandir la famille autour de ce vacancier. Et pour rester dans la s\u00e9rie Nature Adventure, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-pikachu-saison\/\"><strong>figurine Pikachu Saison<\/strong><\/a> forme avec lui un duo de saisons bien assorti.<\/p>\n<p>C&rsquo;est aussi une jolie id\u00e9e de cadeau pour un fan d&rsquo;\u00c9voli qui a d\u00e9j\u00e0 des figurines de combat : celle-ci apporte une note plus l\u00e9g\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<p>Vu de pr\u00e8s, la sculpture d&rsquo;\u00c9voli est tr\u00e8s expressive : les grands yeux bruns, la queue touffue au bout cr\u00e8me et la collerette \u00e9bouriff\u00e9e donnent du volume \u00e0 un personnage qu&rsquo;on repr\u00e9sente souvent de fa\u00e7on trop lisse. La bou\u00e9e, elle, est ray\u00e9e avec pr\u00e9cision, sans bavure entre le rouge et le blanc.<\/p>\n<p>Sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re, la figurine apporte une petite touche de couleur estivale, id\u00e9ale pour casser la monotonie d&rsquo;une collection de bo\u00eetes et de cartes.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Langbowang \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Nature Adventure (Saison) \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> \u00c9voli (n\u00b0 0133) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6923517312944<\/p>\n<p>Une figurine de d\u00e9coration, facile \u00e0 placer sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re ou un bureau.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Huit \u00e9volutions possibles, et il choisit la bou\u00e9e. On ne peut pas lui donner tort : les d\u00e9cisions importantes peuvent bien attendre la fin de l&rsquo;\u00e9t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93776,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison","alt":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison"}],"categories":[{"id":3873,"name":"Figurines Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"figurines-pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":13,"name":"Personnage","taxonomy":"pa_personnage","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6735,"name":"\u00c9voli","slug":"evoli"}]},{"id":12,"name":"Univers \/ M\u00e9dia","taxonomy":"pa_univers-media","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6682,"name":"Anime","slug":"anime"}]},{"id":41,"name":"Fabricant","taxonomy":"pa_fabricant","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12215,"name":"Langbowang","slug":"langbowang"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Taille","taxonomy":"pa_taille","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12164,"name":"Moins de 15 cm","slug":"moins-de-15-cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli Saison&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89120","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89120","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89130,89111,44935,89140"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89120&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89118,"name":"Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli et \u00e9volutions \u2013 Bo\u00eete myst\u00e8re Let&rsquo;s Go! \u00c9voli","slug":"figurine-pokemon-evoli-et-evolutions-mirroirs","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-et-evolutions-mirroirs\/","sku":"6971680456699","short_description":"<p>Une bo\u00eete, une surprise : la <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli et \u00e9volutions<\/strong> de Funism est une bo\u00eete myst\u00e8re de la s\u00e9rie \u00ab Let&rsquo;s Go! \u00c9voli \u00bb, qui contient une figurine au hasard parmi les mod\u00e8les de la collection. \u00c9voli ou l&rsquo;une de ses \u00e9volutions : on ne sait qu&rsquo;\u00e0 l&rsquo;ouverture.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli et \u00e9volutions : la bo\u00eete myst\u00e8re de la famille \u00c9voli<\/h2>\n<p>\u00c9voli a huit \u00e9volutions possibles, et cette bo\u00eete joue pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment sur cette id\u00e9e. La <strong>figurine Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9voli et \u00e9volutions<\/strong> de Funism est une <em>blind box<\/em> de la s\u00e9rie \u00ab Let&rsquo;s Go! \u00c9voli \u00bb : chaque bo\u00eete contient une figurine choisie au hasard parmi les mod\u00e8les de la collection, illustr\u00e9s sur l&#8217;emballage. C&rsquo;est \u00e0 l&rsquo;ouverture qu&rsquo;on d\u00e9couvre qui nous attend.<\/p>\n<h3>Comment fonctionne une bo\u00eete myst\u00e8re<\/h3>\n<p>Le principe est simple : les bo\u00eetes sont scell\u00e9es et identiques, et le personnage \u00e0 l&rsquo;int\u00e9rieur n&rsquo;est pas indiqu\u00e9. Chez le fabricant, la s\u00e9rie est conditionn\u00e9e en pr\u00e9sentoirs de neuf bo\u00eetes, chacune avec un mod\u00e8le diff\u00e9rent. Acheter une seule bo\u00eete, c&rsquo;est donc tenter sa chance pour l&rsquo;un des membres de la famille.<\/p>\n<p>Ce format pla\u00eet autant aux collectionneurs qui veulent compl\u00e9ter la s\u00e9rie qu&rsquo;aux fans qui aiment la petite \u00e9motion de l&rsquo;ouverture. Il fait aussi un joli cadeau, \u00e0 offrir ferm\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Huit destins pour un m\u00eame Pok\u00e9mon<\/h3>\n<p>\u00c9voli, num\u00e9ro 0133, poss\u00e8de un ADN si changeant qu&rsquo;il peut devenir Aquali, Voltali, Pyroli, Mentali, Noctali, Phyllali, Givrali ou Nymphali. Pierre d&rsquo;\u00e9volution, lieu pr\u00e9cis, heure du jour ou affection : chacune a sa condition.<\/p>\n<p>Cette famille aux types vari\u00e9s, de l&rsquo;Eau aux T\u00e9n\u00e8bres en passant par la F\u00e9e, est l&rsquo;une des plus collectionn\u00e9es de la licence. Beaucoup de fans ont leur \u00e9volution pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e, et c&rsquo;est tout le sel de la bo\u00eete myst\u00e8re : tomber sur la sienne, ou d\u00e9couvrir un coup de c\u0153ur inattendu.<\/p>\n<h3>Funism et Pok\u00e9mon<\/h3>\n<p>Funism, fabricant sous licence officielle Pok\u00e9mon, est aussi derri\u00e8re la gamme Prime Figure Mini pr\u00e9sente dans notre rayon. Ces bo\u00eetes myst\u00e8re reprennent le m\u00eame soin des couleurs dans un format plus petit, pens\u00e9 pour \u00eatre collectionn\u00e9 en s\u00e9rie.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour compl\u00e9ter la collection<\/h3>\n<p>Pour un \u00c9voli dont on conna\u00eet d&rsquo;avance le contenu, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/figurine-pokemon-evoli-saison\/\"><strong>figurine \u00c9voli Saison<\/strong><\/a> de Langbowang le montre en vacances sur sa bou\u00e9e. Et pour l&rsquo;entourer d&rsquo;autres Pok\u00e9mon de Kanto en petit format, le rayon <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/figurines\/figurines-mangas\/figurines-pokemon\/\"><strong>figurines Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong><\/a> rassemble de nombreux mod\u00e8les \u00e0 exposer \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>L&#8217;emballage lui-m\u00eame est soign\u00e9 : illustration d&rsquo;\u00c9voli en grand sur la face avant, aper\u00e7u des mod\u00e8les sur le c\u00f4t\u00e9 et logos officiels. Ferm\u00e9e, la bo\u00eete se pose facilement sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re en attendant le bon moment pour l&rsquo;ouvrir, et elle fait un petit paquet-cadeau tout trouv\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Fabricant :<\/strong> Funism \u00b7 <strong>Gamme :<\/strong> Blind box \u00ab Let&rsquo;s Go! \u00c9voli \u00bb \u00b7 <strong>Personnage :<\/strong> \u00c9voli ou l&rsquo;une de ses \u00e9volutions (au hasard) \u00b7 <strong>Mati\u00e8re :<\/strong> PVC \u00b7 <strong>Pr\u00e9sentation :<\/strong> bo\u00eete myst\u00e8re scell\u00e9e \u00b7 <strong>EAN :<\/strong> 6971680456699<\/p>\n<p>Vendue \u00e0 l&rsquo;unit\u00e9 : une bo\u00eete contient une seule figurine, choisie au hasard. Le mod\u00e8le ne peut \u00eatre ni choisi ni \u00e9chang\u00e9.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Le jeu est simple : si vous tombez sur votre \u00e9volution pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e, c&rsquo;est le destin. Sinon, c&rsquo;est le signe qu&rsquo;il vous en faut une deuxi\u00e8me.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"