500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Display Pok\u00e9mon ME04 Chaos Ascendant 36 Boosters","alt":"Display Pok\u00e9mon ME04 Chaos Ascendant 36 Boosters \u2013 visuel du produit"}],"categories":[{"id":2177,"name":"Cartes Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon-cartes","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/"},{"id":2630,"name":"Displays Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"displays-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/displays-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12060,"name":"Display","slug":"display"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12079,"name":"Chaos Ascendant","slug":"chaos-ascendant"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Display Pok\u00e9mon ME04 Chaos Ascendant 36 Boosters&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89015","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":27,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89015","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89032,89578,89007,89005"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=90931,89434,89714,89183"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89015&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89012,"name":"Double Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon World Championships London 2022","slug":"deck-box-pokemon-center-londres","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/deck-box-pokemon-center-londres\/","sku":"820650069475","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon Londres<\/strong> r\u00e9unit deux bo\u00eetes pour decks dans un \u00e9tui commun inspir\u00e9 des Worlds 2022. Une fa\u00e7on pratique de transporter deux jeux, avec en prime un vrai souvenir d\u2019un \u00e9v\u00e9nement historique Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon Londres : deux decks, un seul \u00e9tui<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon Londres<\/strong> aurait pu \u00eatre une simple bo\u00eete destin\u00e9e \u00e0 transporter deux decks Pok\u00e9mon. Sauf qu\u2019il vient des <strong>Championnats du Monde Pok\u00e9mon 2022 de Londres<\/strong>, premi\u00e8re \u00e9dition des Worlds organis\u00e9e hors d\u2019Am\u00e9rique du Nord.<\/p>\n<p>Tout de suite, ranger ses cartes dedans prend une petite dimension suppl\u00e9mentaire.<\/p>\n<h2>Deux deck boxes dans un seul ensemble<\/h2>\n<p>Le coffret comprend <strong>deux deck boxes<\/strong>, leur \u00e9tui commun et <strong>trois s\u00e9parateurs<\/strong>. Il peut accueillir deux decks de 60 cartes prot\u00e9g\u00e9es par des sleeves, avec une fermeture magn\u00e9tique pour maintenir l\u2019ensemble ferm\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Donc vous pouvez transporter deux decks diff\u00e9rents. Un deck principal et celui que vous \u00eates encore en train de tester. Deux couleurs. Deux strat\u00e9gies. Ou simplement le m\u00eame probl\u00e8me que connaissent beaucoup de joueurs :<\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00ab Je d\u00e9monte celui-l\u00e0 pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer les cartes\u2026 ou j\u2019en monte un deuxi\u00e8me ? \u00bb<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Pok\u00e9mon a gentiment fourni deux bo\u00eetes. Nous vous laissons g\u00e9rer la conclusion.<\/p>\n<h2>Londres 2022 sur la table de jeu<\/h2>\n<p>Le design est directement li\u00e9 aux Worlds de Londres. C\u2019est ce qui le distingue d\u2019une deck box Pok\u00e9mon classique : au d\u00e9part, vous avez un accessoire fonctionnel ; quelques ann\u00e9es plus tard, vous avez aussi un objet attach\u00e9 \u00e0 une date et \u00e0 un \u00e9v\u00e9nement pr\u00e9cis.<\/p>\n<p>\u00ab Je l\u2019utilise, c\u2019est fait pour \u00e7a. \u00bb Logique. Puis : \u00ab Je vais quand m\u00eame \u00e9viter de l\u2019ab\u00eemer. \u00bb Toujours logique. Quelques semaines plus tard, vous \u00eates capable de demander aux autres de ne pas poser leur boisson \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>L\u2019\u00e9volution est assez rapide.<\/p>\n<h2>Le probl\u00e8me de la deuxi\u00e8me bo\u00eete vide<\/h2>\n<p>Lorsque vous n\u2019avez qu\u2019un seul deck mont\u00e9, il reste une deck box vide juste \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9. Normalement, cela signifie simplement que vous avez de la place disponible.<\/p>\n<p>Normalement.<\/p>\n<p>Mais un joueur de TCG peut \u00e9galement traduire cette information par : <strong>\u00ab Ce serait quand m\u00eame pratique d\u2019avoir un deuxi\u00e8me deck pr\u00eat \u00e0 jouer. \u00bb<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Nous tenons \u00e0 pr\u00e9ciser que le produit ne contient aucun deck suppl\u00e9mentaire. Le raisonnement, lui, est fourni gratuitement.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Licence :<\/strong> Pok\u00e9mon<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u00c9v\u00e9nement :<\/strong> World Championships Londres 2022<\/li>\n<li><strong>Contenu :<\/strong> 2 deck boxes, \u00e9tui commun et 3 s\u00e9parateurs<\/li>\n<li><strong>Fermeture :<\/strong> magn\u00e9tique<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 820650069475<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#9654;&nbsp; Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>Dans dix ans, le Deck Box remplira toujours sa fonction. Londres 2022, en revanche, sera encore dix ans plus loin. Et soudain, la petite bo\u00eete destin\u00e9e \u00e0 transporter des cartes para\u00eet beaucoup moins banale.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"6900","regular_price":"6900","sale_price":"6900","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">69,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93267,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/double-deck-box-pokemon-world-championships-london-2022-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Double Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon World Championships London 2022","alt":"Double Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon World Championships London 2022, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":2622,"name":"Deck Box","slug":"deck-box","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/deck-box\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12056,"name":"Deck","slug":"deck"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Double Deck Box Pok\u00e9mon World Championships London 2022&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89012","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":3,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89012","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=76404,82164,89035,25072"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88977,89465,78164,89578"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89012&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89009,"name":"Coffret Pok\u00e9mon Ultra Premium Collection 25 Ans","slug":"coffret-pokemon-ultra-premium-collection-25-ans","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-ultra-premium-collection-25-ans\/","sku":"820650554018","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Collection Ultra-Premium C\u00e9l\u00e9brations<\/strong> est le coffret le plus complet des 25 ans du JCC Pok\u00e9mon : deux cartes en m\u00e9tal de Pikachu et Dracaufeu du Set de Base, 17 boosters C\u00e9l\u00e9brations, 8 boosters suppl\u00e9mentaires et des cartes dor\u00e9es.<\/p>\n<p>Une pi\u00e8ce de collection sortie fin 2021, ici en version fran\u00e7aise.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Collection Ultra-Premium C\u00e9l\u00e9brations : le coffret des 25 ans<\/h2>\n<p>Pour f\u00eater les 25 ans du JCC Pok\u00e9mon, The Pok\u00e9mon Company a sorti au quatri\u00e8me trimestre 2021 un coffret \u00e0 part. La <strong>Collection Ultra-Premium C\u00e9l\u00e9brations<\/strong> met \u00e0 l&rsquo;honneur les deux Pok\u00e9mon les plus embl\u00e9matiques du jeu : Pikachu et Dracaufeu, dans leur apparence d&rsquo;origine.<\/p>\n<h3>Les cartes en m\u00e9tal du Set de Base<\/h3>\n<p>La pi\u00e8ce ma\u00eetresse du coffret, ce sont deux cartes souvenirs en m\u00e9tal : le Pikachu et le Dracaufeu du Set de Base, la toute premi\u00e8re extension du jeu. Les m\u00eames illustrations que les cartes de 1996 au Japon, reproduites dans une mati\u00e8re qui ne s&rsquo;ab\u00eeme pas. Pour beaucoup de collectionneurs, c&rsquo;est la fa\u00e7on la plus simple d&rsquo;avoir le Dracaufeu du Set de Base dans sa vitrine.<\/p>\n<h3>Des cartes dor\u00e9es et beaucoup de boosters<\/h3>\n<p>Le coffret contient aussi une version dor\u00e9e sp\u00e9ciale de Pikachu-V et une version dor\u00e9e de la carte Pok\u00e9 Ball, toutes deux jouables. C\u00f4t\u00e9 ouverture, il y a de quoi faire : 17 boosters C\u00e9l\u00e9brations de 4 cartes et 8 boosters suppl\u00e9mentaires du JCC Pok\u00e9mon, soit 25 boosters au total.<\/p>\n<h3>Le reste du contenu<\/h3>\n<p>On y trouve encore un pin&rsquo;s color\u00e9 de Dracaufeu et Pikachu, une pi\u00e8ce Pok\u00e9mon en m\u00e9tal, un guide des m\u00e9caniques de jeu depuis les d\u00e9buts du JCC, trois bo\u00eetes de rangement et une carte \u00e0 code pour le JCC Pok\u00e9mon Online. Le packaging, tr\u00e8s soign\u00e9, fait partie de l&rsquo;objet.<\/p>\n<h3>Une vraie pi\u00e8ce de collection<\/h3>\n<p>Sorti fin 2021, ce coffret s&rsquo;adresse aux collectionneurs qui veulent un souvenir fort des 25 ans, scell\u00e9 ou ouvert. Notre exemplaire est en version fran\u00e7aise. Il peut se voir en boutique \u00e0 Nyon avant achat : n&rsquo;h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 passer ou \u00e0 nous \u00e9crire.<\/p>\n<p>D&rsquo;autres produits de l&rsquo;anniversaire sont en boutique, comme le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-celebrations-25-ans-pikachu-v-union\/\"><strong>Coffret C\u00e9l\u00e9brations Pikachu-V-UNION<\/strong><\/a> et l&rsquo;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-coffret-pokemon-dresseur-delite-celebrations-25-ans\/\"><strong>ETB C\u00e9l\u00e9brations<\/strong><\/a>. L&rsquo;extension est d\u00e9taill\u00e9e sur la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/celebrations\/\"><strong>C\u00e9l\u00e9brations<\/strong><\/a>, et tous les coffrets sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/coffrets-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>coffrets Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Collection Ultra-Premium C\u00e9l\u00e9brations, version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 2 cartes souvenirs en m\u00e9tal (Pikachu et Dracaufeu du Set de Base), 1 Pikachu-V dor\u00e9, 1 Pok\u00e9 Ball dor\u00e9e, 1 pin&rsquo;s Dracaufeu et Pikachu, 1 pi\u00e8ce en m\u00e9tal, 17 boosters C\u00e9l\u00e9brations de 4 cartes, 8 boosters suppl\u00e9mentaires, 1 guide, 3 bo\u00eetes de rangement, 1 carte \u00e0 code. Sortie : 4e trimestre 2021. EAN : 820650554018.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Dix-sept boosters C\u00e9l\u00e9brations plus huit boosters suppl\u00e9mentaires : vingt-cinq au total, autant que d&rsquo;ann\u00e9es f\u00eat\u00e9es par ce coffret.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"150000","regular_price":"150000","sale_price":"150000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1500,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93661,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/coffret-pokemon-ultra-premium-collection-25-ans-nyon.webp","th