name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12052,"name":"Coffret","slug":"coffret"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12066,"name":"\u00c9carlate et Violet","slug":"ecarlate-et-violet"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12070,"name":"Aventures Ensemble","slug":"aventures-ensemble"},{"id":12071,"name":"\u00c9carlate et Violet","slug":"ecarlate-et-violet"},{"id":12074,"name":"Flammes Obsidiennes","slug":"flammes-obsidiennes"},{"id":12076,"name":"Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es","slug":"rivalites-destinees"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Coffret Pok\u00e9mon F\u00e9linferno Ex Et Torterra Ex&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=88998","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":3,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/88998","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89000,88999,88352,89007"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89428,89183,91139,89714"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=88998&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":88985,"name":"Bundle Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait","slug":"bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/","sku":"196214136878","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>lot de 6 boosters \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> (bundle) r\u00e9unit six boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME03 dans une petite bo\u00eete illustr\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Le juste milieu entre le tripack et le display : 60 cartes et 6 \u00c9nergies \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Lot de 6 boosters \u00c9quilibre Parfait : l&rsquo;ouverture du week-end<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>lot de 6 boosters \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong>, souvent appel\u00e9 \u00ab bundle \u00bb, est un format officiel du JCC Pok\u00e9mon : une bo\u00eete en carton qui contient six boosters de l&rsquo;extension ME03, sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 27 mars 2026. Pas d&rsquo;accessoires, pas de promo, juste des boosters, et c&rsquo;est tr\u00e8s bien comme \u00e7a.<\/p>\n<h3>Pourquoi six boosters ?<\/h3>\n<p>Six boosters, c&rsquo;est 60 cartes et 6 \u00c9nergies de base. Assez pour faire une vraie s\u00e9ance d&rsquo;ouverture \u00e0 deux, sans le budget d&rsquo;un display. Les joueurs y voient aussi un bon moyen de r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer les cartes Dresseur de l&rsquo;extension en plusieurs exemplaires. Et pour un cadeau, la bo\u00eete est plus pr\u00e9sentable qu&rsquo;un sachet de boosters en vrac.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce qu&rsquo;on peut croiser dans \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/h3>\n<p>Le gardien de l&rsquo;extension est M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex, le Pok\u00e9mon de l&rsquo;Ordre. Autour de lui, M\u00e9ga-M\u00e9lodelfe-ex, M\u00e9ga-Staross-ex et Miaouss-ex font vivre la ville. La bo\u00eete elle-m\u00eame reprend ces visuels : Miaouss y c\u00f4toie Zygarde et les autres vedettes du set. Pour ceux qui ont jou\u00e9 \u00e0 Pok\u00e9mon X et Y en 2013, Zygarde \u00e9tait le troisi\u00e8me l\u00e9gendaire de Kalos, longtemps rest\u00e9 dans l&rsquo;ombre de Xerneas et Yveltal. Il prend ici sa revanche.<\/p>\n<h3>Un format malin pour les collectionneurs<\/h3>\n<p>Beaucoup de collectionneurs alternent les formats : un ETB pour la promo et les accessoires, puis des lots de 6 pour compl\u00e9ter la liste. C&rsquo;est souvent plus souple que de se lancer d&rsquo;un coup dans 36 boosters, surtout quand on suit plusieurs extensions en m\u00eame temps.<\/p>\n<h3>Ouvrir maintenant ou plus tard ?<\/h3>\n<p>La bo\u00eete se range facilement et garde les boosters \u00e0 l&rsquo;abri. On peut en ouvrir deux le samedi, deux le dimanche et garder les derniers pour une occasion. En th\u00e9orie.<\/p>\n<p>L&rsquo;extension est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e sur la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/equilibre-parfait\/\"><strong>\u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a>. Pour plus petit, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me3\/\"><strong>Tripack \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a> ajoute une promo ; pour plus grand, le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/display-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/\"><strong>Display \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a> monte \u00e0 36 boosters. Les autres formats sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>boosters Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Lot de boosters M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 \u00c9quilibre Parfait (ME03), version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 6 boosters de 10 cartes + 1 \u00c9nergie de base. Sortie : 27 mars 2026. EAN : 196214136878.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Zygarde surveille l&rsquo;\u00e9quilibre des \u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes. Il n&rsquo;a jamais pr\u00e9cis\u00e9 s&rsquo;il surveillait aussi l&rsquo;\u00e9quilibre entre les boosters ouverts et ceux qu&rsquo;on avait promis de garder.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3990","regular_price":"3990","sale_price":"3990","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">39,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":90934,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03.webp 1000w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03.webp 1000w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03","alt":"Bundle Pok\u00e9mon \u00c9quilibre Parfait ME03"}],"categories":[{"id":6518,"name":"Bundles Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"bundles-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/bundles-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12064,"name":"Bundle","slug":"bundle"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12082,"name":"\u00c9quilibre Parfait","slug":"equilibre-parfait"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Bundle Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=88985","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":5,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/88985","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89021,89034,89007,89003"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=88985&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":88977,"name":"Booster Pok\u00e9mon EV10 Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es","slug":"booster-pokemon-destinees-rivales-ev10","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/booster-pokemon-destinees-rivales-ev10\/","sku":"196214128989","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>booster Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong> contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base de l&rsquo;extension EV10.<\/p>\n<p>H\u00e9ros ou Team Rocket : chaque booster peut faire pencher la balance.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Booster Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es : \u00e0 quel camp appartient ce booster ?<\/h2>\n<p>Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es, extension EV10 sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 30 mai 2025, a donn\u00e9 \u00e0 la Team Rocket le r\u00f4le principal. Le <strong>booster Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong> est la mani\u00e8re la plus simple d&rsquo;y go\u00fbter : un sachet, dix cartes, une \u00c9nergie de base, et la question de savoir qui l&#8217;emporte, les h\u00e9ros ou les sbires de Giovanni.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce que l&rsquo;extension r\u00e9serve<\/h3>\n<p>C\u00f4t\u00e9 h\u00e9ros, Cynthia et son Carchacrok-ex, Luth avec Ho-Oh-ex ou Pepper avec Dogrino-ex. C\u00f4t\u00e9 obscur, Mewtwo-ex de la Team Rocket, sous le contr\u00f4le de Giovanni, et toute une troupe de Pok\u00e9mon marqu\u00e9s du R. L&rsquo;extension d\u00e9passe les 240 cartes, avec 85 Pok\u00e9mon de Dresseurs et Dresseuses : de quoi trouver un visage connu dans presque chaque booster.<\/p>\n<h3>Cynthia, la championne de toujours<\/h3>\n<p>Cynthia est la Ma\u00eetre de la Ligue de Sinnoh dans Pok\u00e9mon Diamant et Perle. Son \u00e9quipe, men\u00e9e par Carchacrok, a laiss\u00e9 un souvenir cuisant \u00e0 toute une g\u00e9n\u00e9ration : beaucoup de joueurs se rappellent avoir d\u00fb recommencer plusieurs fois le combat final. Elle reste l&rsquo;un des personnages pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s des fans, et son Carchacrok-ex est l&rsquo;une des cartes les plus attendues de l&rsquo;extension.<\/p>\n<h3>L&#8217;emballage<\/h3>\n<p>Le booster est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 avec l&rsquo;illustration de Mewtwo et de Giovanni, en costume, sur fond rose et violet. Une image qui r\u00e9sume bien l&rsquo;extension : \u00e9l\u00e9gante, un peu mena\u00e7ante, et tr\u00e8s Team Rocket.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour qui ?<\/h3>\n<p>Pour ceux qui veulent voir l&rsquo;extension avant de prendre un plus gros format, pour les enfants qui d\u00e9couvrent Jessie, James et Miaouss en carte, et pour tous ceux qui prennent \u00ab un dernier booster \u00bb au passage en caisse.<\/p>\n<p>L&rsquo;extension est d\u00e9taill\u00e9e sur la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/rivalites-destinees\/\"><strong>Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong><\/a>. Pour en ouvrir plus : le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-rivalites-destinees-ev10\/\"><strong>Tripack Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es<\/strong><\/a> ou la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/pokebox-pokemon-rivalites-destinees-3-modeles\/\"><strong>Bo\u00eete Team Rocket<\/strong><\/a>. La version anglaise existe en <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-pokemon-coffret-dresseur-destined-rivals-ev10\/\"><strong>ETB Destined Rivals<\/strong><\/a>. Tous les boosters sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>boosters Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Booster \u00c9carlate et Violet \u2013 Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es (EV10), version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 10 cartes + 1 \u00c9nergie de base. Sortie : 30 mai 2025. EAN : 196214128989.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Prepare for trouble, make it double, disait la Team Rocket en VO. En version booster, on se contente de pr\u00e9parer les ciseaux.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"890","regular_price":"890","sale_price":"890","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">8,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93750,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-ev10-rivalites-destinees-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon EV10 Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es","alt":"Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon EV10 Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es \u2013 visuel du produit"}],"categories":[{"id":2626,"name":"Boosters Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"boosters-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12059,"name":"Booster","slug":"booster"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12066,"name":"\u00c9carlate et Violet","slug":"ecarlate-et-violet"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12076,"name":"Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es","slug":"rivalites-destinees"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Booster Pok\u00e9mon EV10 Rivalit\u00e9s Destin\u00e9es&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=88977","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":78,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/88977","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89004,89000,88999,88998"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=88977&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":88971,"name":"Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon ME05 Nuit Noire","slug":"booster-blister-carton-nuit-noire-me05","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/booster-blister-carton-nuit-noire-me05\/","sku":"196214142763","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>booster Nuit Noire<\/strong> en blister carton contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base de l&rsquo;extension ME05.<\/p>\n<p>Une petite chance de croiser M\u00e9ga-Darkrai-ex, sans attendre la tomb\u00e9e de la nuit.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Booster Nuit Noire : ouvrir dans le noir, ou presque<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>booster Nuit Noire<\/strong> est la porte d&rsquo;entr\u00e9e de l&rsquo;extension ME05 du JCC Pok\u00e9mon, sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 17 juillet 2026. Il est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 en blister carton, avec plusieurs illustrations d&#8217;emballage aux couleurs sombres de l&rsquo;extension.<\/p>\n<h3>Dix cartes et une \u00c9nergie<\/h3>\n<p>Comme tous les boosters du bloc M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution, il contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base. Nuit Noire compte plus de 115 cartes, dont plus de 35 illustrations sp\u00e9ciales. Les Pok\u00e9mon-ex M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution de l&rsquo;extension ont une finition textur\u00e9e, que l&rsquo;on reconna\u00eet du bout des doigts.<\/p>\n<h3>Zeraora, l&rsquo;\u00e9clair qui r\u00e9pond \u00e0 la nuit<\/h3>\n<p>Face \u00e0 M\u00e9ga-Darkrai-ex, l&rsquo;extension met en avant M\u00e9ga-Zeraora-ex. Zeraora est un Pok\u00e9mon fabuleux d&rsquo;Alola, de type \u00c9lectrik, r\u00e9v\u00e9l\u00e9 en 2018. Il a eu droit \u00e0 son propre film, \u00ab Pok\u00e9mon : Le Pouvoir est en nous \u00bb, o\u00f9 il prot\u00e8ge une ville qui le craint. Rapide, nerveux, avec ses griffes charg\u00e9es d&rsquo;\u00e9lectricit\u00e9, il est le parfait contrepoids de Darkrai : la lumi\u00e8re contre l&rsquo;ombre, version Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<h3>Les visuels du blister<\/h3>\n<p>Les emballages reprennent les vedettes de l&rsquo;extension sur fond nocturne. Le visuel est attribu\u00e9 au hasard, comme toujours. Les collectionneurs de boosters vides en gardent souvent un de chaque, rang\u00e9s \u00e0 plat dans un classeur.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour qui ?<\/h3>\n<p>Pour tenter sa chance \u00e0 petit prix, pour faire d\u00e9couvrir le jeu \u00e0 un enfant, pour compl\u00e9ter un classeur carte par carte. Un booster, c&rsquo;est aussi la petite attention qu&rsquo;on glisse dans un cadeau plus grand, ou la r\u00e9compense apr\u00e8s une bonne note.<\/p>\n<p>La page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/nuit-noire\/\"><strong>Nuit Noire<\/strong><\/a> pr\u00e9sente toute l&rsquo;extension. Pour en ouvrir plus : le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/duopack-me04-me05-zarude\/\"><strong>Duopack Zarude<\/strong><\/a>, l&rsquo;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-pokemon-coffret-dresseur-delite-nuit-noire-me05\/\"><strong>ETB Nuit Noire<\/strong><\/a> ou le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/display-nuit-noire-me05\/\"><strong>Display Nuit Noire<\/strong><\/a>. Retrouvez aussi nos <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>boosters Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Booster M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 Nuit Noire (ME05) en blister carton, version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 10 cartes + 1 \u00c9nergie de base. Illustration de l&#8217;emballage au hasard. Sortie : 17 juillet 2026. EAN : 196214142763.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Conseil de la boutique : ouvrez-le avec la lumi\u00e8re allum\u00e9e. Les cartes textur\u00e9es se voient mieux, et Darkrai fait moins peur.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"690","regular_price":"690","sale_price":"690","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">6,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93657,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me05-nuit-noire-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon ME05 Nuit Noire","alt":"Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon ME05 Nuit Noire \u2013 visuel du produit"}],"categories":[{"id":2626,"name":"Boosters Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"boosters-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12059,"name":"Booster","slug":"booster"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]},{"id":39,"name":"Extension","taxonomy":"pa_extension","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12080,"name":"Nuit Noire","slug":"nuit-noire"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon ME05 Nuit Noire&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=88971","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":75,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/88971","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89021,89020,89015,88374"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89183,91139,91068,89434"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=88971&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":88968,"name":"Booster Blister Pok\u00e9mon ME03 Equilibre Parfait","slug":"blister-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me3","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/blister-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me3\/","sku":"196214136953","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>booster \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> en blister carton contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base de l&rsquo;extension ME03.<\/p>\n<p>Le format \u00e0 l&rsquo;unit\u00e9 pour tenter sa chance sur M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex, avec plusieurs illustrations d&#8217;emballage.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Booster \u00c9quilibre Parfait : une carte, une chance, une ville enti\u00e8re<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>booster \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong> est le format le plus simple pour d\u00e9couvrir l&rsquo;extension ME03 du JCC Pok\u00e9mon, sortie en fran\u00e7ais le 27 mars 2026. Celui-ci est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 en blister carton, une coque qui prot\u00e8ge le booster et se suspend en rayon.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce que contient un booster<\/h3>\n<p>Un booster de l&rsquo;extension contient 10 cartes et une \u00c9nergie de base. On y trouve des cartes Pok\u00e9mon, des cartes Dresseur et, avec un peu de chance, une carte rare, un Pok\u00e9mon-ex ou une carte \u00e0 illustration sp\u00e9ciale. \u00c9quilibre Parfait compte plus de 120 cartes, avec M\u00e9ga-Zygarde-ex en t\u00eate d&rsquo;affiche.<\/p>\n<h3>Plusieurs illustrations au choix<\/h3>\n<p>L&#8217;emballage existe en plusieurs visuels : Miaouss, Zygarde et d&rsquo;autres vedettes de l&rsquo;extension. Certains collectionneurs gardent un booster vide de chaque illustration, d&rsquo;autres choisissent leur booster \u00ab au feeling \u00bb. Il n&rsquo;existe aucune preuve qu&rsquo;un visuel porte plus chance qu&rsquo;un autre, mais personne n&rsquo;a jamais r\u00e9ussi \u00e0 convaincre un fan du contraire.<\/p>\n<h3>Miaouss, l&rsquo;invit\u00e9 surprise<\/h3>\n<p>Au milieu des M\u00e9ga et des l\u00e9gendaires, Miaouss-ex a trouv\u00e9 sa place. Le chat qui parle de la Team Rocket dans le dessin anim\u00e9, celui qui a appris \u00e0 parler pour s\u00e9duire une Miaouss nomm\u00e9e Rosie, m\u00e9rite bien d&rsquo;avoir enfin sa carte de star. Pour une g\u00e9n\u00e9ration enti\u00e8re, c&rsquo;est m\u00eame lui la vraie vedette de la s\u00e9rie.<\/p>\n<h3>Pour qui ?<\/h3>\n<p>Pour les curieux qui veulent voir \u00e0 quoi ressemble l&rsquo;extension, pour les enfants qui d\u00e9couvrent les cartes, et pour tous ceux qui ont gard\u00e9 l&rsquo;habitude de prendre \u00ab juste un booster \u00bb en passant \u00e0 la boutique. Un booster se glisse aussi dans une carte d&rsquo;anniversaire ou une chaussette de No\u00ebl.<\/p>\n<p>Toute l&rsquo;extension est d\u00e9crite sur la page <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/equilibre-parfait\/\"><strong>\u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a>. Pour en ouvrir plus : le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/bundle-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/\"><strong>lot de 6 boosters<\/strong><\/a> ou l&rsquo;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/etb-pokemon-equilibre-parfait-me03\/\"><strong>ETB \u00c9quilibre Parfait<\/strong><\/a>. Tous les boosters \u00e0 l&rsquo;unit\u00e9 sont dans les <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/boosters-pokemon-en-francais\/\"><strong>boosters Pok\u00e9mon en fran\u00e7ais<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h3>\n<p>Booster M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution \u2013 \u00c9quilibre Parfait (ME03) en blister carton, version fran\u00e7aise. Contenu : 10 cartes + 1 \u00c9nergie de base. Illustration de l&#8217;emballage au hasard. EAN : 196214136953.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Miaouss r\u00e9p\u00e8te depuis 1997 que la Team Rocket va gagner. Avec ce booster, il a au moins r\u00e9ussi \u00e0 d\u00e9crocher une carte ex. C&rsquo;est un d\u00e9but.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"690","regular_price":"690","sale_price":"690","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">6,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93746,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03-equilibre-parfait-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/booster-blister-pokemon-me03