:"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/"},{"id":2625,"name":"Tapis Gaming","slug":"tapis-gaming","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/tapis-gaming\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"},{"id":6499,"name":"Ultra Pro","slug":"ultra-pro","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/ultra-pro\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12061,"name":"Tapis de jeu","slug":"tapis-de-jeu"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Tapis de Jeu Pok\u00e9mon Pikachu&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89430","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":9,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89430","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89429,88977,59926,89183"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89430&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89429,"name":"Tapis de Jeu Pok\u00e9mon M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu","slug":"tapis-de-jeu-pokemon-mega-dracaufeu","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tapis-de-jeu-pokemon-mega-dracaufeu\/","sku":"074427167387","short_description":"<p>Le <strong>Tapis M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu<\/strong> Ultra PRO r\u00e9unit M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu Y sur une surface d\u2019environ 61 \u00d7 34 cm, avec tissu doux et dos caoutchouc antid\u00e9rapant.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Tapis M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu : X et Y ont \u00e9vit\u00e9 de choisir<\/h2>\n<p>Le <strong>Tapis M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu<\/strong> Ultra PRO met en sc\u00e8ne <strong>M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu Y<\/strong> sur la m\u00eame surface.<\/p>\n<p>C\u2019est une solution diplomatique assez efficace au vieux probl\u00e8me : \u00ab lequel des deux est le meilleur ? \u00bb<\/p>\n<p>Le tapis r\u00e9pond simplement : les deux prennent la table.<\/p>\n<h2>Une vraie surface de jeu<\/h2>\n<p>Avec environ <strong>61 \u00d7 34 cm<\/strong>, le playmat utilise un dessus en tissu doux qui limite les frottements sur les cartes et un dessous en caoutchouc antid\u00e9rapant qui garde l\u2019ensemble en place.<\/p>\n<p>Il peut servir pour les parties, le tri de cartes, l\u2019ouverture de produits ou comme grand tapis de souris.<\/p>\n<h2>Le bureau change l\u00e9g\u00e8rement d\u2019ambiance<\/h2>\n<p>Un tapis noir reste discret.<\/p>\n<p>Deux M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu c\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te, un peu moins.<\/p>\n<p>Mais si le but \u00e9tait la discr\u00e9tion, choisir Dracaufeu \u00e9tait probablement d\u00e9j\u00e0 une d\u00e9cision assez audacieuse.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marque :<\/strong> Ultra PRO<\/li>\n<li><strong>Licence :<\/strong> Pok\u00e9mon<\/li>\n<li><strong>Illustration :<\/strong> M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X et M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu Y<\/li>\n<li><strong>Dimensions :<\/strong> environ 61 \u00d7 34 cm<\/li>\n<li><strong>Surface :<\/strong> tissu doux<\/li>\n<li><strong>Base :<\/strong> caoutchouc antid\u00e9rapant<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 074427167387<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#x25b6;\u00a0 Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>Le tapis ne r\u00e8gle pas le d\u00e9bat M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu X contre M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu Y. Il offre simplement suffisamment de place pour continuer la discussion confortablement.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2490","regular_price":"2900","sale_price":"2490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"sale-price\"><del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Le prix initial \u00e9tait\u00a0: 29,00&#067;&#072;&#070;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">24,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Le prix actuel est\u00a0: 24,90&#067;&#072;&#070;.<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":89854,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tapis-de-jeu-pokemon-ultra-pro-officiel-mega-dracaufeu-xy.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/tapis-de-jeu-pokemon-ultra-pro-officiel-mega-