":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12061,"name":"Tapis de jeu","slug":"tapis-de-jeu"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Tapis de Jeu Pok\u00e9mon M\u00e9ga-Dracaufeu&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89429","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":11,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89429","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89430,88977,59926,89183"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89429&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89428,"name":"Protection Crystal Box Souple Coffret Pok\u00e9mon 4 Boosters","slug":"protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-pokemon-4-boosters","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-pokemon-4-boosters\/","sku":"5412128690578","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Crystal Box Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong> Phoenix Shield prot\u00e8ge les coffrets standard de 4 boosters avec une coque transparente rigide-souple livr\u00e9e \u00e0 plat. Elle limite poussi\u00e8re et rayures sans transformer chaque coffret en bloc d\u2019acrylique.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Crystal Box Pok\u00e9mon : prot\u00e9ger sans mettre chaque coffret sous vitrine<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Crystal Box Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong> Phoenix Shield est destin\u00e9e aux coffrets Pok\u00e9mon standard de <strong>4 boosters<\/strong>. Elle est livr\u00e9e \u00e0 plat puis se plie pour former une coque transparente autour du produit.<\/p>\n<p>Ce format r\u00e9pond \u00e0 un probl\u00e8me tr\u00e8s concret : parfois, on veut simplement \u00e9viter les rayures et la poussi\u00e8re sans investir dans une protection acrylique lourde pour chaque bo\u00eete.<\/p>\n<h2>Une protection souple qui garde le coffret visible<\/h2>\n<p>Le plastique transparent permet de voir la bo\u00eete et ses promos tout en ajoutant une barri\u00e8re suppl\u00e9mentaire contre les manipulations, la poussi\u00e8re et les frottements sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<p>Elle se monte en quelques secondes et reste beaucoup plus l\u00e9g\u00e8re qu\u2019un bo\u00eetier acrylique.<\/p>\n<h2>Le coffret qu\u2019on \u00ab gardera peut-\u00eatre scell\u00e9 \u00bb<\/h2>\n<p>La Crystal Box est particuli\u00e8rement adapt\u00e9e \u00e0 cette cat\u00e9gorie de produits que l\u2019on ach\u00e8te avec une intention tr\u00e8s pr\u00e9cise :<\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00ab Je pense que celui-l\u00e0, je vais le garder ferm\u00e9. \u00bb<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Le mot important de la phrase est \u00e9videmment \u00ab pense \u00bb.<\/p>\n<p>Au moins, pendant la p\u00e9riode de r\u00e9flexion, la bo\u00eete est prot\u00e9g\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marque :<\/strong> Phoenix Shield<\/li>\n<li><strong>Type :<\/strong> protection transparente pliable<\/li>\n<li><strong>Compatibilit\u00e9 :<\/strong> coffrets Pok\u00e9mon standard 4 boosters<\/li>\n<li><strong>Montage :<\/strong> livr\u00e9e \u00e0 plat, \u00e0 plier<\/li>\n<li><strong>Protection :<\/strong> poussi\u00e8re et rayures, avec filtration UV<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 5412128690578<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#9654;&nbsp; Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>La Crystal Box ne tranche pas la grande question \u00ab ouvrir ou conserver \u00bb. Elle a simplement l\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gance de prot\u00e9ger le coffret pendant que vous changez d\u2019avis plusieurs fois.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"500","regular_price":"500","sale_price":"500","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">5,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93264,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-4-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-4-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-4-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-4-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-crystal-box-souple-coffret-4-boosters-phoenix-shield-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.b