Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12054,"name":"Protection","slug":"protection"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":1,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 1 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique SPC Super Premium Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89426","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89426","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,76404,59926"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88455,90931,89428,89423"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89426&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89425,"name":"Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield","slug":"protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-phoenix-shield","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-phoenix-shield\/","sku":"5412128692107","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Protection Pok\u00e9box Phoenix Shield<\/strong> enferme une Tin Pok\u00e9mon dans un bo\u00eetier acrylique transparent avec fermeture magn\u00e9tique et filtration UV. La Pok\u00e9box reste visible, mais beaucoup moins expos\u00e9e aux rayures et \u00e0 la poussi\u00e8re.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Protection Pok\u00e9box Phoenix Shield : la Tin passe sous cloche<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Protection Pok\u00e9box Phoenix Shield<\/strong> est con\u00e7ue pour les bo\u00eetes m\u00e9talliques Pok\u00e9mon au format Pok\u00e9box. Acrylique transparent, filtration UV et couvercle magn\u00e9tique : l\u2019objectif est de conserver la Tin visible sans la laisser subir directement l\u2019\u00e9tag\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<h2>Les Pok\u00e9box ont un d\u00e9faut assez particulier<\/h2>\n<p>Elles sont en m\u00e9tal. On pourrait donc croire qu\u2019elles n\u2019ont besoin de rien.<\/p>\n<p>Puis on regarde une Pok\u00e9box ancienne avec une petite bosse sur un coin ou une rayure sur le visuel.<\/p>\n<p>Le m\u00e9tal prot\u00e8ge parfaitement les cartes \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur.<\/p>\n<p>Il est beaucoup moins dou\u00e9 pour prot\u00e9ger son propre \u00e9tat de collection.<\/p>\n<h2>Un format calibr\u00e9 pour la Pok\u00e9box<\/h2>\n<p>Les dimensions int\u00e9rieures annonc\u00e9es tournent autour de <strong>118 \u00d7 80 \u00d7 154 mm<\/strong>, adapt\u00e9es aux Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon classiques. Le couvercle magn\u00e9tique facilite la manipulation et le nettoyage.<\/p>\n<p>La transparence permet surtout de garder le visuel totalement visible, ce qui est quand m\u00eame le principe lorsqu\u2019on d\u00e9cide de conserver une Tin scell\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marque :<\/strong> Phoenix Shield<\/li>\n<li><strong>Compatibilit\u00e9 :<\/strong> Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon<\/li>\n<li><strong>Mat\u00e9riau :<\/strong> acrylique transparent<\/li>\n<li><strong>Fermeture :<\/strong> magn\u00e9tique<\/li>\n<li><strong>Filtration UV :<\/strong> \u00e9lev\u00e9e<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 5412128692107<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#x25b6;\u00a0 Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>Une Pok\u00e9box est d\u00e9j\u00e0 une bo\u00eete qui prot\u00e8ge des cartes. Avec une protection acrylique autour, on arrive donc officiellement au stade o\u00f9 la bo\u00eete qui prot\u00e8ge les cartes poss\u00e8de sa propre bo\u00eete. Personne n\u2019a dit que la collection devait rester simple.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2500","regular_price":"2500","sale_price":"2500","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">25,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":90941,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-pokebox-pokemon-zenith-supreme-phoenix-shield.webp 1536w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield","alt":"Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield"}],"categories":[{"id":4294,"name":"Protections acryliques TCG","slug":"protections-acrylique-tcg","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/protections-acrylique-tcg\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6503,"name":"Phoenix Shield","slug":"phoenix-shield","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/phoenix-shield\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12054,"name":"Protection","slug":"protection"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Pok\u00e9box Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89425","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":26,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89425","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88455,90931,89428,89423"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89425&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89424,"name":"Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Display de 8 Minitins Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield","slug":"protection-acrylique-magnetique-display-de-8-minitins-pokemon-phoenix-shield","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-display-de-8-minitins-pokemon-phoenix-shield\/","sku":"5412128690073","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Protection Mini Tins 8<\/strong> Phoenix Shield est dimensionn\u00e9e pour les displays Pok\u00e9mon de 8 Mini Tins. Son acrylique transparent, son couvercle magn\u00e9tique et sa filtration UV sont pens\u00e9s pour conserver l\u2019ensemble scell\u00e9 et visible.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Protection Mini Tins 8 : garder la s\u00e9rie ensemble<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Protection Mini Tins 8<\/strong> Phoenix Shield accueille les displays Pok\u00e9mon de <strong>8 Mini Tins<\/strong>, notamment certains formats de s\u00e9ries sp\u00e9ciales.<\/p>\n<p>Le bo\u00eetier transparent permet de conserver l\u2019ensemble exactement comme il a \u00e9t\u00e9 pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 : huit tins align\u00e9es, le carton du display et surtout aucune d\u00e9cision \u00e0 prendre sur laquelle ouvrir en premier.<\/p>\n<h2>La sym\u00e9trie est une arme dangereuse<\/h2>\n<p>Un display complet a quelque chose de satisfaisant. Huit bo\u00eetes, huit emplacements, tout est \u00e0 sa place.<\/p>\n<p>C\u2019est pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment pour cela que retirer une seule Mini Tin devient beaucoup plus visible que pr\u00e9vu.<\/p>\n<p>Vous n\u2019avez pas ouvert \u00ab une petite bo\u00eete \u00bb.<\/p>\n<p>Vous avez cr\u00e9\u00e9 un trou.<\/p>\n<p>Les collectionneurs sensibles \u00e0 la sym\u00e9trie comprendront imm\u00e9diatement le probl\u00e8me.<\/p>\n<h2>Acrylique, UV et fermeture magn\u00e9tique<\/h2>\n<p>Phoenix Shield annonce une protection contre les UV, la poussi\u00e8re, les rayures et les petits chocs. Le couvercle magn\u00e9tique facilite l\u2019acc\u00e8s et le nettoyage sans masquer le display.<\/p>\n<p>Les dimensions int\u00e9rieures sont d\u2019environ <strong>166 \u00d7 121 \u00d7 130 mm<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marque :<\/strong> Phoenix Shield<\/li>\n<li><strong>Compatibilit\u00e9 :<\/strong> display Pok\u00e9mon 8 Mini Tins<\/li>\n<li><strong>Dimensions int\u00e9rieures :<\/strong> 166 \u00d7 121 \u00d7 130 mm<\/li>\n<li><strong>Fermeture :<\/strong> magn\u00e9tique<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 5412128690073<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#9654;&nbsp; Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>Le bo\u00eetier prot\u00e8ge le display. Il prot\u00e8ge aussi, indirectement, votre capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 ne pas \u00ab juste sortir une Mini Tin pour regarder \u00bb. Ce deuxi\u00e8me effet n\u2019est pas garanti par le fabricant, mais il m\u00e9rite d\u2019\u00eatre signal\u00e9.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3000","regular_price":"3000","sale_price":"3000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">30,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93245,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-8-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Protection acrylique display 8 Mini Tins Phoenix Shield","alt":"Protection acrylique magn\u00e9tique Phoenix Shield pour display de 8 Mini Tins Pok\u00e9mon, chez BDFancomics \u00e0 Nyon"}],"categories":[{"id":4294,"name":"Protections acryliques TCG","slug":"protections-acrylique-tcg","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/protections-acrylique-tcg\/"}],"tags":[],"brands":[{"id":6503,"name":"Phoenix Shield","slug":"phoenix-shield","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/phoenix-shield\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12054,"name":"Protection","slug":"protection"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"En stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Display de 8 Minitins Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=pokemon&#038;per_page=100&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=89424","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":6,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/89424","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=89465,78164,89578,76404"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=88455,90931,89428,89423"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=89424&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":89423,"name":"Protection Acrylique Magn\u00e9tique Display de 10 Minitins Pok\u00e9mon Phoenix Shield","slug":"protection-acrylique-magnetique-display-de-10-minitins-pokemon-phoenix-shield","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/protection-acrylique-magnetique-display-de-10-minitins-pokemon-phoenix-shield\/","sku":"5412128690080","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Protection Mini Tins 10<\/strong> Phoenix Shield accueille un display Pok\u00e9mon complet de 10 Mini Tins. Acrylique transparent, fermeture magn\u00e9tique et filtration UV permettent de l\u2019exposer sans le laisser prendre la poussi\u00e8re.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Protection Mini Tins 10 : quand le display entier m\u00e9rite sa vitrine<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Protection Mini Tins 10<\/strong> Phoenix Shield est con\u00e7ue autour d\u2019un display Pok\u00e9mon complet de <strong>10 Mini Tins<\/strong>. Le bo\u00eetier en acrylique transparent associe fermeture magn\u00e9tique et filtration UV.<\/p>\n<p>Une Mini Tin seule est facile \u00e0 ranger.<\/p>\n<p>Dix Mini Tins parfaitement align\u00e9es dans leur display, beaucoup moins facile \u00e0 ignorer.<\/p>\n<h2>Garder le display complet change tout<\/h2>\n<p>Le principal int\u00e9r\u00eat de cette protection n\u2019est pas seulement d\u2019\u00e9viter la poussi\u00e8re : elle permet de conserver le display dans sa pr\u00e9sentation d\u2019origine.<\/p>\n<p>Chaque tin reste \u00e0 sa place, l\u2019ensemble reste visible et vous n\u2019avez pas besoin de manipuler directement le carton \u00e0 chaque fois que vous voulez le d\u00e9placer ou nettoyer l\u2019\u00e9tag\u00e8re.<\/p>\n<p>Le petit probl\u00e8me arrive lorsqu\u2019une des dix illustrations est votre pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Elle est l\u00e0.<\/p>\n<p>\u00c0 quelques millim\u00e8tres.<\/p>\n<p>Scell\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Avec neuf t\u00e9moins autour d\u2019elle.<\/p>\n<h2>Protection UV et fermeture magn\u00e9tique<\/h2>\n<p>Phoenix Shield utilise un acrylique haute transparence et annonce une forte filtration UV sur sa gamme. La fermeture magn\u00e9tique permet un acc\u00e8s simple sans sacrifier la pr\u00e9sentation.<\/p>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Marque :<\/strong> Phoenix Shield<\/li>\n<li><strong>Compatibilit\u00e9 :<\/strong> display Pok\u00e9mon de 10 Mini Tins<\/li>\n<li><strong>Dimensions int\u00e9rieures :<\/strong> environ 166 \u00d7 143 \u00d7 130 mm<\/li>\n<li><strong>Fermeture :<\/strong> magn\u00e9tique<\/li>\n<li><strong>Protection :<\/strong> UV, poussi\u00e8re et petits chocs<\/li>\n<li><strong>EAN :<\/strong> 5412128690080<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"seo-plus\" style=\"margin-top: 30px\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer;color: #cc0000;font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #cc0000\">&#9654;&nbsp; Lire plus<\/span><\/summary>\n<p>Une Mini Tin se collectionne. Un display complet de dix commence \u00e0 ressembler \u00e0 un objet d\u2019exposition \u00e0 part enti\u00e8re. Et une fois qu\u2019il est proprement enferm\u00e9 dans l\u2019acrylique, la phrase \u00ab j\u2019en ouvre juste une \u00bb devient beaucoup plus engageante qu\u2019avant.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3500","regular_price":"3500","sale_price":"3500","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">35,00<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93244,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-10-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-10-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-10-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-10-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-10-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/protection-acrylique-display-10-mini-tins-phoenix-shield-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uplo